<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Nchane New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Macho</para>
  <para style="toc1">Saaka wù joŋe kune Jiso no Macho gɛ̀ saŋ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Macho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mch</para>
  <para style="mt2">Saaka wù joŋe kune Jiso no</para>
  <para style="mt1">Macho</para>
  <para style="mt2">gɛ̀ saŋ</para>
  <para style="imt">Fiɛɛ fì le a Ŋwa wu Macho wunɛ le</para>
  <para style="ip">Saaka wù joŋe wù le a Ŋwa wu Macho wunɛ le, jɛme lɛ Jiso le Mbvusɛ wu Nyo. gɛ̀ ka. Saaka wù joŋe wunɛ le fɛ bamii bachii ba le yi kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ le. Ŋwa wunɛ duunyi lɛ Jiso le Muh wu N'yɛyɛ wù kooji wù kee ki wu nâjɛ chuule fiɛɛ fì banchi ba Nyo jɛme. N'yɛyɛ wu Jiso wuchii wu a ŋwa wunɛ le, le ba banyɛ yi bikwɛɛ le bitɛŋ. (1) No Jiso gɛ̀ bɛnɛ wu shii yi mbegɛ le wu yɛyi kune bamii ba bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le bvuboo. (2) No Jiso gɛ̀ nya nteefɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ le kune lɛme chì wu gɛ̀ tuŋ bo yu. (3) Baŋgaŋ ba Jiso gɛ̀ ma kune bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe. (4) N'yɛyɛ kune fiɛɛ fì le muh wu ŋgoo wu Jiso. (5) N'yɛyɛ kune no woŋ kfunɛ le wu to wu ka bɛ no bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo lé bvu gê bvu tô</para>
  <para style="iot">Bikwɛɛ bi mwɛɛ mù le a Ŋwa wunɛ le</para>
  <para style="io">1:1–2:23 Kfuu chi Jiso Kletu bɛ no ba gɛ̀ boyɛ wu</para>
  <para style="io">3:1-12 Lɛme chi Joŋ Nlesɛajoo</para>
  <para style="io">3:13–4:11 No ba gɛ̀ leesɛ Jiso a joo bɛ no Sataŋ gɛ̀ moŋ wu</para>
  <para style="io">4:12–18:35 Lɛme chi Jiso gɛ̀ jiɛnyi wù gee Galalee</para>
  <para style="io">19:1–20:34 Jiso ja Galalee, wu gɛɛŋ Yɛlusalɛm</para>
  <para style="io">21:1–27:66 Kimaa ki Jiso ki fɛkimɛsɛ Yɛlusalɛm bɛ mbebe yo le</para>
  <para style="io">28:1-20 No Tada Jiso gɛ̀ bu yi kwe le, wu dunyɛ kikwɛɛ ke bamii be le</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Kfuu chi Jiso Kletu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Manɛ le maŋkuŋ ma bachiji kfuu chi Jiso Kletu: Jiso gɛ̀ bee mwa wu a kfuu chi Nfoŋ Dabi wù gɛ̀ bee mwa wu a kfuu chi Ablaham le. <verse eid="MAT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Ablaham gɛ̀ bee chiji Asik, Asik gɛ̀ bee chiji Yakob, Yakob gɛ̀ bee chiji Juda bɛ booŋ bachiji, <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Juda gɛ̀ bee chiji Bɛlɛ bɛ Sɛla ba bwee bo gɛ̀ bee Tama. Bɛlɛ gɛ̀ bee chiji Ɛsloŋ, Ɛsloŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Laŋ. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Laŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Aminada, Aminada gɛ̀ bee chiji Nasoŋ, Nasoŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Salimoŋ. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salimoŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Boa wù bwee gɛ̀ bee Lahab. Boa gɛ̀ bee chiji Obɛd wù bwee gɛ̀ bee Lu. Obɛd gɛ̀ bee chiji Jɛsi. <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Jɛsi gɛ̀ bee chiji Nfoŋ Dabi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Nfoŋ Dabi gɛ̀ bee chiji Salamoŋ wù bwee gɛ̀ bee kwɛ Ulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Salamoŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Luhobwaŋ, Luhobwaŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Abija, Abija gɛ̀ bee chiji Asa. <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asa gɛ̀ bee chiji Jɛhoshɛfat, Jɛhoshɛfat gɛ̀ bee chiji Jolaŋ, Jolaŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Yosaya. <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Yosaya gɛ̀ bee chiji Jotaŋ, Jotaŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Aha, Aha gɛ̀ bee chiji Hɛsikaya, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hɛsikaya gɛ̀ bee chiji Manase, Manase gɛ̀ bee chiji Amoŋ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baŋwa ba kege bamu kɛme jee chinɛ lɛ, “Amos”.</char></note> Amoŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Yosaya. <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosaya gɛ̀ bee chiji Jɛkonia bɛ booŋ ba bwee. Ba gɛ̀ boyi bo shɛshi shige nyu kife kì bamii ba Babiloŋ gɛ̀ kooyɛ bamii ba Ishwala bo gɛɛŋ bɛ bo woŋ wuboo wù Babiloŋ le.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Ajiŋ ayu, no bo gɛ̀ kooyɛ bamii ba Ishwala bo gɛɛŋ bɛ bo Babiloŋ, Jɛkonia gɛ̀ bee chiji Shalta, Shalta gɛ̀ bee chiji Sɛlubabe, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Sɛlubabe gɛ̀ bee chiji Abiud, Abiud gɛ̀ bee chiji Ɛliakim, Ɛliakim gɛ̀ bee chiji Aso, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Aso gɛ̀ bee chiji Sadok, Sadok gɛ̀ bee chiji Akim, Akim gɛ̀ bee chiji Ɛliud, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Ɛliud gɛ̀ bee chiji Ɛlisa, Ɛlisa gɛ̀ bee chiji Mataŋ, Mataŋ gɛ̀ bee chiji Yakob. <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakob gɛ̀ bee chiji Yosɛf wù juma Mɛɛle, Mɛɛle nyu wu wù gɛ̀ boyɛ Jiso wù ba tɛŋe lɛ Kletu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Noo, bachiji kfuu chi Jiso banɛ le yuufe ncho banɛh kɛge yi Ablaham le, too bude yi Nfoŋ Dabi le, ka nyu yuufe ncho banɛh kɛge yi Nfoŋ Dabi le too bude sege ba gɛ̀ kooyɛ bamii ba Ishwala ba gɛɛŋ bɛ bo Babiloŋ. Kɛge sege ba gɛ̀ kooyɛ bamii ba Ishwala too bude sege ba gɛ̀ boyɛ Kletu, bachiji kfuu chiboo tɛ nyu yuufe ncho banɛh.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kune no boyɛ chi Jiso gɛ̀ jiɛnyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Boyɛ chi Jiso Kletu gɛ̀ jiɛnyi a je yinɛ le. Bwee wù Mɛɛle gɛ̀ bee ba seesɛ wa lɛ wu lé wu gê wu nyûme kwɛ Yosɛf. Fɛ bo taashɛ bvuguu, fi gɛ̀ ja fi bu lɛ wu le wa bɛ fwe a bvuŋga bvu Kiyo ki Yuude le. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>No fi gɛ̀ kooshɛ noo, Yosɛf wù jwɛɛŋ, no wù gɛ̀ bee muh wù chaaŋ wu koŋe gɛ ki wu chôosɛ wu gɛ, wu mo wu yɛŋ lɛ wu lé wu gâsɛ bɛ wu nyu ajiŋ ajiŋ. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>No wu gɛ̀ baaŋ wu kwaji ki wu gê noo, fi kooshɛ lɛ nchɛndaa wu Tada gɛ̀ ja wu to fɛ wu le a kifilɛ le sege wu gɛ̀ lefe wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Yosɛf, mwa wù a kfuu chi Nfoŋ Dabi le, keefɛ wo fâŋ ki wo jô Mɛɛle bwee yeh wo le gɛ, nje fwe chinɛ chi wu le bɛ chi wù kɛme chi a bvuŋga bvu Kiyo ki Yuude le. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Wu lé wu gê wu boo mwa wu jwɛŋsɛ wo chû jee che lɛ Jiso,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jee chi Jiso chinɛ le lɛ, “Tada bvuuse lo”</char></note> nje wu lé wu gê wu bvûsɛ bamii be yi bimbefɛ biboo le.” <verse eid="MAT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Mwɛɛ munɛ munchii gɛ̀ kooshɛ ki fi to fi kojɛ no Tada gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wa jwe wu muh we wu tuŋ le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, mwa wuchile wumu lé wu gê wu nyu bɛ fwe, wu boo mwa wu jwɛŋsɛ ba tɛ̂ŋe wu lɛ Ɛmaniwe.” Jee chinɛ le lɛ, “Nyo le bɛ bee.” <verse eid="MAT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>No kifilɛ kɛɛ gɛ̀ lanɛ Yosɛf noo, wu gɛ̀ kaŋsɛ wu mo wu ge gɛh no nchɛndaa wu Tada gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wu le. Wu gɛ̀ be wu jo Mɛɛle kwɛɛ le, <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>geenɛ gɛ wu gɛ chee bɛ wu njɛ no muh bɛ kwɛɛ to bo chee gɛ. Bɛ wu chee noo gɛɛŋ bu no Mɛɛle gɛ̀ jiɛnyɛ fɛ wu to wu boo. Yosɛf mo wu chu jee chi mwa wuyu lɛ Jiso.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Babvufee gɛɛŋ ki bo buuŋ Jiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Ba gɛ̀ boyi Jiso ntɛ wù Bɛtɛhɛm le a kimbe ki woŋ ki Judia le. Gɛ̀ bee kife kiyu le Hɛlod nyu Nfoŋ wu Judia. Fi kooshɛ lɛ babvufee bamu gɛ̀ bee bo ja woŋ wumu le kimbe kì juu saane yo le, bo to Yɛlusalɛm bo biide lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>“Nfoŋ wu Bajuu wù ba boyi wɛɛ le faaŋ? Bee biide nɛ nje bee le be yɛŋ joŋ ye le a kimbe kì juu saane yo le, bee mo be ja bee too ki be yuusɛ wu.” <verse eid="MAT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Nfoŋ Hɛlod doo wu yu saaka wunɛ noo wu shiŋshɛ fitele fie, wu shiŋshɛ mo mu bamii ba Yɛlusalɛm bachii. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Wu tɛɛŋ bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bachii bɛ bamii bachii ba duunyi banchi ba Nyo, bamii baa taashɛ. Wu biih bo le laa fɛ ba gɛ̀ bee ki ba boo Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka, le faane la? <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Bochvuu lɛ, “Ba gɛ̀ bee boo wu ntɛ wù Bɛtɛhɛm le wu kimbe ki Judia le. Finɛ fiɛɛ le no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo gɛ̀ saŋ lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘Wo wù Bɛtɛhɛm wu woŋ wu Juda le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">keefɛ wo kwâji lɛ wo le fintɛ fì shige baaŋ woŋ wu Juda le gɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">wo kêe lɛ muh lé wu gê wu bu ntɛ wunɛ le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">wu lé wu gê wu sage bamii baŋ ba Ishwala.’”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Nfoŋ Hɛlod mo wu tɛɛŋ tɛ babvufee baa ajiŋ ajiŋ wu biih ki wu yû a bo le chuule kife ki joŋ yiyu gɛ̀ bu. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>No wu yu wu mo wu tuŋ bo Bɛtɛhɛm wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ tâa bɛŋ gôoŋ mwa wuyu chuule. Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gooŋ bɛŋ yɛŋ, bɛŋ kaasɛ bɛŋ to bɛŋ sɛ̂ɛŋ mɛne, wu lɛ taŋlo ŋgɛɛŋ tɛ n'yuusɛ wu.” <verse eid="MAT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Bamii bayu yu no Nfoŋ jɛmɛ noo, bo mo bo bu bo gɛɛne ŋgɛnɛ wuboo. Lɛ bo doo bo gɛɛŋ, fi kooshɛ lɛ joŋ yì bo gɛ̀ yɛŋ a kimbe kì juu saane yo yɛɛ le ka yi yɛnɛ yi tu yi jiɛnyi yi gɛɛne bo fwe yi duunyi bo je. Yi gɛɛŋ nɛ, yi gɛɛŋ yi bu fɛ mwa wuyu gɛ̀ bee fo, yi mo yi lɛɛŋ. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>No bo yɛŋ joŋ yiyu le noo, bo yu njoŋ baaŋ, ye tu yi joŋe bo. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Bo gɛɛŋ bo lee yeh yi mwa gɛ̀ bee yu le, bo yɛŋ mwa bɛ bwee wù Mɛɛle le, bo mo bo gwe a mwa wuyu jii bo yuusɛ wu. No bo yuuse bo gwenyɛ bikɛɛ biboo bo bvusɛ mwɛɛ muboo mu n'yuusɛ nfoŋ, bo nya wu le. Mwɛɛ munɛ gɛ̀ bee kichwa ki bige kì yɛɛde, bɛ kfuu chi jiiŋ chimi ba tɛŋe lɛ flaŋkiŋsɛŋ, mo kfuu chi mɛɛ ma yefɛ mamu ba tɛŋe lɛ mɛɛl.<figure style="fig" alt="Frankincense" file="hk00115c.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 2:11" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="2:11">Flaŋkinsɛŋ, kfuu chi jiiŋ chimi</figure> <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Nyo chiisɛ lo bo le a kifilɛ le lɛ keefɛ bo ka bo tu jiŋ bo gɛɛŋ bo yɛŋ Nfoŋ Hɛlod le gɛ. Bo mo bo tu jiŋ woŋ wuboo le a je yimi le yeye.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosɛf jo mwa bɛ bo saŋ bo gɛɛŋ Ijib</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>No babvufee baa gɛ̀ ja wa bo gɛɛŋ, fi kooshɛ lɛ nchɛndaa wu Tada gɛ̀ ja wu to fɛ Yosɛf le a kifilɛ le wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Ja we wo jo mwa bɛ bwee bena bo fɛɛ bɛŋ gɛɛŋ woŋ wu Ijib le, bɛŋ nyume yo gɛɛŋ bu kife ki nle ŋge ndu lɛ bɛŋ kaasɛ. Njɛme nɛ nje Nfoŋ Hɛlod goone je ki wu yûuyɛ mwa wunɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Yosɛf mo wu ja we, wu jo mwa bɛ bwee antaŋ bo ja bo gɛɛŋ Ijib, <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>bo tu bo nyu yo gɛɛŋ bu kife ki Nfoŋ Hɛlod gɛ̀ lɛsɛ le. Fi gɛ̀ kooshɛ noo ki fi gê fi to fi kojɛ no Nyo gɛ̀ jɛmɛ jwe wu muh tuŋ we le lɛ, “Nle ntɛɛŋ mwa yaŋ wu bu woŋ wu Ijib le.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nfoŋ Hɛlod yuuyɛ booŋ Bɛtɛhɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Hɛlod gɛ̀ doo wu yɛŋ lɛ babvufee baa le bo lɛɛ bɛ wu, fi fuuŋsɛ wu baaŋ. Wu mo wu tuŋ bamii lɛ bo gɛɛŋ Bɛtɛhɛm mo bimbe bi mbebe yo le bichii, bo yuuyɛ booŋ ba bilɛŋsɛ ba le kɛge biluŋ bifɛɛ tuu jiŋ. Wu gɛ̀ nya biluŋ binɛ wu bii no wu gɛ̀ bilɛ babvufee baa le wu yu chuule kife kì bo gɛ̀ yɛŋ joŋ yɛɛ le. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Bo gɛɛŋ bo yuuyɛ booŋ banɛ noo, fi mo fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Yɛlimia gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wa lɛ,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Bo le bo yu kitada ntɛ wù Lama le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">muh jaŋe kwe, wu beede wu fuude ye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Le Lashɛ wu beede booŋ be.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">Bo chiise wu bo chiise sɛŋ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">nje booŋ be baaŋ gɛ yu gɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba Yosɛf ja Ijib bo kaasɛ bo tu jiŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Nfoŋ Hɛlod gɛ̀ doo wu lɛsɛ, fi kooshɛ lɛ Nchɛndaa wu Tada gɛ̀ bu fɛ Yosɛf le a kifilɛ le woŋ wù Ijib le, wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>“Ja we, wo jo mwa bɛ bwee bena bo kaasɛ bɛŋ tu jiŋ woŋ wù Ishwala le, nje bo baa bò gɛ̀ goone ki bo jo kinche ki mwa wunɛ le bo kweeyɛ wa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Noo, Yosɛf mo wu ja we wu jo mwa bɛ bwee bɛ bo tuu jiŋ woŋ wù Ishwala le. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Geenɛ, wu gɛ̀ doo wu to, wu yu lɛ mwa Nfoŋ Hɛlod wù Akɛliu le wu ji kinta ki chiji Judia, wu tu wu sage, wu mo wu faŋ ki wu gɛ̂ɛŋ yo. Bo ka bo kajɛ wu a kifilɛ le lɛ keefɛ wu gɛ̂ɛŋ yo gɛ. Wu mo wu bɛɛŋ wu gɛɛŋ nyu kimbe ki woŋ kì Galalee le, <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>wu gɛɛŋ wu tu wu chee ntɛ wu ba tɛŋe lɛ Nasalɛ le. Fi gɛ̀ kooshi noo ki fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wa lɛ, “Bo lé bo gê bo tɛŋe wu lɛ muh wu Nasalɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ wu Joŋ Nlesɛajoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliku 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joŋ 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Gɛ̀ bee kife kɛɛ le, Joŋ Nlesɛajoo ja wu bunɛ wu gɛɛŋ kwa kimbe ki woŋ kì Judia le wu tu wu feeji bamii le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>“Bɛŋ kusɛ muntele mwɛna, nje bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le wa mbebe le.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Joŋ wunɛ le muh wù Yosaya wù muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo gɛ̀ jɛme kune wu sege wu gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">“Jɛ yi muh jaŋe nchvuuŋ lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Ba sêesɛ je yi Tada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">ba nâjɛ yi nyû chaaŋ.’”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Joŋ gɛ̀ jiide njú yì ba kɛnyɛ bɛ yvú yi nyaŋ yimi yì ba tɛŋe lɛ kamɛɛ, wu kaane kicha chiŋ ba kɛnyɛ bɛ je yi nyaŋ, mwɛɛ mwe munjile gɛ̀ bee chuma bɛ bvutu bvu nchvuuŋ. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>No wu gɛ̀ feeji noo, bamii tu bo bude Yɛlusalɛm bɛ bantɛ le bachii ba Judia mo bimbe bi mbebe Joo yì Jodaŋ le bichii, bo gɛɛne fɛ wu le. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>No bo gɛɛne noo bo sɛŋe bimbefɛ biboo, wu mo wu leese bo a Joo yì Jodaŋ le.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Geenɛ, wu gɛ̀ doo wu yɛŋ Bafalashii bɛ Basadushii bamu le wesee bo too lɛ wu leesɛ bo a joo, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, “Kiŋgogɛ ki yó lɛ, teefe yɛɛŋ bɛŋ lɛ bɛŋ lêge shɛ́ŋ yi Nyo yì bɛɛne wu yì wu lé wu gê wu dûnyɛ bɛŋ le, fɛ bɛŋ too nɛ? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Bɛŋ gêe mwɛɛ mù duunyi lɛ bɛŋ le bɛŋ kusɛ wa muntele mwɛna. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Keefɛ bɛŋ mo bɛŋ dûu gɛh fɛ bikwɛɛ biɛna le lɛ Ablaham le chiji wene gɛ. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ taŋlo Nyo fiisɛ ata kanɛ wo tu booŋ ba Ablaham. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Bɛŋ kêe lɛ ba le ba gɛɛ wa tɛmɛ fɛ binyi bi bite le. Kite kichii kì baaŋ yuŋ gɛ muntaŋ mù njoŋe gɛ, tu ba lé ba gwô nɛ ba lee ba gɛɛŋ yi gɛŋ le, ba toŋ lo. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Nleese bɛŋ a joo nje bɛŋ le bɛŋ kusɛ wa muntele mwɛna. Geenɛ muh wù too a mɛ jiŋ kuge wu fede mɛ. Jé ye, gɛ ŋkooji ki ntuu gɛ. Wu lé wu gê wu leese fie bɛŋ nyu chiaaŋ yi Kiyo ki Yuude le, mo yi ŋgu le. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Wu kɛme fiɛɛ fie abo fì wu fɛɛde agiŋ yu, wu lé wu yɛ̂ɛsɛ fɛ wu fɛ̂ɛde, wu bânyɛ agiŋ wu gɛ̂ɛ a ŋwaŋ le, wu mo wu kôo munyi wu toŋ bɛ ŋgu wu fiee wu jime gɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Joŋ leesɛ Jiso a joo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliku 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>No Joŋ gɛ̀ leese bamii a joo noo, Jiso mo wu ja kimbe ki woŋ kì Galalee le wu to fɛ Joo yì Jodaŋ le lɛ Joŋ leesɛ tɛ wu a joo. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Geenɛ Joŋ tu wu faŋe wu duu lɛ, “Le wo wù be kɛme ki wo lêesɛ mɛ a joo, wo katu too fɛ mɛne nɛ nɛɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Chînɛ fi nyume noo mɛɛse! Le yi yinɛ je le yì besa wo lé be gê fiɛɛ fichii fi nyu chaaŋ a Nyo jii.”</char> Noo, Joŋ mo wu bɛɛŋ, wu leesɛ Jiso a joo. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Gɛh no Jiso gɛ̀ bude a joo, kibvulɛ gwenyɛ ye, Kiyo ki Nyo shii ki to ye ye le fiɛɛnɛ kibɛmbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ, jɛ gɛ̀ jɛmɛ fɛwe lɛ, “Wunɛ le Mwa yaŋ. Wu le fitele fiaŋ. N'yuge njoŋ bɛ wu baaŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Debele tu wu mone Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliku 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Kiyo ki Yuude mo ki ja ki jo Jiso ki gɛɛŋ bɛ wu kwa lɛ debele moŋ wu. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Wu gɛɛŋ wù nyu yo wu shee wu too wu chee, wu jii gɛ fiɛɛ gɛ, yi aju le mbaanyɛ. Ajiŋ ayu jɛŋ ja yi yuu wu. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Wu wɛɛ wù mone bamii mo wu to wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Wo nɛ le Mwa Nyo, wo dû ata kanɛ tu bantu ba blɛd.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ba le ba saŋ lɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">
    <char style="wj">‘Gɛ muh chee gɛh nje mwɛɛ munjile maa gɛ.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:4">
    <char style="wj">Muh chee tɛ nje jɛ yichii yì bude jwe wù Nyo le.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Noo, Sataŋ mo wu jo wu, wu gɛɛŋ bɛ wu a kinlaantɛŋ kì Yɛlusalɛm le, wu leesɛ wu fɛ kigo ki yeh yi kintanyɛ le, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Wo nɛ le Mwa Nyo, wo selɛ fɛkuu, nje fi le ba saŋ lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Nyo lé wu dû banchɛndaa be le lɛ bo chîɛɛŋ wo.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 4:6">Fi ka nyu ba saŋ lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Bo lé bo gê bo kaŋ lo wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">lɛ keefɛ wo kfuuŋ kikaa yi tɛdɛ le gɛ.’”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ <char style="wj">“Ba le ba saŋ lɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:7">
    <char style="wj">‘Keefɛ wo mône Tada wù Nyo wo gɛ.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Debele ka wu jo Jiso fo, wu gɛɛŋ nyu yi kikwɛɛ ki mbegɛ wumu wu ndefe fɛwe wesee le, wu mo wu chunyɛ bituŋ bi yi kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ le bichii bɛ bvukugɛ bvuyu bvuchii. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>No wu chunyi noo wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Nlé nnyâ mwɛɛ munɛ munchii wo le, fɛ wo nɛ le wo gwe a mɛ jii wo ŋgvuuŋ mɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛnɛ yaga Sataŋ! Ba le ba saŋ lɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="wj">‘Wo ŋgvûune Tada wù Nyo wo,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="wj">wo lɛ̂ne nyu wu le maa.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Noo debele mo wu chinɛ Jiso le, wu gɛɛŋ. Fi kooshɛ lɛ banchɛndaa ba Nyo gɛ̀ ja bo to bo jiiŋe fɛ wu le.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso kɛ lɛme che Galalee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliku 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu yu lɛ ba le ba koo Joŋ Nlesɛajoo ba leesɛ wu yeh yi ncha le, wu mo wu ja wu kaasɛ wu tu jiŋ kimbe kì Galalee le. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Wu gɛɛŋ wu bu Nasalɛ, wu ja yo wu gɛɛŋ wu tu wu chee a kilaantɛŋ kì Kafanahum le. Kilaantɛŋ kinɛ gɛ̀ bee mbebe Mamasi wù Galalee le mo mbebe bimbe bi bamii ba Sɛbuluŋ bɛ ba Naftali le. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Finɛ fiɛɛ gɛ̀ kooshi nɛ lɛ fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Yosaya gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wa lɛ,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Kimbe kì Sɛbuluŋ bɛ kì Naftali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">bì le mbebe mamasi le Joo yì Jodaŋ le wuŋ kwege,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">nshɛŋ yi Galalee yì bamii ba le gɛ Bajuu gɛ,<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>bamii ba chi shee bo chee kijibɛ le,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">le bo yɛŋ wa n'yuu wù baaŋ le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">Juu le chi saaŋ wa fɛ bamii banɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">ba chi shee bo chee gwɛŋ wu kijibɛ ki kwe le.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Kɛge kife kɛɛ le, Jiso mo wu kɛ wu feeji bamii le wu jɛme lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kûsɛ muntele mwɛna, nje bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le wa mbebe le!”</char><verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso tɛɛŋ bamii banɛh lɛ bo nyû booŋ be ba ŋgoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliku 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu jiɛnyi mbebe Mamasi wù Galalee le, wu yɛŋ bamii bamu le bafɛɛ, nyu muh bɛ mwa bwee. Bamii banɛ gɛ̀ bee Samoŋ wù ba gɛ̀ tɛŋe lɛ Bita, bɛ mwa bwee wù Andulu, bo nooŋ gii a mamasi le, no lɛme chiboo gɛ̀ bee bíɛŋ yi kolɛ. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ bîi mɛne nlé nfɛ̂ bɛŋ bɛŋ koode wa nyume bamii!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Kimimia bo mo bo chinɛ gii yiboo le bo bii wu le. <verse eid="MAT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Jiso gɛ̀ doo wu ja fo wu kɛŋsɛ, wu ka wu yɛŋ bamii bamu le bafɛɛ nyu gɛh muh bɛ mwa bwee. Bamii banɛ gɛ̀ bee Jɛm bɛ mwa bwee wù Joŋ ba gɛ̀ bee booŋ ba Jɛbɛdi, bo nyu a ŋguh le bɛ chiji bo wù Jɛbɛdi bo chvuushi gii. Wu tɛɛŋ tɛ bo. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Kimimia bo mo bo chinɛ ŋguh le bɛ chiji bo, bo bii wu le.<figure style="fig" alt="Boat" file="hk00208c.tif" size="span" loc="Mch 4:21-22" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="4:22">Ŋgu</figure><verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso tu wu yɛyi bamii wu ka fɛde ba binchɛŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu jiɛnyi kimbe kì Galalee le kichii wu yɛyi bamii yéh yi buunɛ yiboo le wu feeji tɛ saaka wù joŋe kune bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo. Wu ka fɛde binchɛŋ bichii mo goŋ yichii yi bamii le. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Noo, saaka kune wu saaŋe wu gɛɛŋ woŋ wù Silia le wuchii. Bamii mo bo too bɛ bamii bachii ba gɛ̀ chɛne mo ba gɛ̀ bee yi manluŋ le fɛ wu le, kɛnɛ le ba banchɛndaa ba debele njiŋse bɛ bo, kɛnɛ bo gwee kika, kɛnɛ ba kwe wa kimbe kimimia. Bo too bɛ bo noo wu fɛde bo bachii. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Mo faaŋ fɛ wu gɛ̀ gɛɛne fo binchvu bi bamii bì baaŋ bi kfuune bi bii a wu jiŋ. Bamii banɛ gɛ̀ jade kimbe ki woŋ kì Galalee le, bamu jade a Bilaantɛŋ bi Yuufe le, bamu Yɛlusalɛm mo bantɛ ba Judia ba bamu le. Bamu jade a Joo yì Jodaŋ le wuŋ kwege.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Jiso gɛ̀ doo wu yɛŋ kinchvu ki bamii le noo, wu mo wu ja wu bɛɛŋ wu gɛɛŋ wu shii yi mbegɛ le, booŋ be ba ŋgoo banyɛ bo to mbebe ye le. <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Wu mo wu kɛ wu yɛyi bo wu duu lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/><char style="wj">“Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba kee lɛ bo fuude yi kimbe ki Nyo le, nje bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le bvuboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba beede le, nje Nyo lé wu gê wu chiisɛ bo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba jode bikwɛɛ biboo fɛkuu, nje bo lé bo gê bo ji kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba jɛŋ yuu bo le, kindoŋ yune bo kune kinche ki chaaŋ, nje Nyo lé wu gê bo fuu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba koode yii fɛ bamu le, nje Nyo lé wu gê wu koo tɛ yii fɛ bo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba kɛme muntele mu yuude le, nje ba lé ba tɛ̂ŋe bo lɛ booŋ ba Nyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba too bɛ nyiɛgee le nje Nyo lé wu tɛ̂ŋe bo lɛ booŋ be.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba bo boone bikaa a bo jiŋ nje bo chee kinche ki chaaŋ, nje bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le bvuboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le kena, sege bamii naanyi bɛŋ, bo boone bikaa a bɛŋ jiŋ, bo jɛme kfuu chi mwɛɛ mù mbefe munchii kune bɛŋ yi achiji le, nje bɛŋ le bamii baŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/><char style="wj">Fi doo fi kooshi noo bɛŋ mo bɛŋ lâŋeye, nje maajɛ wene wu kuge le woŋ wù fɛwe le. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ, le gɛh noo no bamii gɛ̀ boone bikaa ajiŋ a bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo ba gɛ̀ to fwe a bɛŋ le.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛŋ le ŋka bɛ n'yuu wu yi woŋ kfunɛ le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliku 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Le bɛŋ ba le ŋka yi yi nshɛŋ yinɛ le. Geenɛ ŋka ja lo yi chii, ba ka ba ge nɛɛ bɛ yi fɛ yi ka yi kaasɛ yi jɛŋɛ? Gɛ taŋlo ba ka ba ge fiɛɛ fì joŋe bɛ yi gɛ fede lɛ ba noŋ lo bamii fede bo jiɛnyi bɛ bikaa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/><char style="wj">Le bɛŋ tɛ ba le n'yuu wu yi woŋ kfunɛ le. Gɛ kilaantɛŋ kì ba jonɛ yi mbegɛ le, to ki nyiile gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/><char style="wj">Gɛ muh to wu chu tɛ kin'yesɛ wu ka wu jo ŋkaa wu kfuusɛ yu gɛ. Wu to wu tome nyume yi fiɛɛ fì ba toome kin'yesɛ fo, ki mo ki yɛ̂ne muh wuchii wù le yeh le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/><char style="wj">Le gɛh tɛ yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no n'yuu wene kɛme ki wu bâaŋ a bamii jii, lɛ bo yɛde lɛme chena chì joŋe le bo nyaa mbɛɛŋsɛ Chiji wene wù le fɛwe le.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune banchi ba Musɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>
    <char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ kwâji lɛ nto ki nchîijɛ mwɛɛ mù le a Ŋwa wu banchi ba Musɛ le gɛ, mo mù le a Baŋwa bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo le gɛ. Nto ki ŋge mu kojɛ lo. Gɛ nto ki nchiijɛ lo gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ gɛɛŋ bu no kibvulɛ bɛ nshɛŋ lé ki tô ki ka, gɛ fijise fi ŋwa a Ŋwa wu banchi le mo fi shige nɛɛ, nyume fi yu fi fe kuu njɛ fi kojɛ no fi chuunyi sɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ nɛ le yɛɛŋ wù bwɛɛdɛ nchi wumu a banchi banɛ le, wuwɛɛ nchi mo nyu wù shige nɛɛ lɛ, wu tu wu yɛyi bamii lɛ bo bwɛ̂ɛyi tɛ noo, tu mwɛdɛ lé wu gê wù nyu muh wù shige antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe. Geenɛ muh wù gɛɛde banchi banɛ, wu ka yɛyi tɛ bamii lɛ bo gɛ̂ɛde, tu mwɛdɛ lé wu gê wù nyu muh wù baaŋ antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/><char style="wj">Noo, nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ, nɛ gee chena chì chaaŋ fede gɛ chi bamii ba duunyi banchi ba Nyo gɛ, mo chi Bafalashii lɛ, bɛŋ gɛ yu bɛŋ lee fɛ bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune shɛ́ŋ yì toonyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̀ yu wa ba duu bamii ba fweele le lɛ, ‘Keefɛ wo yûuyɛ muh gɛ! Nɛ muh yuuyi lo muh, tu wù kɛme nsa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ muh wuchii wù toonyi shɛ́ŋ bɛ mwa bwee, lé wù kɛ̂me tɛ nsa. Muh naŋ mwa bwee, wu kêe lɛ wu lé wu gê wu lɛɛŋ fwe a bamii ba sage bansa. Muh tɛŋe mwa bwee lɛ, ‘Kiyuŋ’ wu kee lɛ wu lé wu lêe ŋgu wù baaŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ, wo nɛ lɛme ki wo nyâ nnya yo fɛ kitana ki kintanyɛ le, wo kwajɛ lɛ mwa bwoo kɛme wo fɛ shɛŋ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/><char style="wj">wo chinɛ nya yo le mbebe kitana ki kintanyɛ le, wo gɛɛŋ bena wu ya bɛŋ tu jwe wu mumwaa, fɛ wo kaasɛ wo to wo nya nnya yo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/><char style="wj">Muh nɛ jo lo wo wu gɛɛne bɛ wo yeh yi nsa le, wo moŋ bena wu yaŋsɛ bɛŋ seesɛ baaŋ a je, fɛ wu nya wo chiaaŋ yi muh wù sage bansa le, wu feese wo chiaaŋ yi nchi le ba faa wo yeh yi ncha le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe wo nchiɛɛŋ lɛ gɛ taŋlo wo bu yu njɛ wo mɛsɛ wo laŋɛ finini fichii fì ba goone sɛŋ gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune kinjaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̀ yu wa ba duu lɛ, ‘Keefɛ wo jâŋ kwɛ muh gɛ!’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ, muh wuchii wù jiiŋe kwɛse wù kɛme ŋkwajɛ wu kinjaŋ fɛ wu le, tu wu le wu jaŋ wa wu fɛ fitele le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/><char style="wj">Nɛ jise chuŋ chì nchiɛɛŋ gee wo gee kimbefɛ, wo bvusɛ jise chiyu wo noŋ. Fi joŋe lɛ wo lɛsɛ kimbe kuŋ ki ye kimimia, fede fɛ ba ge ba noŋ ye yo yichii ŋgu wù baaŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/><char style="wj">Kibo kuŋ kinchiɛɛŋ nɛ gee tɛ wo gee kimbefɛ, wo suunɛ kibo kiyu wo noŋ. Fi joŋe lɛ wo lɛsɛ kimbe kuŋ ki ye kimimia, fede fɛ ye yo yichii gɛɛŋ ŋgu wù baaŋ le.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune ki muh kuŋ bɛ kwɛse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliku 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>
    <char style="wj">Ba gɛ̀ jɛmɛ tɛ lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh kuŋ lo bɛ kwɛɛ, tu wù kɛme ki wu sâŋ ŋwa wu nya kwɛse wuyu le, wù duunyi lɛ gɛ wu baaŋ kwɛɛ gɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ, muh kuŋ lo bɛ kwɛɛ, nyume gɛ lɛ kwɛse wuyu le wu ge kinjaŋ gɛ, tu wu le wu ge lɛ wu gɛɛŋ wu tu kwɛse wu kinjikuu. Muh jo kwɛse wù bu a jwɛŋsɛ yeh wu gɛɛ a wu yeh, tu wu le wu jo kwɛ muh.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune ki muh jɛmɛ fiɛɛ wu kaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̀ yu wa tɛ no ba gɛ̀ jɛme bamii ba fweele le lɛ, ‘Sege wo jɛmɛ fiɛɛ wo kaŋ, keefɛ wo nyume njɛ wo ge fi sɛŋ gɛ. Wo kɛme ki wo gê fiɛɛ fì wo le wo jɛmɛ wo kaŋ a Tada fwe lɛ wo lé wo gê.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ, keefɛ muh doo wu jɛme fiɛɛ wu kaŋ lo gɛ. Keefɛ wo kâŋ a jee chi fɛwe le gɛ, nje fɛwe le kala wu Nyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ wo kâŋ nshɛŋ gɛ, nje nshɛŋ le kitege ki bikaa bi Nyo. Keefɛ wo kâŋ Yɛlusalɛm gɛ, nje Yɛlusalɛm le kilaantɛŋ ki Nfoŋ wù baaŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ wo kaŋ kikwɛɛ kuŋ gɛ, nje gɛ wo taŋlo wo fɛ yvu yimimia yi tu chibvuu kɛnɛ yi yiide gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/><char style="wj">Muh nɛ le wu bɛɛŋ fiɛɛ lɛ ‘Ɛɛŋ’, fi kojɛ noo. Wu tuŋ lɛ, ‘Aay’, fi kojɛ noo. Nɛ wu ka tale lo fiɛɛ fo, tu fiɛɛ fiyu ja fɛ muh wu kimbefɛ wɛɛ le.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune nchvusɛ kichvusɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29">Luka 6:29</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:30">30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̀ yu wa tɛ lɛ ba gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh bvuse jise chi muh, ba bvusɛ tɛ che. Muh baa kige ki muh, ba baa tɛ ke.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ, keefɛ muh nyîide fiɛɛ bɛ muh wù befe gɛ. Nɛ muh le wu suŋ kinlaŋɛ kuŋ kinchiɛɛŋ, wo kaasɛ kiŋkoŋo wu mɛsɛ wu suŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/><char style="wj">Muh some wo lɛ wu fi kikuŋ kuŋ kì antɛŋ, wo mɛsɛ wo nya mo kì akfuuŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/><char style="wj">Muh kane wo lɛ wo jiɛnyɛ wo gɛɛŋ ma wu mumwaa, wo jiɛnyɛ wo bu mo bama bafɛɛ bena wu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/><char style="wj">Muh lɛgɛ fiɛɛ a wo le, wo nya wu yu. Muh foo fiɛɛ a wo le, keefɛ wo fâŋ ki wo nyâ gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune no muh gêe bɛ muh we wu kimbanɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̀ yu wa lɛ ba gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Wo kôŋe muh wù le mbebe yo le wo bâne muh wo wu kimbanɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, ntu njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ, bɛŋ kôŋe bamii bena ba kimbanɛ, bɛŋ bûune fɛ ba boone bikaa a bɛŋ jiŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/><char style="wj">Noo, bɛŋ mo bɛŋ nyu booŋ ba Chiji wene wù le fɛwe. Le wu wù gee juu saane fɛ bamii ba befe le mo fɛ ba joŋe le. Wu gee tɛ jaŋ too fɛ bamii ba gee mwɛɛ mù chaaŋ le, mo fɛ bamii ba befe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ bɛŋ nɛ koŋe gɛh nyu bamii ba koŋe bɛŋ, maajɛ wuyu nyume la fɛ bɛŋ le? Gɛ bamii ba koode ŋwa gee tɛ noo gɛ?</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamii ba fii kwa ba gɛ̀ yɛde lɛ le bamii ba befe.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ nɛ yɛɛse gɛh nyu booŋ ba bwee bena le, tu fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ gee fì bamii bamu gee gɛ le la? Gɛ bamii ba befe gee gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no bɛŋ gee gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ bɛŋ kɛme ki bɛŋ jôŋe bɛŋ gɛɛne bɛŋ mɛɛse no Chiji wene wu fɛwe joŋe wu gɛɛne wu mɛɛse.”</char><verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune nnya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yɛ̂ne lɛ keefɛ bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gee mwɛɛ mù njoŋe, bɛŋ gêe a bamii fwe ki bo yɛ̂ne gɛ. Nɛ bɛŋ gee noo, chiji wene wù le fɛwe gɛ ka wu mâajɛ bɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/><char style="wj">Noo, sege wo nyaa fiɛɛ muh wù fuude le, keefɛ wo mo wo tôŋe soŋ njɛ bamii ba jɛme yeye bo gee yeye to bo gee yéh yi buunɛ le mo jé le, lɛ bamii shânɛ bo gɛ. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ bo le bo kɛmɛ wa maajɛ wuboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, sege wo nyaa fiɛɛ muh wù fuude le, keefɛ wo gê kibo kuŋ kiŋkoŋo kɛɛ fiɛɛ fì kinchiɛɛŋ gee gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/><char style="wj">Noo, nnya yo nyû nyilɛ le, Chijo wù yɛde mwɛɛ mu ba gee nyilɛ le, lé wu gê wu maajɛ wo.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune buunɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>
    <char style="wj">Sege bɛŋ buune, keefɛ bɛŋ gêe njɛ no bamii ba jɛme yeye bo gee yeye to bo gee gɛ. Bo to bo koŋe ki bo lɛme yéh yi buunɛ le, mo ntasɛ yi jé le bo buune, lɛ bamii yɛ̂ne bo le. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ bo le bo kɛmɛ wa maajɛ wuboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ sege wo goone ki wo bûunɛ, wo lee wo gɛɛŋ yeh, wo faa kimbuŋ fɛ wo buune fɛ Chijo wù le nyilɛ le. Chijo wù yɛde mwɛɛ mù ba gee nyilɛ le, lé wu mâajɛ wo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ buune, keefɛ bɛŋ shê bɛŋ laane njɛ no bamii ba maa Nyo to bo gee gɛ. Bo gee noo bo kwaji lɛ ba le ba yu buunɛ chiboo nje jɛ́ yì bo jɛme wesee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ nyûme njɛ no bo le gɛ. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ Chiji wene kee wa fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ goone fɛ bɛŋ biide.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/><char style="wj">Le nɛ no taŋlo bɛŋ bûune: ‘Chiji wese wù le fɛwe, gêe lɛ bamii ŋgvûune jee chuŋ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/><char style="wj">wo gê lɛ bvunfoŋ bwuŋ to, wo gê fiɛɛ fì wo goone fɛkuu fɛnɛ fi nyûme no fi le fɛwe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/><char style="wj">Nya bee bɛ mwɛɛ munjile mu abɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/><char style="wj">Lɛɛshɛ bimbefɛ biɛsa, no bee tɛ lɛɛshi bimbefɛ bì bamii bamu gee fɛ bee le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ wo chînɛ bee lee moŋ wù ya bee le gɛ. Fi bee chiaaŋ yi muh wu kimbefɛ wɛɛ le.’</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baŋwa bamu ba kege jɛme fɛnɛ lɛ, “Bvusɛ bee a kimbefɛ ntɛnɛɛ.”</char></note> <char style="wj">[Bvunfoŋ le bwuŋ, bvuŋga nyu bwuŋ, bvukugɛ nyu bwuŋ segechii bvu kage gɛ. Fi nyûme noo.]</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ nɛ bɛŋ lɛɛshi bimbefɛ bi bamii bamu gee fɛ bɛŋ le, Chiji wene wù le fɛwe lɛɛshɛ tɛ biɛna.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, nɛ bɛŋ le njɛ bɛŋ lɛɛshi bimbefɛ bì bamii bamu gee fɛ bɛŋ le sɛŋ, Chiji wene gɛ lɛɛshɛ tɛ biɛna gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune mbaŋ mwɛɛ munjile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Sege bɛŋ bane mwɛɛ munjile, keefɛ bɛŋ jîiŋe nɛ yulaa njɛ no bamii ba chiaase ye gee gɛ. Bo kusɛ manshi maboo lɛ segeyu, wu lɛ bamii yɛ̂ne lɛ bo banɛ mwɛɛ munjile. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ bo le bo kɛmɛ wa maajɛ wuboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, sege wo banɛ mwɛɛ munjile, wo yefɛ kikwɛɛ kuŋ, wo chugɛ bvushi bwuŋ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/><char style="wj">wu lɛ keefɛ bamii yɛ̂ne lɛ wo banɛ mwɛɛ munjile gɛ, le yɛde gɛh Chijo wù le nyilɛ le. Le Chijo wù yɛde mwɛɛ mù bamii gee nyilɛ le wu lé wu gê wu mâajɛ wo.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune nchvu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛde nchvu yene fɛkuu fɛnɛ fɛ taŋlo shé kaaŋ, taŋlo tɛ ŋga koo, bachoŋ taŋlo bo ŋgode bo lee bo choŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛde nchvu yene nyu yi woŋ wù Nyo le, fɛ taŋlo shé gɛ kaaŋ gɛ, taŋlo tɛ ŋga gɛ koo gɛ, bachoŋ taŋlo tɛ bo gɛ ŋgode bo lee bo choŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ fɛ muh gɛɛde nchvu ye fo le fɛ fitele fie le fo.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kin'yesɛ ki ye yi muh le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">Ajii a muh le kin'yesɛ yi ye ye le. Noo, ajii a wo nɛ yuude lo, tu ye yo yichii le yi yisɛ bɛ n'yuu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, ajii a wo nɛ jime lo, tu ye yo yichii le yi yisɛ bɛ kijibɛ. Nɛ n'yuu wu muh le wu ja wu tu kijibɛ, kijibɛ kiyu jime wa nɛɛ?</char><verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyo jiiŋe fɛ bamii be le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">Gɛ nfwa taŋlo wu lɛ̂ne bachiji kikwɛɛ le bafɛɛ gɛ. Wu nɛ lɛne noo, wu bânɛ wumu, wu koŋe wumu, kɛnɛ wu yuge wumu le chuule wu jode wumu fɛkuu. Gɛ taŋlo bɛŋ lɛ̂ne Nyo le bɛŋ ka lɛne bige le gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Noo, njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ keefɛ bɛŋ lûume kune kinche kena le laa bɛŋ lé bɛŋ jî la lɛ, kɛnɛ bɛŋ mu la lɛ, kɛnɛ kune ye yene laa bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gê bɛŋ jii la lɛ. Gɛ kiyo ki muh fede mwɛɛ munjile gɛ? Gɛ ye yi muh fede tɛ njú gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ no munyii mù fuune we le. Gɛ mu to mu boone gɛ, kɛnɛ mu gweji ŋgu mu banyi mu gɛɛde a basaŋkwa le gɛ. Geenɛ, Chiji wene wù le fɛwe nyaŋe gɛh mu. Gɛ bɛŋ yage munyii gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/><char style="wj">Le yɛɛŋ a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ wù fuuŋse, wù taŋlo wu bisɛ gɛh kife shige yi kinche ke le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ luume kune njú nje la? Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ no nfudɛ kuu kwa wù nyu. Gɛ nfudɛ to wu lɛne gɛ kɛnɛ wu shiŋe njú gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ gɛh Nfoŋ Salamoŋ bɛ bvukugɛ bvuchii bvù wu gɛ̀ kɛme gɛ̀ susɛ ye wu bu fɛ nfudɛ wumu le gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/><char style="wj">Nyo nɛ suse agaaŋ a nchvuuŋ nɛ, agaaŋ a kuu abɛŋ, bu antaana ba fwɛɛ lo fɛtaŋ, tu gɛ taŋlo wu susɛ bɛŋ wu fe lo noo gɛ? O oo bamii ba mbɛmɛ wù shige!</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/><char style="wj">Noo, keefɛ fi fûuŋse bɛŋ, bɛŋ dûu laa bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gê bɛŋ ji la lɛ, bɛŋ mu la lɛ, kɛnɛ lɛ bɛŋ jii la ye le lɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/><char style="wj">Mwɛɛ munɛ munchii le mù bamii ba kee gɛ Nyo gɛ to bo gɛɛde bvufee yi mu le. Bɛŋ le fiena Chiji wene wù le fɛwe kee lɛ bɛŋ goone mwɛɛ munɛ munchii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ ya bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛ bvufee bwena nyu yi bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo le bɛ yi fiɛɛ fì le chaaŋ a wu jii le, wu mo wu nyaa tɛ mwɛɛ munɛ munchii bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ, keefɛ bɛŋ wɛ̂se kune fɛwɛge gɛ. Ba lé ba bû ba wɛse yi fiɛɛ fì fɛwɛge le, nyu fɛwɛge. Ŋgɛ wu yi juu le kooji gɛh yi juu chiyu chiɛɛ le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Keefɛ muh sâge gee chi muh mu gɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Keefɛ bɛŋ sâge gee chi bamii bamu gɛ, noo, Nyo gɛ sa tɛ chena gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ je yì bɛŋ sage gee chi muh mu lɛ yu, le gɛh yi yì Nyo lé wu gê wu sa tɛ chena yu. Fiɛɛ fì muh fege fiɛɛ yo fɛ wu nya muh le, le gɛh fi fì Nyo lé wu gê wu fe yo fɛ wu nya mwɛdɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/><char style="wj">Le nje la fì wo jiiŋe nyu sese chì le a mwa bwoo jii, geenɛ wo yɛde gɛ kikesɛ kì le a chuŋ jise le gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/><char style="wj">Taŋlo wo ge nɛɛ fɛ wo du mwa bwoo le lɛ, ‘Gɛh lɛ̂ɛŋ mbvusɛ sese chi a wo jii’, geenɛ wo yɛde gɛ kikesɛ kì le a chuŋ jise le gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/><char style="wj">Wo le muh wù chiaase ye! Ya bvusɛ kikesɛ kì le a chuŋ jise le fɛ wo yɛŋ sese chì le a jise chi mwa bwoo le chuule, wo mo wo bvûsɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>
    <char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ jô fiɛɛ fì Nyo bɛŋ nyâ bvú le gɛ. Nɛ bɛŋ ge noo, yi kaasɛ ye yi lumɛ lo bɛŋ. Keefɛ bɛŋ jô tɛ mbele bɛŋ nya munyuŋa le gɛ. Nɛ bɛŋ ge lo noo, mu jiɛnyɛ lo bɛ bikaa.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɛŋ bîide, bɛŋ ŋgôone, bɛŋ kûne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ bîide, Nyo lé wu nyâ bɛŋ le. Bɛŋ ŋgôone, Nyo lé wu gê bɛŋ yɛŋ. Bɛŋ kûne kimbuŋ, Nyo lé wu gwênyɛ bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ muh wuchii wù biide, wu lé wu kɛ̂mɛ, muh wuchii wù goone, lé wu gê wu yɛŋ, muh wuchii wù kune kimbuŋ lé ba nyû ba gwenyɛ wu le.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Le yɛɛŋ a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ wù mwa ye biide bvulɛɛŋ, wu nyâ wu nyu tɛdɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/><char style="wj">Kɛnɛ wu biide biɛŋ, wu nya wu nyu yo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/><char style="wj">Nɛ bɛŋ bamii ba befe bɛŋ kee ki bɛŋ nyâ mwɛɛ mù njoŋe booŋ bena le, tu gɛ Chiji wene wù le fɛwe taŋlo wu nya mwɛɛ mù njoŋe bamii ba biide wu le fede noo gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyume lɛ, nɛ le la fì bɛŋ goone lɛ bamii gêe fɛ bɛŋ le, nyume fi, fì bɛŋ gêe tɛ fɛ bo le, nje finɛ fiɛɛ le fiɛɛ fichii fì Ŋwa wu banchi ba Musɛ mo Baŋwa ba bamii ba ntuŋ ba Nyo yɛyi.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jwe wu kitaŋ wù fasaa bɛ wù bwuu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ lêe a kitaŋ le nyu fɛ jwe wù fasaa le, nje jwe wù buuu bɛ je yì chige gɛɛne nyu fɛ ba lé ba lɛ̂ɛshɛ lo nlɛɛshɛ le, bamii leese fɛ wu kwɛɛ le wesee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ jwe wu kitaŋ wù fasaa, bɛ je yì tɛɛme gɛɛne nyu fɛ kinche kì kage gɛ le. Bamii ba yɛde yi le bo le shige.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">No taŋlo muh kɛɛ bamii ba ntuŋ ba Nyo ba chimbiaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ jôde kife bɛ bamii ba mbiane lɛ bo le bamii ba ntuŋ ba Nyo. Bo too fɛ bɛŋ le bo duunyi lɛ bo le shóŋ, geenɛ antɛŋ nyu bakfuula bo taŋlo bo yɛɛsɛ lo shóŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gê bɛŋ kɛɛ bo nyu yi gee chiboo le, gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no ba to ba kee kite yi muntaŋ mù yune yi ki le. Taŋlo ba ke muntaŋ mu glɛb yi bifafɛ le, kɛnɛ ba ke muntaŋ mu fig yi kite ki mbíaŋ le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/><char style="wj">Fi nyu lɛ kite kì joŋe kichii to ki yune gɛh nyu muntaŋ mù njoŋe, kite kì befe yune gɛh nyu muntaŋ mù mbefe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/><char style="wj">Gɛ kite kì joŋe taŋlo ki yuŋ muntaŋ mù mbefe gɛ. Gɛ taŋlo tɛ kite kì befe yuŋ muntaŋ mù njoŋe gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/><char style="wj">Kite kichii kì yune gɛ muntaŋ mù njoŋe gɛ le ba nyu ba gwo ba toŋ lo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/><char style="wj">Noo, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ kɛ̂ɛ bamii ba chimbiaŋ bayu nyu yi gee chiboo le.</char><verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Gɛ nyu muh wuchii wu tɛŋe mɛ lɛ, ‘Tada, Tada’, nyu wu lee fɛ bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le gɛ. Lé lêe gɛh muh wù gee fiɛɛ fì Chii wù le fɛwe goone.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/><char style="wj">Lé tô nyu abvu bvu nsa wu fɛkimɛsɛ, bamii ba duude biide mɛne lɛ, ‘Tada, Tada, bee gɛ̀ teede gɛ̀ bantuŋ ba Nyo a jee chuŋ le, bee gɛ̀ bvuuse banchɛndaa ba debele yi bamii le a jee chuŋ le, bee ka gee biŋgha bi mwɛɛ a jee chuŋ le?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/><char style="wj">Mɛ mo ndu bo le lɛ, ‘Gɛ ŋkee bɛŋ gɛ. Bɛŋ ja lo a mɛ jii bamii ba gɛɛde nchi fɛkuu.’</char><verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Muh wu njonɛ wù kɛme bvufee bɛ wù le kiyuŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>
    <char style="wj">Noo, muh wuchii wù too wu yuge n'yɛyɛ waŋ, wu mo wu gee gɛh no wu duu, wu le gɛh njɛ muh wu bvufee wù gɛ̀ jonɛ yeh ye yi kimbaaŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/><char style="wj">Jaŋ gwe, jóo yisɛ yi bu, fii fe yi chi yeh yiyu, geenɛ yi gɛ gwe gɛ, nje wu gɛ̀ jooŋ kichi kiyu yi kimbaaŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, muh wù yuge n'yɛyɛ waŋ wù gee gɛ no wu jɛme gɛ, le njɛ kiyuŋ ki muh wù gɛ̀ jonɛ ye yeh nyu yi munshɛɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/><char style="wj">Jaŋ gwe, jóo yisɛ yi bu, fii fe yi chi yeh yiyu, yi kesɛ, yi shii fɛkuu yichii nɛ wuuu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bvuŋga bvu n'yɛyɛ bvù Jiso kɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Jiso gɛ̀ jɛmɛ mwɛɛ munɛ munchii wu mɛsɛ, kinchvu ki bamii kiyu kɛmɛ lo kiŋgha yi n'yɛyɛ we le, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>nje wu gɛ̀ yɛyi njɛ muh wù kɛmɛ bvuŋga bvu n'yɛyɛ. Gɛ wu gɛ̀ yɛyi njɛ no bamii baboo ba duunyi banchi ba Nyo gɛ̀ to bo yɛyi gɛ.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ muh goŋ yì baaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliku 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Sege Jiso gɛ̀ ja yi mbegɛ le wu boh, kinchvu ki bamii kì baaŋ banyɛ ki bii wu le. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ muh wumu wù gɛ̀ chɛne bɛ goŋ yì baaŋ, gɛ̀ ja wu to wu tuŋ anyuu a Jiso fwe wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Tada, taŋlo wo fɛ mɛ n'yuude, fɛ wo nɛ koŋe lo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Jiso mo wu nɛjɛ kibo wu kuŋ wu le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ŋkoŋe lo, tɛ̂mɛ la wo yûude.”</char> Kimimia, goŋ yì baaŋ yiyu mo yi ka ye ye le, wu mo wu tu wu yuude. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Jiso chiisɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo yɛ̂ne, keefɛ wo sɛ̂ɛŋ muh le gɛ. Geenɛ, gɛnɛ wo chûnyɛ kikwɛɛ kuŋ chiji kintanyɛ le, wo mo wo nya nnyaa yì Musɛ gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ muh kɛmɛ ki wu nyâ ki wu chûnyɛ bamii le lɛ wu le wu tɛmɛ wa yi goŋ yinɛ le wu tu wu yûude.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ mwa lɛme wu kikwɛɛ ki bamii ba nchi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu gɛɛŋ wu lee a kilaantɛŋ kì Kafanahum le, kikwɛɛ ki bamii ba nchi kimi gɛ̀ to ki yɛŋ wu le ki ku chiaaŋ wu le ki du lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>“Tada, mwa yaŋ wu lɛme gime yeh wu ŋgɛɛse lo, wu le wu kwe wa kimbe kimimia.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nlé ntô nfɛ̂ wu?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Geenɛ, kikwɛɛ ki bamii ba nchi kɛɛ chvuu Jiso le lɛ, “Tada, gɛ ŋkooji muh wù taŋlo wo to a wu yeh gɛ. Jɛmɛ gɛh nyu jɛ mwa yaŋ wu lɛme mo wu tɛmɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Nle a bvuŋga bvu muh mu kuu, bamii ba nchi nyu tɛ a mɛ kuu. Njɛme muh le lɛ, ‘Gɛ̂nɛ’, wu mo wu gɛɛne lo, ndu muh le lɛ, ‘Tô’, wu mo wu too lo. Ndu tɛ nfwa waŋ le lɛ, ‘Gêe nɛ’, wu mo wu gee lo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Jiso doo wu yu fiɛɛ fì wu jɛme, jwe yuŋ lo wu. Wu jɛmɛ bamii ba gɛ̀ bii wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, ŋge mbaaŋ a n'yɛŋ gɛ muh le Ishwala wù lese kfuu chi finɛ fitele yi ye yaŋ le nɛ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ bamii wesee le bo ja bimbe le bichii, kɛge a juu saane yo gɛɛne bude a chi seele yo, bo to bo shii bo jii mwɛɛ bɛ bachiji bena wù Ablaham mo Asik mo Yakob woŋ wu Nyo wu fɛwe le,</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/><char style="wj">geenɛ, booŋ ba woŋ wuyu le wuboo le ba noŋ bo yi kijibɛ le akfuuŋ fɛ bamii lé bo gê bo beede bo ŋgeji bige.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>No Jiso jɛmɛ noo wu mo wu du kikwɛɛ ki bamii ba nchi kɛɛ le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo gɛɛne la, fi lé fi gê noo no wo le wo leesɛ fitele ye yaŋ le.”</char> Mwa lɛme wu kikwɛɛ ki bamii ba nchi wuyu mo wu tɛmɛ lo gɛh ki sege.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ bamii ba binchɛŋ wesee</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliku 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu gɛɛŋ wu lee a Bita yeh, wu yɛŋ mwɛɛdɛ Bita gime wu chɛne bɛ kin'ya. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Jiso kuŋ kibo ke le, kin'ya kiyu mo ki chinɛ wu le, wu mo wu ja we wu bijɛ fiɛɛ Jiso ji.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Lɛ nyu fɛnfu, bamii tu bo too bɛ bamii wesee ba banchɛndaa ba debele gɛ̀ njiiŋse bɛ bo. Jiso tu wu bvuuse biyo biyu nyu gɛh bɛ jɛ maa. Wu ka fɛde tɛ bamii bachii ba gɛ̀ chɛne. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Finɛ fiɛɛ gɛ̀ kooshi ki fi gê fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Yosaya gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wa lɛ, “Wu le wu jo wa goŋ yese besabɛŋ, wu tuu binchɛŋ biɛsa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baŋgɛ ba muh wù bii Jiso le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Jiso gɛ̀ doo wu yɛŋ kinchvu ki bamii kì baaŋ taashɛ mbebe ye le, wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bee daŋ mamasi bee gɛɛŋ wuŋ kwege.” </char> <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Muh wumu wù gɛ̀ duunyi banchi ba Nyo mo wu kɛŋsɛ wu jɛmɛ Jiso le lɛ, “Muh n'yɛyɛ, nlé mbîi wo le mo nyu faaŋ fɛ wo gɛɛne fo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ,<char style="wj">“Binchombiaŋ kɛme bintuge biboo, munyii mù fuune we kɛme yéh yiboo, geenɛ gɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh kɛme lo fɛ wu giŋsɛ kikwɛɛ ke fo gɛ.” </char> <verse eid="MAT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Muh we wu ŋgoo wumu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Tada, chinɛ ŋgɛɛŋ njiiyɛ chijaŋ fɛ nto mbii.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Geenɛ Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo bîi mɛne, chinɛ bamii ba kweeyɛ wa bo jiiyi bamii baboo ba kweeyɛ wa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso waŋ nfuŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliku 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Jiso gɛ̀ gɛɛŋ wu lee a ŋguh le, booŋ be ba ŋgoo bi tɛ wu le yo. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ nfuŋ wumu wù baaŋ ja gɛh wu jaŋɛ wu kɛ a mamasi wuyu le wu shiŋshi joo yi bɛɛne yi lese a ŋguh le, yi goone ki yi yîsɛ a ŋguh le. Gɛ̀ bee Jiso lefe lo fie.<figure style="fig" alt="Wave enter the boat" file="lb00213c.tif" size="span" loc="Mch 8:24" copy="Louise Bass" ref="8:24">Kiŋkede ki joo lee a ŋguh le</figure> <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛɛŋ bo kaŋsɛ wu bo du lɛ, “Tada, fi bee, bee lé be kwêeyɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Wu kaŋsɛ wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ooo bamii ba mbɛmɛ wù shige. Bɛŋ faane la?”</char> No wu jɛmɛ noo wu mo wu ja we wu waŋ nfuŋ wuyu mo joo yì baaŋ, mu lu, manjuu chii nɛ nshiiŋŋ. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Jwe yuŋ bamii bayu nɛ kah. Bo ghaade lɛ, “Kfuu chi wunɛ muh le wu nɛɛ wù nfuŋ bɛ joo yuge wu le?”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso bvusɛ banchɛndaa ba debele yi bamii le bafɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliku 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Jiso gɛ̀ daŋ wu bu wuŋ kwege kimbe ki bamii ba Gadala le.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baŋwa ba kege bamu tɛŋe lɛ, “Gadalɛŋ, bamu lɛ Gɛlgɛseŋ.”</char></note> Bɛ bamii bafɛɛ tasɛ banchɛndaa ba debele nyu yi bo le. Bamii bayu gɛ̀ bu afuuŋ yì ba gɛ̀ jiiyi bamii yo le, bo gɛ̀ ŋase baaŋ taŋlo muh gɛ fe lo je yo gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ bo gɛ̀ kɛ bo tu bo wane fɛwɛɛwe bo biide lɛ, “Mwa Nyo, wo fii la a bee le? Wo to fɛnɛ ki wo nyâ ŋgɛ bee le kife baaŋ a kojɛ gɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Gɛ̀ bee ŋgoo yi munyuŋa jii kimbe kiyu le mu duude lo. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Banchɛndaa ba debele bayu mo bo lɛgɛ Jiso lɛ, “Kii wo, wo nɛ le wo bvusɛ bee, wo chiiŋsɛ bee yi munyuŋa mwege le.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Jiso mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ lo!”</char> Bo mo bo bu, bo gɛɛŋ bo lee yi munyuŋa muyu le. Fi kooshɛ lɛ ŋgoo yi munyuŋa yiyu yichii gɛ̀ kɛŋ yi boh a kiŋkoŋ le, mu shii a mamasi le mu kweeyɛ yo. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Bamii ba gɛ̀ chiɛɛne munyuŋa muyu fɛɛ lo, bo gɛɛŋ a kilaantɛŋ le, bo sɛɛŋ fiɛɛ fichii nchensɛŋ fì gɛ̀ kooshɛ bɛ bamii ba banchɛndaa ba debele gɛ̀ bee yi bo le. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ kilaantɛŋ kiyu kichii gɛ̀ bu lo ki to ki yɛŋ Jiso le. No bo gɛ̀ yɛŋ wu le, bo lɛgɛ lɛ wu ja gwɛŋ wuboo le.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ muh wù kwe wa kimbe kimimia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliku 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Jiso lee a ŋguh le, wu kaasɛ wu daŋ wu gɛɛŋ a kilaantɛŋ ke le. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ bamii bamu gɛ̀ too bɛ muh mu fɛ wu le a wu kwe wa kimbe kimimia, bo tuu a kidaŋ le. Jiso yɛŋ lɛ bamii bayu le bo leesɛ muntele muboo ye ye le, wu jɛmɛ muh wù gɛ̀ kwe kimbe kimimia wɛɛ le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsaa yaŋ, jijɛ fitele le. Nle nlɛɛshɛ wa bimbefɛ biuŋ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ bamii bamu ba gɛ̀ duunyi banchi ba Nyo gɛ̀ kɛ bo tu bo shuŋshi lɛbolɛbo bo duu lɛ, “Muh wunɛ jode kijusɛ ki Nyo.” <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Jiso kɛɛ baŋkwajɛ baboo wu biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kɛme baŋkwajɛ ba befe a muntele mwɛna le nɛ nje la?</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/><char style="wj">Fi chige fì njɛmɛ le fì la? Ki njɛmɛ muh wunɛ le lɛ nle nlɛɛshɛ wa bimbefɛ bie noo, lɛ wu jâ we wu jîɛnyi le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, nlé ŋgê bɛŋ kɛ̂ɛ lɛ muh wu jee che le Mwamuh kɛme bvuŋga fɛkuu fɛnɛ ki wu lɛ̂ɛshɛ bimbefɛ.”</char> No wu jɛmɛ noo wu mo wu du muh wù gɛ̀ kwe kimbe kimimia wɛɛ le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ja we, wo jo bvuko bwuŋ wo gɛ̂ɛne fɛ yeh le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Wu mo wu ja we wu gɛɛne fɛ yeh le. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Kinchvu ki bamii yɛŋ fiɛɛ fì kooshi le, nfaaŋ koo bo, bo tu bo tume maŋkuŋ ma Nyo wù le wu nya kfuu chi bvunɛ bvuŋga muh wu wuŋ le.<figure style="fig" alt="The paralyzed man" file="Parlyse on Roof 01.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 9:1-8" copy="Mbanji Bawe Ernest" ref="9:8">Muh wu kwe kimbe kimimia</figure><verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso tɛɛŋ Macho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliku 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja fo wu doo wu jiɛnyi wu gɛɛne wu yɛŋ muh mu le ba tɛŋe lɛ Macho, nyu muh wù gɛ̀ koode ŋwa, wu shii fɛ kijusɛ ke ki lɛme le. Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo bîi mɛne!”</char> Wu mo wu ja we wu bii wu le.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu gɛɛŋ wu shii wu jii mwɛɛ a Macho yeh, fi kooshɛ lɛ bamii bamu wesee ba gɛ̀ koode ŋwa, mo bamii ba befe bamu tɛ gɛ̀ to bo shii bo jii mwɛɛ bɛ ba Jiso mo booŋ be ba ŋgoo. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Bafalashii doo bo yɛŋ no bɛ bo jii mwɛɛ noo bo biih booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, “Le nje la wù muh wene wu n'yɛyɛ jii mwɛɛ bɛ bamii ba koode ŋwa mo bamii ba befe bamu?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Jiso yu no bo biide, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ bamii ba tɛɛme to bo goone muh wu nche gɛ. To goone nyu bamii ba chɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ kwâjɛ, bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ laa kinyi ki fiɛɛ fì ba saŋ finɛ Nyo jɛme lɛ, ‘Ŋgoone lɛ bamii kôode nyu yii fɛ bamii le, gɛ ŋgoone lɛ bo gêe nyu kintanyɛ fɛ mɛne gɛ’, le lɛ la lɛ? Bɛŋ kêe lɛ gɛ nto ki ntɛɛŋ nyu bamii ba chaaŋ gɛ. Nto ki ntɛɛŋ nyume bamii ba befe.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamii biih kune mbaŋ mwɛɛ munjile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliku 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Joŋ gɛ̀ ja bo to bo biih Jiso le lɛ, “Le nje la wù besa Bafalashii banɛ mwɛɛ munjile, buŋ booŋ ba ŋgoo banɛ gɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ taŋlo ba tɛɛŋ bamii ba bvuguu, bo gɛɛŋ bo nyu yii yii chiji bvuguu nyu bɛ bo? Geenɛ, aju too lo a ba lé ba fî chiji bvuguu wuyu a bo le, bo mo bo kɛ bo banɛ mwɛɛ munjile.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/><char style="wj">Gɛ muh taŋlo wu jo finchaŋa fi nju fifɛŋ, wu chvuushɛ nju yì kege yu gɛ. Nɛ wu ge lo noo, finchaŋa fi nju fiyu kfunyɛ fi saayɛ nju yì kege yiyu, kintuge kì le fo ki mɛsɛ ki kugɛ lo ki fe no ki chi shee ki nyume.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/><char style="wj">Gɛ taŋlo tɛ muh jo mbvuuŋ manfɛŋ wu gɛɛ a kolo wu mbvuuŋ wù kege le gɛ, wu ge lo noo, mbvuuŋ manfɛŋ maa ge mo koo, mo saayɛ lo kolo wù kege wɛɛ, mbvuuŋ bɛ kolo mo mu lɛsɛ achiji. Fi kooji le lɛ ba kɛme ki ba gɛɛ mbvuuŋ manfɛŋ nyume a kolo wù fwɛŋ le. Noo, mbvuuŋ bɛ kolo mo, mo nyume.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɛse wumu kuŋ Jiso le wu tɛmɛ, <optbreak/> Jiso fɛ mwa muh wù baaŋ yɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliku 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Gɛh no Jiso gɛ̀ baaŋ wu jɛme bo le noo, fi kooshɛ lɛ muh wù baaŋ wumu gɛ̀ to wu lee wu tuŋ anyuu a wu jii wu lɛgɛ lɛ, “Mwa yaŋ wù kwɛse le wu kwe gɛh mɛɛse nɛ, geenɛ, to wo kuŋ wu le bɛ kibo kuŋ wu kaasɛ wu tu yu.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Jiso mo wu ja we bɛ wu tu bo gɛɛne, booŋ be ba ŋgoo bii tɛ wu le.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ kwɛse wumu wù gɛ̀ bee wu chɛŋ wa bɛ kinchɛŋ ki bikɛse lɛ biluŋ le yuufe ncho bifɛɛ gɛ̀ to a Jiso jiŋ wu kuŋ jwe wù nju ye le. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Fɛ wu kuŋ noo, gɛ̀ bee wu jɛmɛ wa fɛ fitele fie le lɛ, “Nɛ mɛ moŋ nlo ŋkuŋ gɛh nyu nju ye le, tu nle ntɛmɛ wa.” <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>No wu kuŋ noo, Jiso kaasɛ ye wu yɛŋ wu le, wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Mwa yaŋ, keefɛ wo fâane gɛ. Fitele fiuŋ fì wo lese yi ye yaŋ le, le fi ge wa wo tɛmɛ.”</char> Gɛh sege yu, kwɛse wuyu mo wu tɛmɛ lo.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Jiso gɛɛŋ wu fɛsɛ fɛ muh wù baaŋ wɛɛ yeh le, wu yɛŋ bamii ba gɛ̀ toŋe bandoŋ ba kwe mo kinchvu ki bamii. Ki gɛ̀ bee fo bo fuge lo bɛ kwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ sâaŋe, mwa wuyu baaŋ a kwe gɛ, wu lefe lo.”</char> Bamii bayu tu bo keede lo wu. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Bo doo bo bvusɛ bamii bayu akfuuŋ, wu mo wu lee wu gɛɛŋ yeh, wu jijɛ mwa wuyu yi kibo le, wu mo wu ja we. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Saaka wù kune fiɛɛ fiyu jiɛnyɛ fi gɛɛŋ a kimbe ki woŋ wuyu le kichii.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso gwenyɛ ajii a binfeeŋ bifɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Jiso ja fɛ yeh yɛɛ le, wu doo wu jiɛnyi wu gɛɛne, binfeeŋ bimi bifɛɛ, nyu bilɛŋsɛ bi kuŋe bi bii wu le bi wanɛ fɛwɛɛwe bi duu lɛ, “Mwa Nfoŋ Dabi, koo yii fɛ bee le.” <verse eid="MAT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Jiso gɛɛŋ wu lee yeh, binfeeŋ biyu bi wu le, wu biih bi le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ le bɛŋ bɛɛŋ lɛ taŋlo ŋge fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ beede finɛ?”</char> Bi bɛɛŋ lɛ, “Ɛɛŋ Tada.” <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Jiso mo wu kuŋ ajii aboo le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bii yi fitele fì bɛŋ leese yi ye yaŋ le, fi ge ye noo fɛ bɛŋ le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Ajii aboo mo wo gwenyɛ. Jiso mo wu lejɛ lo fi tɛmɛ bo le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yɛ̂ne keefɛ bɛŋ môŋ bɛŋ gê muh kɛ̂ɛ gɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Geenɛ, bo ka bo gɛɛŋ bo saŋsɛ lo saaka kune lɛme chi Jiso kimbe ki woŋ wuyu le wuchii.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ kinchifɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>No bamii bayu gɛ̀ ja wa bo gɛɛne, fi kooshɛ lɛ bamii gɛ̀ ja bo to bɛ kinchifɛ kimi fɛ Jiso le, nchɛndaa wu debele nyu yi wu le. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Jiso doo wu bvusɛ nchɛndaa wu debele wuyu ye yi muh wuyu le, wu mo wu kɛ wu jɛme. Kinchvu ki bamii yɛŋ noo jwe yuŋ bo, bo tu bo maŋe bo duu lɛ, “Gɛ bo gɛ̀ yu wa bo yɛŋ fiɛɛ njɛ finɛ le woŋ wù Ishwala le gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Geenɛ, Bafalashii jɛme fiboo lɛ, “Wu bvuuse banchɛndaa ba debele banɛ nyu bɛ bvuŋga bvu nfoŋ banchɛndaa ba debele.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgwejɛ duude baaŋ bamii ba ŋgwejɛ nyu shige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Jiso ja wu jiɛnyi a bilaantɛŋ le bichii mo bantɛ le wu yɛyi bamii yéh yi buunɛ yiboo le, wu ka feeji tɛ saaka wù joŋe kune bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo. Wu gɛ̀ jiɛnyi noo wu fɛde tɛ binchɛŋ bichii mo goŋ yì baaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Wu gɛ̀ yɛŋ binchvu bi bamii le, yii koo wu bɛ bo nje bo gɛ̀ bee yi manluŋ le, muh nyume gɛ yu wù fii bo gɛ, njɛ shóŋ yì le gɛ bɛ muh wù chiɛɛne yi gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Wu mo wu ja wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ŋgwejɛ duude baaŋ, geenɛ bamii ba ŋgwejɛ nyu shige.</char> <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/><char style="wj">Noo, bɛŋ bûune lɛ Tada wù Chiji mwɛ chiiŋsɛ bamii ba ŋgwejɛ a wu mwɛne.”</char><verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso tuŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliku 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Jiso ja wu tɛɛŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ bo to. Wu nya bo bvuŋga ki bo bvûuse biyo bì yiide yi bamii le bo ka fɛ̂de binchɛŋ bichii mo goŋ yichii. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Kanɛ le a jee a booŋ ba ntuŋ ba Jiso ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ: Wù fwe gɛ̀ bee Samoŋ wù ba ka tɛŋe lɛ Bita, bɛ Andulu wù mwa bwee. Bamu nyu Jɛm wù mwa Jɛbɛdi bɛ mwa bwee wù Joŋ, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>mo Filib, Batolomiu, Toma bɛ Macho wù gɛ̀ koode ŋwa, Jɛm wù mwa Alfayu, Tadio, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>bɛ Samoŋ wù gɛ̀ bee ŋgoo yi Bajalot le,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bajalot gɛ̀ bee Bajuu ba gɛ̀ toone woŋ, bo juu ki bo bvusɛ bo yi ŋgɛ le chiaaŋ yi bamii ba Lum le.</char></note> bɛ Juda Ɛkaliot wù gɛ̀ gesɛ Jiso.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliku 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Jiso tuŋ bamii ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ banɛ, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gɛɛne, keefɛ bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ kijusɛ le njɛ le ki bamii ba le gɛ Bajuu gɛ. Keefɛ bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bilaantɛŋ bì le bi bamii ba Samaliya le gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ nyu fɛ booŋ ba Ishwala le ba le ba lɛsɛ wa njɛ shóŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gɛɛne bɛŋ mo bɛŋ fêeji bɛŋ dûu lɛ, ‘Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe le wa mbebe le.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ fɛ̂de tɛ bamii ba chɛne, bɛŋ gêe bamii ba kweeyɛ wa bo tuu yu, bɛŋ fɛ̂de bamii ba kɛme goŋ yì baaŋ, bɛŋ bvûuse banchɛndaa ba debele yi bamii le. Nle nnya bvuŋga bɛŋ le achiji. Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ tɛ bɛŋ fîih bamii yu achiji.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gɛɛne, keefɛ muh jô bige wu shûu yi kicha le gɛ, kɛnɛ nyu bì kuge, kɛnɛ nyu bì shige, kɛnɛ nyu bì shige shige nɛɛ lɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ muh jô kikɛɛ gɛ! Keefɛ muh jo bikuŋ bifɛɛ kɛnɛ jé yimi gɛ, mo nyu kimbaŋ gɛ. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ nɛ muh lɛne lɛme, tu le fo fɛ wù kɛme ki wu jîi fo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gɛɛŋ bɛŋ lee a laantɛŋ, kɛnɛ ntɛ le, bɛŋ gooŋ bɛŋ yɛŋ muh wù le wu kojɛ le, bena bo chêe gɛɛŋ bu kife kì bɛŋ le bɛŋ ja yo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gɛɛŋ, bɛŋ doo bɛŋ lese a muh yeh, bɛŋ yɛsɛ yeh yiyu le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/><char style="wj">Yeh yiyu nɛ le yi kojɛ, kimbonɛ kena to yu yeh. Nɛ yeh yiyu baaŋ kojɛ gɛ, kimbonɛ kena kaasɛ ki tu a bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh le wu faŋ ki wu fî bɛŋ kɛnɛ ki wu yû fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ jɛme, bɛŋ doo bɛŋ bude yeh yiyu le kɛnɛ a kilaantɛŋ kiyu le bɛŋ kaajɛ bibvunɛ biboo yi bikaa biɛna le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ lé gê doo nyume juu chi nsa wù fɛkimɛsɛ, mwɛɛ bonɛ fɛ kilaantɛŋ ki Sodom bɛ ki Gomola le, fe kilaantɛŋ ki kɛɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Baŋgɛ ba booŋ ba ntuŋ ba Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliku 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, ntune bɛŋ, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ nyû njɛ shóŋ antɛnɛɛ a baŋgvufe. Noo, bɛŋ doo bɛŋ jiɛnyi bɛŋ fêefe njɛ yó, bɛŋ nyû tɛ nyiɛgee njɛ bibɛmbɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ jiɛnyi bɛŋ jôde kife kune bamii. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ ba lé ba gê ba nya bɛŋ chiaaŋ yi bamii ba sage bansa le. Bo lé bo gê bo suŋe bɛŋ yéh yi buunɛ yiboo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/><char style="wj">Bo lé bo gê bo chii bɛŋ bo gɛɛŋ bɛ bɛŋ fwe fɛ bamii ba sage bimbe bi woŋ le, mo fwe a banfoŋ nje mɛ, wu lɛ bɛŋ mo bɛŋ jɛme bo le mo bamii ba le gɛ Bajuu le gɛ kune mɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/><char style="wj">Ba doo ba nya bɛŋ bo le noo, keefɛ kikwɛɛ fûuŋse bɛŋ laa bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ jɛmɛ lɛ la lɛ, je yì nɛɛ le la, nje Nyo lé wu gê wu nya fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ le bɛŋ jɛmɛ kife kiyu le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ gɛ ka jɛme bɛŋ gɛ. Lé gê jɛ̂me Kiyo ki Chiji wene jwe wene le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/><char style="wj">Muh lé wu gê wu ja wu jô mwa bwee wu nyâ ba yuuyɛ, chiji mwa jô mwa ye wu nyâ ba yuuyɛ. Booŋ lé bo gê bo ja bo boone bikaa a bachiji baboo jiŋ, bo gee ba yuuyi bo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/><char style="wj">Bamii bachii lé bo gê bo banɛ bɛŋ nje jee chaŋ. Geenɛ muh wu lé wu kâaŋ shɛ́ŋ gɛɛŋ bu fɛkimɛsɛ, lé wu gê wu bonɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/><char style="wj">Sege bamii booŋ bikaa a bɛŋ jiŋ a kilaantɛŋ kimi le, bɛŋ fɛ̂ɛ bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ a kimi le. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, gɛ bɛŋ nyu bɛŋ jiɛnyɛ bilaantɛŋ bi Ishwala le bichii muh wù jee che le Mwamuh baaŋ to gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ kee lɛ gɛ mwa ŋwa to wu fede muh wù yɛyi wu gɛ, gɛ mwa lɛme to wù fede tɛ chiji kikwɛɛ ke gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/><char style="wj">Fi le fi kojɛ lɛ mwa ŋwa taŋlo wù nyu njɛ muh wù yɛyi wu, mwa lɛme nyu tɛ njɛ chiji kikwɛɛ ke. Ba nɛ tɛŋe chiji yeh lɛ wu le Bɛsebu, ba gɛ tɛɛŋ booŋ ba yeh bɛ jee chi kuufe ye chi fede chi chiɛɛ gɛ?</char><verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>
    <char style="wj">Noo, keefɛ bɛŋ fâane muh gɛ. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ gɛ fiɛɛ fì ba le ba baŋe fi nyu njɛ fi lé fi tô fi bu fɛ waaŋ sɛŋ gɛ. Gɛ fiɛɛ nyu yu tɛ fì ba nyile fì nyu njɛ ba kɛɛ sɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/><char style="wj">Fiɛɛ fì nsɛŋe bɛŋ le antaŋ, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ jɛ̂mɛ bamii le fɛnshe. Fì nchvuune bɛŋ le, bɛŋ é bɛŋ jâŋ nyu fɛ kigo ki yeh le. </char> <figure style="fig" alt="House top" file="lb00234c.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 10:27" copy="Louise Bass" ref="10:27">A yeh we</figure> <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ fâane bamii ba taŋlo bo yuuyɛ gɛh nyume nyaŋ yi ye maa, njɛ taŋlo bo yuuyɛ tɛ kiyo sɛŋ gɛ. Bɛŋ fâane nyu Nyo wù taŋlo wu lɛɛshɛ kiyo ki muh bɛ ye ye yi ŋgu wù baaŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/><char style="wj">Gɛ ba gese munsɛŋ munfɛɛ yi finini le maa gɛ? Geenɛ, gɛ fimimia gwee fɛkuu njɛ Chiji wene le wu bɛɛŋ sɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/><char style="wj">Fiena le lɛ Nyo kee yvú yichii yì le a bɛŋ fwa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/><char style="wj">Noo, keefɛ bɛŋ fâane gɛ. Bɛŋ fede munsɛŋ mù duude. </char><verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>
    <char style="wj">Nɛ muh bɛmɛ mɛ a bamii fwe lɛ wu kee mɛ, tu nlé ŋgê mbɛɛŋ tɛ mwɛdɛ fwe a Chijaŋ wù fɛwe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ le yɛɛŋ wù faŋ mɛ a bamii fwe, nlé ŋgê nfaŋ tɛ wù fwe a Chii wù fɛwe.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso to bɛ kiŋgaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>
    <char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ kwâji lɛ nto nyu bɛ nyiɛgee yi nshɛŋ le fɛnɛ gɛ. Gɛ nyu fiɛɛ fì nto nje fi gɛ. Nto nyu bɛ jɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ nto ki ŋge mwa wù jwɛŋsɛ juu bɛ chiji, mwa wù kwɛse juu bɛ bwee, kwɛ mwa juu bɛ bwe jwɛɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/><char style="wj">Bamii ba kimbanɛ ba muh lé bo gê bo nyu bamii ba a wu yeh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh koŋe chiji kɛnɛ bwee wu fede mɛ, tu wu baaŋ kojɛ gɛ ki wù nyu muh waŋ gɛ. Muh koŋe tɛ mwa ye wu jwɛŋsɛ kɛnɛ wù kwɛse wu fede mɛ, tu wu baaŋ kojɛ gɛ ki wù nyu muh waŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh baaŋ tuu gɛ kintaaŋ ke wu bii mɛne gɛ, tu wu baaŋ kojɛ gɛ ki wù nyu muh waŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh baji kinche ke, tu wu lé wu gê wu lɛsɛ kinche kiyu. Geenɛ muh wu lɛsɛ kinche ke nje mɛ, tu wu lé wu gê wù kɛme kinche kì kage gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:4">Maliku 9:4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>
    <char style="wj">Nɛ muh fii bɛŋ, tu wu fii nyu mɛ. Muh fii mɛ, tu wu fii nyume muh wu tuŋ mɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh fii muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo nje wu kee lɛ le Nyo wù tuŋ wu, tu wu lé wu gê wù kɛme maajɛ wù Nyo maaji bamii be ba ntuŋ yu. Nɛ muh fii muh wù chaaŋ nje wu kee lɛ mwɛdɛ le muh wù chaaŋ, tu wu lé wu gê wù kɛme maajɛ wù Nyo maaji bamii ba chaaŋ yu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, muh wù nya fiŋkoo fi joo yi jiɛɛ muh wu mumwaa a ŋgoo yi bamii ba shige shige banɛ le nje wu kee lɛ le muh waŋ wu ŋgoo, tu gɛ mwɛdɛ nyu wu to wu fu maajɛ we gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Joŋ Nlesɛajoo tuŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo fɛ Jiso le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Jiso mɛsɛ wu tefɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ wu mo wu ja fo wu jiɛnyi a bilaantɛŋ bi yo le wu yɛyi bamii wu ka feeji saaka wù joŋe. <verse eid="MAT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Gɛ̀ bee kife kiyu le, Joŋ Nlesɛajoo nyu yeh yi ncha le. Wu ja wu yu kune mwɛɛ mu Kletu gɛ̀ gee, wu mo wu tuŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo bo gɛɛŋ, <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>bo biih wu le laa le wu wù gɛ̀ bee ki wu gê wu to noo, bo chîɛɛne muh mu la. <verse eid="MAT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Bo gɛɛŋ bo biih, Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kâasɛ bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ sɛ̂ɛŋ Joŋ mwɛɛ mù bɛŋ yu mo mù bɛŋ yɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/><char style="wj">Binfeeŋ yɛde wa mwɛɛ le, batɛŋlaase jiɛnyi chaaŋ, bamii ba chɛne bɛ goŋ yì baaŋ tɛmɛ wa bo yuude, binchifɛ yuge wa mwɛɛ, bamii ba kweeyɛ kaase bo tuu yu, bo ka feeji tɛ saaka wù joŋe wu Nyo bamii ba kifufe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/><char style="wj">Noo, kinlaŋye kì baaŋ le kì muh wù baaŋ mɛ maŋɛ gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Booŋ ba Joŋ ba ŋgoo baa ja, Jiso mo wu kɛ wu jɛme kinchvu ki bamii le kune Joŋ wu biide lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ chi shee bɛŋ bude bɛŋ gɛɛne kwa ki bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ yɛŋ nyu la le? Gane chì fii fede chi shiŋshi le noo?</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/><char style="wj">Nɛ ya noo gɛ, bɛŋ chi bude bɛŋ gɛɛne yo nje la? Bɛŋ chi gɛɛne ki bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ muh le wù susɛ ye bɛ njú yì bonɛ? Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, bamii ba suse ye bɛ njú yì bonɛ to bo nyu a banto le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/><char style="wj">Nɛ ya noo gɛ, bɛŋ chi bude bɛŋ gɛɛne yo nje la? Ki bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ yɛŋ muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo le noo? Ɛɛŋ, nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ wu fede muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/><char style="wj">Le wu wù ba gɛ̀ saŋ kune wù Nyo duu lɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">‘Yêgɛ yû, nlé ŋgê nchîiŋsɛ muh waŋ wu ntuŋ wu sâ wo fwe,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="wj">wu sêesɛ je yo fɛ wo tôo.’</char><verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, antɛnɛɛ a bamii ba bikɛse le bo boo wa, ba baaŋ a boo gɛ muh wù kuge wu fede Joŋ Nlesɛajoo gɛ. Geenɛ, muh wù shige antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe kuge wu fede wu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/><char style="wj">Kɛge yi kife kì Joŋ Nlesɛajoo gɛ̀ kɛ lɛme che too bude mɛɛse, gɛ̀ bee bamii taŋe bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe, bamii ba bvuŋga lode bɛ bvuŋga.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/><char style="wj">Bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo bachii mo banchi ba Musɛ gɛ̀ jɛme kune bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe to bu kife ki Joŋ Nlesɛajoo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/><char style="wj">Nɛ bɛŋ le bɛŋ yɛŋ lɛ bɛŋ taŋlo bɛŋ bɛɛŋ, bɛŋ bɛɛŋ lɛ Joŋ wunɛ le Alaja wù gɛ̀ bee ki wu gê wu to.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/><char style="wj">Muh wù kɛme bintuŋ wu yu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>Jiso ja wu gha lɛ, <char style="wj">“Fiɛɛ fì taŋlo mbege kiŋgogɛ ki mɛɛse kinɛ yu le la? Bo le gɛh lo njɛ booŋ ba shige shige ba shiiyɛ manjuu ma waaŋ le, bamu tɛŋe bamu bo biide lɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/><char style="wj">‘Bee toŋe ndoŋ bɛŋ bine gɛ? Bee nyaa ŋkee wu kwe, bɛŋ bɛmɛ gɛ?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/><char style="wj">Njɛme noo nje Joŋ gɛ̀ bee wu to wu faŋ ki wu jîi mwɛɛ kɛnɛ ki wu mûu, bɛŋ tu bɛŋ jɛme lɛ wu kɛme nchɛndaa wu debele yi wu le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/><char style="wj">Muh wù jee che le Mwamuh doo wu to, wu jii mwɛɛ wu ka muu, bɛŋ lɛ ba jiŋɛ ba yɛŋ, wu jiɛnyi wu wuude lo mwɛɛ munjile wu yaane lo mbvuuŋ, wu ka nyume nsaa yi bamii ba koode ŋwa mo bamii ba befe bamu. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ bvufee to bvu duunyi ye nyu yi fiɛɛ fì bvu lɛne le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso tu wu kɛnɛ ye yi gee chi bilaantɛŋ bimi le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Jiso mo wu ja wu kɛ wu kɛnɛ ye yi gee chi bilaantɛŋ bimi bì wu gɛ̀ ge biŋgha bi mwɛɛ bì duude bi le, nje wu gɛ̀ ge noo, bamii ba yo faŋ ki bo kusɛ kinche kiboo. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>Wu gɛ̀ kɛnɛ noo, wu jɛme lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bamii ba Kolasiŋ, ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le tɛ wene bɛŋ bamii ba Bɛsada. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ, nɛ ŋgɛ̀ ŋge biŋgha bi mwɛɛ bì ŋgɛ̀ ŋge bɛŋ le, nyume Taya bɛ Sidoŋ, tu bo gɛ̀ bee bo jii wa bimbaŋkwe, bo kfuuŋ taaŋ ye le nchensɛŋ ki bo dunyɛ lɛ bo le bo kusɛ wa muntele muboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ, lé gê doo nyume juu chi nsa wù fɛkimɛsɛ, mwɛɛ bonɛ fɛ bamii ba Taya le mo ba Sidoŋ le fe fɛ bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/><char style="wj">Mo bɛŋ bamii ba Kafanahum, bɛŋ kwaji lɛ ba lé ba gê ba bɛɛŋsɛ bɛŋ, bɛŋ bɛɛŋ fɛwe? Aay! Ba lé ba gê ba shiishɛ lo bɛŋ, bɛŋ shii bɛŋ gɛɛŋ woŋ wu baŋkfu le. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ, nɛ ŋgɛ̀ ŋge biŋgha bi mwɛɛ bì ŋgɛ̀ ŋge bɛŋ le nyu Sodom, tu kilaantɛŋ kiyu be baaŋ yu, too bude abɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ, lé gê doo nyume juu chi nsa wu fɛkimɛsɛ, mwɛɛ bonɛ fɛ bamii ba woŋ wu Sodom le fe fɛ bɛŋ le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimbuŋ ki Jiso yaafe lo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Gɛh kife kiyu le, Jiso ja wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnyaa kiyone wo le Chii Nfoŋ kibvulɛ bɛ nshɛŋ, no wo le wo nyilɛ mwɛɛ munɛ babvufee le mo baŋkɛɛ fiɛɛ le, wo dunyɛ nyu mumwone mu bwele le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/><char style="wj">Le no fi le Chii, nje le no wo gɛ̀ goone lɛ fi nyume.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>
    <char style="wj">Chii le wu nya wa mwɛɛ munchii mɛne. Gɛ muh nyu yu wù kee Mwa fuge Chiji gɛ. Gɛ muh nyu yu wù kee Chiji fuge Mwa ye gɛ, mo bamii ba Mwa le wu cha wa ki wu dûnyɛ Chiji bo le.</char><verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ bachii ba le akuu a bvujijɛ bvu yage bɛŋ, bɛŋ to fɛ mɛne, ŋge bɛŋ fufɛ shɛ́ŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ jo nyu kimbuŋ kaŋ bɛŋ shumɛ, bɛŋ bîi n'yɛyɛ waŋ le, nje nle fiaŋ muh wù nyiɛgee, ŋkɛme fitele fì jiɛɛ, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ kɛ̂mɛ nfufɛ shɛ́ŋ fɛ muntele mwɛna le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/><char style="wj">Gɛ kimbuŋ kaŋ yage shumɛ le gɛ, gɛ bvujijɛ bwaŋ jiji gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso najɛ saaka kune juu chi yuuŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliku 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Gɛ̀ bee kife kiyu le, Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo jiɛnyi bo fede mwɛ wu agiŋ wumu le, nyu juu chi yuuŋ. Gɛ̀ bee jɛŋ yuu booŋ be ba ŋgoo, bo mo bo ja bo kɛ bo suume bichiɛɛ bo jii. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Bafalashii yɛŋ, bo jɛmɛ Jiso le lɛ, “Bîjɛ wo yɛ̂ŋ, booŋ buŋ ba ŋgoo gee fiɛɛ fì nchi baaŋ bɛɛŋ gɛ lɛ muh gê juu chi yuuŋ gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Wu biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ baaŋ a tɛɛŋ gɛ a Ŋwa wu Nyo le no jɛŋ gɛ̀ yuu Dabi bɛ ŋgoo ye, no wu gɛ̀ ge gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/><char style="wj">Wu gɛ̀ lee yeh yi Nyo le, wu ji blɛd wù ba le ba cha ba gɛɛ lɛ le wu Nyo, gɛ̀ bee nchi fɛ wu le kɛnɛ bamii ba gɛ̀ bee bɛ wu ki bo ji. Taŋlo ji gɛh nyu bachiji kintanyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/><char style="wj">Noo, lɛ bɛŋ baaŋ a tɛɛŋ gɛ tɛ a banchi ba Musɛ le, lɛ ge doo nyume juu chi yuuŋ, bachiji kintanyɛ ŋgode nchi wu yuuŋ bo ge lɛme chiboo yeh yi kintanyɛ le, geenɛ, nsa nyu gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/><char style="wj">Nsɛɛŋ bɛŋ le lɛ fiɛɛ le yu fɛnɛ mɛɛse fi kuge fì fede yeh yi kintanyɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/><char style="wj">Ba le ba saŋ a Ŋwa wu Nyo le lɛ Nyo jɛme lɛ, ‘Ŋgoone lɛ bamii kôode nyu yii fɛ bamii le, gɛ ŋgoone lɛ bo gêe nyu bintanyɛ fɛ mɛne gɛ.’ Nɛ bɛŋ fɛnɛ bee bɛŋ kee fiɛɛ fì kijusɛ kiyu kinɛ duu, bɛŋ gɛ ka bɛŋ sage bamii ba kɛme jialɛ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/><char style="wj">Fi le lɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh le Chiji kikwɛɛ ki yuuŋ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ muh juu chi yuuŋ kibo nyu ki kwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliku 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Jiso ja fo, wu gɛɛŋ wu lee yeh yi buunɛ yiboo le. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ muh mu gɛ̀ bee yu a kibo ke kimi nyume ki kwe wa. Bamii bamu ja bo biih Jiso le lɛ, “Nchi le wu bɛɛŋ lɛ taŋlo ba fɛ muh juu chi yuuŋ?” Bo gɛ̀ biide noo bo goone nyu fiɛɛ fì bo kooyi yi ye ye le. <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Le yɛɛŋ a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ wù kɛme shóŋ, yimi gwe a kintuge le juu chi yuuŋ, wu gɛ jijɛ wu chii wu bvusɛ gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/><char style="wj">Gɛ muh wu wuŋ fede shoŋ gɛ? Noo, tu nchi le wu bɛɛŋ lɛ muh ge lɛme chi joŋe juu chi yuuŋ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Wu mo wu jɛmɛ muh wù gɛ̀ bee kibo nyu ki kwe wɛɛ le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nɛ̂jɛ kibo kuŋ!”</char> Muh wuyu nɛjɛ ki, ki mo ki tɛ̂mɛ ki tu ki nyu gɛh njɛ kimi kɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Geenɛ Bafalashii bu bo gɛɛŋ bo mo bo chu ntaŋ no bo lé bo gê fɛ bo yuuyɛ Jiso.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso le muh wu lɛme wù Nyo le wu cha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Jiso kɛɛ kune ntaŋ wu ba chu, wu mo wu ja fo. Bamii ba duude bi wu le. Wu fɛ bo bachii ba gɛ̀ kɛme binchɛŋ, <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>wu chiisɛ bo le lɛ keefɛ bo gê bamii kɛɛ wu gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Fi gɛ̀ bee noo ki fi gê fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Yosaya gɛ̀ jɛme lɛ,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, wunɛ le mwa yaŋ wu lɛme wù nle ncha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Ŋkoŋe wu, fitele fiaŋ yuge njoŋ bɛ wu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">Nlé ŋgê nnyâ Kiyo kaŋ wu le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">wu fêeji bamii ba le gɛ Bajuu le gɛ kune je yì chaaŋ yì wu suune bansa yu.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Gɛ wu nyu wu wâade bɛ bamii gɛ, kɛnɛ wu kune jwe gɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">Gɛ muh nyu wu yu jɛ ye yi bifiaŋ bi jé le gɛ.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Gɛ wu nyu wu mɛ̂sɛ wu ŋgode gane chì ŋgvuusɛ wa gɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Gɛ wu nyu wu jîŋsɛ kin'yesɛ kì bɛde jibejibe gɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">Fi lé fi nyû noo gɛɛŋ bu no wu lé wu fɛ̂ je yì chaaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">yì wu suume bansa yu lé yi sô.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Bamii ba le gɛ Bajuu gɛ bachii lé bo gê bo jîiŋe fwe bo gɛɛ bvufee yi wu le.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bvuŋga bvu Jiso jade faaŋ?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliku 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Bamii bamu ja bo to bɛ muh mu wu feeŋ, wu nyu kinchifɛ, nchɛndaa wu debele nyu yi wu le. Jiso fɛ wu, wu jɛme wu ka yɛde mwɛɛ le. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Jwe yuŋ bamii ba gɛ̀ bee fo bachii, bo tu bo biide lɛ, “Taŋlo muh wunɛ nyu mwa Nfoŋ Dabi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Geenɛ Bafalashii doo bo yu no bo biide noo bo duu lɛ, “Muh wunɛ bvuuse banchɛndaa ba debele banɛ nyu bɛ bvuŋga bvu Bɛsebu wù le nfoŋ wu banchɛndaa ba debele.” <verse eid="MAT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Jiso kɛɛ fiɛɛ fì bo kwaji wu mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nɛ kituŋ ja ki ga ki tu ki juu lɛkilɛki, tu ki lé ki jâ ki tu binfu. Kilaantɛŋ kɛnɛ yeh ja yi gasɛ yi tu juu lɛyilɛyi, yi gɛ ka yi lɛɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/><char style="wj">Nɛ, Sataŋ bvuse ye ye yi muh le, tu wu le wu gasɛ wa ye ye. Nɛ fi le noo, bvunfoŋ bwe gɛ ka bvu lɛɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/><char style="wj">Fi nɛ le lɛ mbvuuse banchɛndaa ba debele nyu bɛ bvuŋga bvu Bɛsebu, tu bena booŋ bvuuse nyu bɛ bvu yɛɛŋ? Fiɛɛ fì booŋ bena bayu gee duunyi lɛ bɛŋ le bɛŋ gwe wa nsa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ nɛ mbvuuse banchɛndaa bayu nyu bɛ bvuŋga bvu Kiyo ki Nyo, tu bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo le bvu to wa fɛ bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ taŋlo muh lee a muh wu bvuŋga yeh, wu kudɛ mwɛɛ mwe wu bu bɛ mu, njɛ wu ya wu koo muh wu bvuŋga wuyu wu kaaŋ sɛŋ? Sege wu le wu kaaŋ noo fɛ wu kudɛ mwɛɛ mwe wu bu bɛ mu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh baaŋ nyu gɛ kimbe kaŋ le gɛ, tu wu banɛ mɛ. Muh le njɛ wu fii mɛ ki be baanyi lo sɛŋ, tu wu saayi lo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/><char style="wj">Noo, nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ Nyo taŋlo wu lɛɛshɛ mwɛɛ mù mbefe mo jɛ́ yì befe yichii yì bamii jɛme. Geenɛ muh wù jɛme jɛ yì befe kune Kiyo ki Yuude, tu gɛ taŋlo Nyo lɛɛshɛ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh jɛme jɛ́ yì befe kune muh wu jee che le Mwamuh, tu taŋlo Nyo lɛɛshɛ jɛ́ yiyu. Geenɛ muh jɛme jɛ yì befe kune Kiyo ki Yuude, tu gɛ taŋlo Nyo yu wu lɛɛshɛ gɛ kɛnɛ nyu kife kinɛ le kɛnɛ kife ki too le.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba kee kite yi muntaŋ mwe le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>
    <char style="wj">Nɛ muh kɛme kite kì joŋe, tu wù kɛme muntaŋ mù njoŋe mù yune yi ki le. Muh nɛ kɛme kite kì befe, tu wù kɛme tɛ muntaŋ mù mbefe mù yune yi ki le. Ba kee kite nyu yi muntaŋ mù yune yi ki le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/><char style="wj">Kiŋgogɛ ki yó lɛ kinɛ, bɛŋ taŋlo bɛŋ ge nɛɛ fɛ bɛŋ jɛme njɛmɛ wù joŋe bɛŋ nyume bamii ba befe? Bɛŋ kêe lɛ fiɛɛ fì le fi yisɛ a fitele fì muh le, le fi fì bude jwe we le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/><char style="wj">Muh wù kɛme nchvu yi mwɛɛ mù njoŋe a fitele fie le, tu wu lé wu bvûuse mwɛɛ mù njoŋe. Nɛ le muh wù kɛme nyu nchvu yi mwɛɛ mù mbefe, tu wu lé wu bvûuse nyu mwɛɛ mù mbefe.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>
    <char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ lé tô nyume juu chi nsa wù fɛkimɛsɛ, muh kɛme ki wu tânyɛ jwe yi jɛ́ yì achiji yì wu gɛ̀ jɛme le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ sege ba sage muh, lé jɛ́ yì bûde jwe we le yì lé yi gê wu yuu, le gɛh tɛ jɛ́ yì bude jwe we le, lé yi gê wu gwe sa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamii bamu tu bo goone lɛ Jiso dunyɛ kiŋgha ki fiɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliku 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Bamii bamu ba gɛ̀ duunyi banchi ba Nyo bɛ Bafalashii mo bo ja bo jɛmɛ Jiso le lɛ, “Muh wu N'yɛyɛ, bee goone lɛ wo ge fiɛɛ fì duunyi bvuŋga bwuŋ bee yɛŋ.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Kiŋgogɛ kì befe kì chinɛ wa Nyo le njɛ kwɛse wu kinjikuu, ki goone ki yɛŋ fiɛɛ fì duunyi bvuŋga bwaŋ le! Gɛ taŋlo ndunyɛ fiɛɛ kiŋgogɛ kinɛ le fede fi muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Jona gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/><char style="wj">No Jona gɛ̀ che a biɛŋ yì kuge shɛŋ yi aju le atade bɛ bintaŋ bitɛde, le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wù nyû antɛnɛɛ a nshɛŋ yi aju le atade bɛ bintaŋ bitɛde.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/><char style="wj">Lé doo nyûme juu chi nsa wù fɛkimɛsɛ, bamii ba Ninibɛ lɛɛŋ bɛ kiŋgogɛ ki mɛɛse kinɛ ki ge ba leesɛ ki yi ŋgɛ le, nje bo, bamii ba Ninibɛ gɛ̀ yu fiɛɛ fì Jona feeji, bo kusɛ kinche kiboo. Geenɛ bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, muh le fɛnɛ bɛ fiɛɛ fì kuge fi fede fi Jona.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/><char style="wj">Lé tô nyu juu chì fɛkimɛsɛ Yaa wù gɛ̀ sage kituŋ kì Shɛba wu lɛɛŋ bɛ kiŋgogɛ ki mɛɛse kinɛ wu leesɛ ki ŋgɛ le, nje wu gɛ̀ ja a kituŋ ke le a woŋ juuse yo ki wu tô wu yu bvufee bvu Nfoŋ Salamoŋ. Geenɛ bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, muh mu le fɛnɛ bɛ fiɛɛ fì kuge fi fede fi Salamoŋ.</char><verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>
    <char style="wj">Kiyo kì yiide to ki bu ye yi muh le ki gɛɛŋ nchvuuŋ ki tu ki goone fɛ ki lé ki chêe fo. Geenɛ ki doo ki gooŋ sɛŋ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/><char style="wj">ki mo ki jɛ̂mɛ kikwɛɛ ke le lɛ, ‘Nlé ŋkâasɛ ntû a mɛ yeh fɛ nchi mbu fo.’ Sege ki kaasɛ ki tu jiŋ ki yɛŋ yeh le fiɛɛ nyu gɛ yu gɛ, ba yɛɛsɛ ba seesɛ yi yuude,</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/><char style="wj">noo ki mo ki kâasɛ ki gɛɛŋ, ki to bɛ biyo bimi bvusooshwi bì befe bì fede ki, bɛ bi mo bi to bi lee bi chee fo. Mwɛɛ mo mu mɛsɛ mu fo lo fɛ mwɛdɛ le segeyu fede no mu chi shee mu nyume. Le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no fi lé fi nyû fɛ kiŋgogɛ kì befe ki mɛɛse kinɛ le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamii ba le kfuu chi Jiso le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliku 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Gɛh no Jiso gɛ̀ baaŋ wu yɛyi bamii noo, fi kooshɛ lɛ bwe Jiso bɛ booŋ ba bwe Jiso gɛ̀ to bo lɛɛŋ akfuuŋ bo goone lɛ bɛ bo jɛmɛ. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Muh mu jɛmɛ Jiso le lɛ, “Bwoo bɛ booŋ ba bwoo lɛme akfuuŋ bo goone lɛ bena bo jɛmɛ.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛ baŋwa ba kege bamu ba bo gɛ̀ ya saŋ jɛ Nyo yo kɛme kinchiŋ kinɛ gɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Wu biih wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bwɛɛŋ le yɛɛŋ, booŋ ba bwɛɛŋ le baaŋ?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>No wu bile noo, wu mo wu looŋ bamii be ba ŋgoo, wu du lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bwɛɛŋ bɛ booŋ ba bwɛɛŋ le banɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ muh wuchii wù gee fiɛɛ fì Chii wu fɛwe goone le wu wù le mwa bwaaŋ bɛ jɛme yaŋ mo bwɛɛŋ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="ms">Baŋgaŋ kune bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-50">13:1-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune muh wù gɛ̀ nooŋ muntaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliku 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Gɛh abvu, Jiso ja wu bu yeh, wu gɛɛŋ wu shii mbebe mamasi le. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Kinchvu ki bamii kì baaŋ taashɛ mbebe ye le nɛ gɛmm. Wu mo wu ja wu lee wu shii nyu a ŋguh le a joo, kinchvu kiyu lɛme kwa ŋgɛɛme yi joo le. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Wu jɛme mwɛɛ wesee a baŋgaŋ le bo le. Wu gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Muh gɛ̀ la ki wu gɛ̂ɛŋ wu noŋ muntaŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/><char style="wj">Wu gɛ̀ doo wu nooŋ, mumu gwe a je, munyii to mu tajɛ mu ji.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/><char style="wj">Muntaŋ mumu gwe fɛ kijusɛ ki ata le nshɛŋ nyu gɛ fo chuule gɛ, mu mo mu yaŋsɛ mu bu nje gɛ nshɛŋ gɛ̀ bee fo chuule gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/><char style="wj">Muu gɛ̀ doo wu kɛ wu baaŋ wu suŋ muntaŋ muyu. No mu baaŋ a chimɛ gɛ gɛŋ chuule gɛ, mu mo mu yunɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/><char style="wj">Mumu muntaŋ gwe yi mbiaŋ le. Mbiaŋ yiyu kuu yi mo yi baŋɛ muntaŋ muyu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/><char style="wj">Muntaŋ mumu gwe nyu yi nshɛŋ yì joŋe le, mu buujɛ, mu ku mu yuŋ chuule. Binyi bimi nyu ajii gwii, bimi mbambvusoo, bimi mbanshɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/><char style="wj">Muh wù kɛme bintuŋ, wu yu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fi ge fɛ Jiso jɛme a baŋgaŋ le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliku 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo ja bo kɛŋsɛ bo gɛɛŋ bo biih wu le lɛ, “Le nje la wù wo jɛme bamii banɛ le nyu a baŋgaŋ le?” <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Wu chvuu bo le lɛ,<char style="wj">“Le bɛŋ ba Nyo le wu ge lɛ taŋlo bɛŋ kee mwɛɛ mu bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe mù le nyilɛ le. Geenɛ wu baaŋ ge gɛ lɛ taŋlo bamii banɛ kɛɛ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ muh wù kɛme fiɛɛ lé ba nyû ba ge ba bisɛ wu kɛme fi duude. Muh wù kɛme gɛ mo fiɛɛ fì shige fì wù kɛme ba lé ba fî lo a wu le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/><char style="wj">Nɛ fiɛɛ fì njɛme bo le nyu a baŋgaŋ le, nje bo jiiŋe gɛh lo mwɛɛ bo yɛde gɛ, bo yege gɛh lo mwɛɛ, bo yuge gɛ, kɛnɛ bo kee gɛ mu gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/><char style="wj">Fiɛɛ fi muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Yosaya gɛ̀ jɛme le fi kojɛ chuule bɛ fiɛɛ fì bamii banɛ gee. Wu gɛ̀ jɛme lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ yêge mwɛɛ, geenɛ bɛŋ yuge gɛ. Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ jîiŋe mwɛɛ, geenɛ bɛŋ yɛde gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/><char style="wj">Nje muntele mu bamii banɛ le mu jiɛ wa, bintuŋ biboo le bi chiinyɛ wa, bo le bo baŋɛ wa ajii aboo. Bo ge noo lɛ fɛ bo yɛ̂ne mwɛɛ le bɛ ajii aboo gɛ, bo yuge mwɛɛ bɛ bintuŋ biboo gɛ, muntele muboo kee gɛ, bo mo bo kaasɛ bo tu jiŋ fɛ mɛne, nfɛ bo.’</char><verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Geenɛ, njoŋ wù baaŋ le wene nje ajii a wene yɛde mwɛɛ le, bintuŋ biɛna yuge mwɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo wesee bɛ bamii ba chaaŋ bamu gɛ̀ shee bo beede ki bo yɛŋ mwɛɛ mù bɛŋ yɛne le, bo gɛ baaŋ yɛŋ gɛ. Bo tu bo beede tɛ ki bo yu mwɛɛ mù bɛŋ yuge, bo gɛ baaŋ yu gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fiɛɛ fì ŋgaŋ kune muh wù gɛ̀ nooŋ muntaŋ duunyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliku 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ yu la fiɛɛ fì ŋgaŋ wɛɛ wù kune muh wù gɛ̀ nooŋ muntaŋ duunyi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/><char style="wj">Muh wù yuge fiɛɛ kune bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe wu ya kee gɛ kinyi kiyu gɛ, Sataŋ wu muh wu kimbefɛ mo wu to wu chufɛ jɛ yì ba bonɛ fɛ fitele fie le yi bu. Finɛ fiɛɛ le muntaŋ mù ba gɛ̀ doo ba nooŋ mu gwe a je.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/><char style="wj">Muntaŋ mù gɛ̀ gwe fɛ kijusɛ ki ata le, le bamii ba yuge jɛ yi Nyo bo mo bo fi lo kimimia bɛ njoŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, yi baaŋ a chimɛ gɛ gɛŋ fɛ muntele muboo le gɛ. Yi lɛme gɛh nɛ shige. Nɛ ŋgɛ le wu to kɛnɛ bamii boone nyu bikaa a wu jiŋ nje jɛ yiyu, wu mo wu chii bikaa kimimia.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/><char style="wj">Muntaŋ mù ba gɛ̀ noŋ mu gwe yi mbiaŋ le, le muh wù yuge jɛ yi Nyo, nfuuŋsɛ wu mwɛɛ mu yi woŋ kfunɛ le, mo bɛ kiŋkoŋɛ ki bvukugɛ taashɛ mu baŋɛ jɛ yiyu yi laayɛ lo achiji.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/><char style="wj">Muntaŋ mù ba gɛ̀ noŋ yì nshɛŋ yi joŋe le, le muh wù yuge jɛ yiyu, wu yuge chuule wù gee no yi goone njɛ muntaŋ mù yuŋ mumu nya ajii gwii, mumu ajii mbambvusoo, mumu mbaanshɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune muntaŋ mu agiŋ bɛ mu agaaŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Jiso ka wu ma ŋgaŋ wumu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe taŋlo ba beji bɛ muh mu wù gɛ̀ gɛnɛ wu noŋ muntaŋ mù njoŋe mù le mu agiŋ a wù mwɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/><char style="wj">Bamii doo bo leefɛ, muh we wu kimbanɛ gɛɛŋ wu noŋ muntaŋ mu agaaŋ yo mù fiɛɛnɛ mu agiŋ, wu mo wu ja.</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Agaaŋ kanɛ le a ba tɛŋe a jɛ yi bala le lɛ “darnel” ŋgo yiyu nyume nlo.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/><char style="wj">Agiŋ ayu gɛ̀ doo wo ku wo kɛ wo fuuse, muntaŋ mu agaaŋ mwɛɛ mo mu yɛɛŋ tɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/><char style="wj">Bamii ba lɛme ba muh mwɛ kwɛɛ bo to bo biih wu le lɛ, ‘Chiji kikwɛɛ, wo gɛ̀ doo wo noŋ muntaŋ mwɛne nyu mu agiŋ, mu agaaŋ kanɛ jiɛnyi nɛɛ fɛ mu nyu yu ntɛŋ?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/><char style="wj">Wu chvuu bo le lɛ, ‘Ge gɛh muh waŋ wu kimbanɛ fiɛɛ fiyu fiɛɛ.’ Bamii ba lɛme bayu biih wu le lɛ, ‘Wo goone lɛ bee gɛɛŋ be juumɛ?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/><char style="wj">Chiji kikwɛɛ wuboo faŋ wu jɛme bo le lɛ, ‘Taŋlo bɛŋ doo bɛŋ juume bɛŋ ja bɛŋ baayi tɛ agiŋ yu ntɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ chînɛ mu ku munchii gɛɛŋ bu kife ki ŋgwejɛ. Nɛ doo nyume kife ki ŋgwejɛ le, ndu bamii ba gweji le lɛ bo ya bo juumɛ agaaŋ ayu bo banyɛ bo yilɛ bo gɛɛ bibi le bibi le, bo ge bo toŋ, bo mo bo banyɛ agiŋ bo gɛɛ a ŋwaŋ waŋ le.’”</char><figure style="fig" alt="Wheat harvest" file="lb00098c.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 13:30" copy="Louise Bass" ref="13:30">Agiŋ</figure><verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune jise chi fintaŋ fimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliku 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Jiso ka wu ma ŋgaŋ wumu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe le njɛ ŋgo yi fintaŋ fimi, fì muh gɛ̀ jo wu noŋ a wu mwɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/><char style="wj">Fintaŋ finɛ fi nyoonyi ajii baaŋ fi fede muntaŋ munchii. Geenɛ, sege fi bu, fi ku fi kugɛ fi fe munte munchii, fi mo fi ja fi tu kite kì munyii mù fuune we to mu joone yi chɛ́ yiyu le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune kinshilɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Wu ka wu ma ŋgaŋ wumu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe le njɛ kinshilɛ kì kwɛse gɛ̀ fe mune bintee bì baaŋ baaŋ bitɛde, wu jo wu fiiŋsɛ yu, wu tojɛ wu gɛɛ, fi mo fi ge mune chiyu bɛɛnyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Jiso gɛ̀ jɛme mwɛɛ munɛ munchii kinchvu ki bamii le nyu a baŋgaŋ le. Nchiɛɛŋ, gɛ wù gɛ̀ bee ki wu jɛ̂me fiɛɛ bo le fuge a ŋgaŋ le sɛŋ gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Wu gɛ̀ gee noo, ki fi gê fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wumu gɛ̀ jɛmɛ wa lɛ, “Sege nlé ŋgwênyɛ jwe waŋ bûde gɛh nyu baŋgaŋ. Nlé ŋgê mbwaashɛ mwɛɛ mù gɛ̀ bee nyilɛ le kɛge no ba gɛ̀ fɛ woŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fiɛɛ fì ŋgaŋ kune muntaŋ mu agiŋ bɛ mu agaaŋ duunyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Jiso ja wu chinɛ kinchvu ki bamii le wu lee wu gɛɛŋ yeh. Booŋ be ba ŋgoo bi bo biih wu le lɛ, “Gɛh yuusɛ bee fiɛɛ fì ŋgaŋ kune agaaŋ a mwɛne ayu duunyi.” <verse eid="MAT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Muh wù nooŋ muntaŋ mù njoŋe le muh wù jee che le Mwamuh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/><char style="wj">Mwɛ le woŋ kfunɛ. Muntaŋ mù njoŋe duunyi booŋ ba le bɛ bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo. Agaaŋ nyu booŋ ba le ba muh wu kimbefɛ wɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/><char style="wj">Muh wu kimbanɛ wù gɛ̀ noŋ muntaŋ muyu nyu debele. Kife ki ŋgwejɛ le kife ki woŋ kfunɛ lé wu gê wu ka. Bamii ba ŋgwejɛ le banchɛndaa ba Nyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/><char style="wj">Gɛh no bo gɛ̀ juumɛ agaaŋ bo baanyi bo tone bɛ ŋgu, le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no fi lé fi nyûme yi kife kì woŋ lé wu ka.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/><char style="wj">Muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gê wu chiiŋsɛ banchɛndaa be, bo jiɛnyɛ bo baanyɛ mwɛɛ munchii mù too bɛ kimbefɛ mo bamii ba gee bimbefɛ bachii wu bvusɛ a bvunfoŋ bwe le,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/><char style="wj">wu noŋ fɛ kimbvulɛ ki ŋgu le. Lé fɛ̂ bamii lé bo gê bo beede bo ŋgeji bige fo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/><char style="wj">Noo, bamii ba chaaŋ bâaŋ njɛ juu a bvunfoŋ bvu Chiji bo le. Muh wù kɛme bintuŋ wu yû.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune nchvu mo mbele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>
    <char style="wj">Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe le njɛ nchvu yì muh gɛ̀ jo wu gɛɛŋ wu nyilɛ mwɛne. Muh mu gɛ̀ to wu yɛŋ wu mo wu kaasɛ wu baŋɛ, wu kwɛɛde njoŋ yuu lo wu. Wu mo wu gɛɛŋ wu gesɛ mwɛɛ mwe munchii mù wu gɛ̀ kɛme, wu gɛɛŋ wu gu mwɛ kwɛɛ yu.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>
    <char style="wj">Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe ka nyume njɛ muh wu waaŋ wumu wù gɛ̀ jiɛnyi wu goone ajii a mbele a joŋe nɛ chuule.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/><char style="wj">Wu gɛ̀ doo wu goone, wu gɛɛŋ wu yɛŋ wumu le nyu wu tɛɛme kwa. Wu mo wu gɛɛŋ wu gesɛ mwɛɛ mwe munchii mu wù gɛ̀ kɛme wu gɛɛŋ wu gu jise chi mbele chiyu.</char><verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune gwii wu bíɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>
    <char style="wj">Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe ka nyume gɛh njɛ gwii wù ba gɛ̀ nooŋ a joo, kfuu chi bíɛŋ yichii taashɛ yu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/><char style="wj">wu yisɛ. Bamii mo bo chii bo bvusɛ kwa, bo shii fɛkuu, bo cha bíɛŋ yì joŋe bo gɛɛ a ŋkáa le, bo noŋ yì befe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/><char style="wj">Lé gɛh no lé tô nyume kife kì woŋ lé wu ka. Banchɛndaa ba Nyo bu bo to bo gasɛ bamii ba befe a ba chaaŋ le,</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/><char style="wj">wu noŋ fɛ kimbvulɛ ki ŋgu le, Lé fɛ̂ bamii lé bo gê bo beede bo ŋgeji bige fo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Jiso mo wu biih booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ le bɛŋ yu mwɛɛ munɛ munchii chuule?”</char> Bo bɛɛŋ lɛ, “Ɛɛŋ.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Wu mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Fi mo fi nyume lɛ, muh wuchii wù duunyi banchi ba Nyo le wù ba le ba yɛyɛ wa wu kune bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le njɛ chiji yeh wù kɛme nchvu, wu taŋlo wu bvusɛ mwɛɛ mwe munfɛŋ kɛnɛ mù kege yo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba faŋ Jiso ntɛ we le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliku 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Jiso mɛsɛ wu ma baŋgaŋ banɛ, wu mo wu ja yo, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>wu gɛɛŋ ntɛ we le, wu gɛɛŋ wu lee wu tu wu yɛyi bamii yeh yiboo yi buunɛ le. Bo yuge n'yɛyɛ we bo kɛme lo ŋgha, bo mo bo kɛ bo tu bo maŋe lɛ, “Muh wunɛ jo faaŋ bvunɛ bvufee bvù baaŋ bɛ bvuŋga bvù wu gee biŋgha bi mwɛɛ yu nɛ? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Le gɛ mwa chiji la wunɛ wu kaane bite? Gɛ bwee nyu Mɛɛle gɛ? Gɛ booŋ ba bwee nyu Jɛm bɛ Yosɛf mo Samoŋ bɛ Juda gɛ? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Gɛ jɛ́me ye yichii nyume besa bo fɛnɛ gɛ? Muh wunɛ ja faaŋ bɛ mwɛɛ munɛ munchii nɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>No bo ghaade noo bo mo bo faŋ lo wu. Noo Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ba to ba ŋgvuune muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo manjuu le manchii, fuge gɛh woŋ we le, bɛ a kfuu che le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Jiso faŋ ki wu ka wu ge biŋgha bi mwɛɛ yo wesee, nje bo gɛ̀ baaŋ leesɛ gɛ muntele yi wu le gɛ.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Kune kwe yi Joŋ Nlesɛajoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliku 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Gɛ̀ bee kife kiyu le, Nfoŋ Hɛlod wù gɛ̀ sage kimbe ki woŋ kì Galalee le, yu kune lɛme chi Jiso. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Wu jɛmɛ bachiji woŋ be le lɛ, muh wunɛ le Joŋ Nlesɛajoo wu kaase wu bu yi kwe le. Nɛ fiɛɛ fì ge fɛ wu kɛ̂me bvuŋga ki wu gêe biŋgha bi mwɛɛ munɛ nɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Fi le lɛ, Hɛlod gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ ba koo Joŋ, ba kaaŋ, ba faa yeh yi ncha le, nje Hɛlodia wù kwɛ Filib wù mwa bwe Hɛlod, Hɛlod gɛ̀ jo kwɛɛ le. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Joŋ faŋ wu du lɛ nchi baaŋ bɛɛŋ gɛ lɛ wu jo wu kwɛɛ le gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Hɛlod mo wu goone je yì wu yuuyɛ Joŋ yu, geenɛ wu faane bamii, njɛ bamii gɛ̀ kɛme Joŋ njɛ muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Lɛ to nyu juu chi Nfoŋ Hɛlod gɛ̀ gee ŋka ki wu kwâjɛ juu chì ba gɛ̀ boyɛ wu, mwa Hɛlodia wù kwɛse lee wu chɛŋ bine a bamii ba gɛ̀ bee fɛ ŋka wɛɛ le, Hɛlod yɛŋ nɛ ye yufɛ wu. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Wu mo wu ka mwa wɛɛ, wu ji leh lɛ wu lé wu fâyɛ wu mo nyu bɛ la fì wu lé wu bîih lɛ wu fayɛ wu yu. <verse eid="MAT 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Bwe mwa wɛɛ mo wu nyiisɛ mwa wu dû lɛ wu nyâ kikwɛɛ ki Joŋ Nlesɛajoo a kidɛŋ le, wu le. <verse eid="MAT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Wu jɛmɛ, Nfoŋ Hɛlod yu noo, ye wooŋ lo wu. Geenɛ nje leh wù wu gɛ̀ ji wa fwe a bamii ba gɛ̀ bee fɛ ŋka wɛɛ le, wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ ba ge no mwa ye jɛme. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Wu mo wu tuŋ bamii bo gɛɛŋ yeh yi ncha le, bo bvusɛ kikwɛɛ ki Joŋ, <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>bo to bɛ ki a kidɛŋ le bo nya mwa wù kwɛse wɛɛ le, wu mo wu gɛɛŋ wu nya bwee le. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Joŋ gɛɛŋ bo jo gvunɛ chi Joŋ bo jiiyɛ, bo gɛɛŋ bo sɛɛŋ saaka wuyu Jiso le.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso nyaŋɛ bamii banchvuge batɛŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliku 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joŋ 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Jiso doo wu yu fiɛɛ fì kooshi bɛ Joŋ, wu mo wu lee a ŋguh le wu kɛŋsɛ yo wu gɛɛŋ fɛ bamii gɛ̀ bee gɛ fo gɛ. Geenɛ binchvu bi bamii yu, bo mo bo bu a bilaantɛŋ le bo jiɛnyi bɛ bikaa bo bii wu le. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Wu bu a ŋguh le wu doo wu fɛsɛ kwa, wu yɛŋ kinchvu ki bamii le nɛ mamama. Yii koo wu bɛ bo, wu mo wu tu wu fɛde bamii ba gɛ̀ chɛne. <verse eid="MAT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Lɛ doo nyume fɛnfu, booŋ be ba ŋgoo kɛŋsɛ bo jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Fɛnɛ le kwa, juu gɛɛŋ wa, du lɛ bamii banɛ gɛɛŋ bantɛ le bo gu mwɛɛ muboo munjile.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ fi nyu lɛ bo ja gɛ. Le bɛŋ, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ nyâ bo fiɛɛ fì bo lé bo jî.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Bo chvuu wu le lɛ, “Bee kɛme gɛh nyu chefe yi blɛd yishɛŋ bɛ bíɛŋ yifiɛɛ maa.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ to bɛŋ nya mɛne.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Wu mo wu du kinchvu ki bamii kiyu le lɛ ki shiiyɛ fɛkuu yi agaaŋ le. Wu jo chefe yi yishɛŋ chiɛɛ bɛ bíɛŋ yi yifiɛɛ, wu bijɛ we, wu nya kiyone Nyo le, wu mo wu bwɛɛyɛ wu nya chefe yiyu booŋ be ba ŋgoo le, bo gajɛ kinchvu kiyu le. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Bamii bachii ji bo fuu. Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo baanyɛ bimbɛge bì gɛ̀ shɛshɛ bi yisɛ ŋkáa yuufe ncho yifiɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Bamii ba gɛ̀ ji mwɛɛ munjile muyu gɛ̀ bee bilɛŋsɛ njɛ banchvuge batɛŋ, fɛ nyu bikɛse bɛ booŋ.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso jiɛnyɛ yi joo le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliku 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joŋ 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Jiso mo wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ bo lee a ŋguh le bo sa fwe wuŋ kwege, wu shɛ̂ɛ wu yɛsɛ kinchvu ki bamii le lɛ ki kwɛɛde. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Wu gɛ̀ shɛɛ wu yɛsɛ bo, wu mo wu ja wu bɛɛŋ yi mbegɛ le wu maa ki wu gɛ̂ɛŋ wu buunɛ. Akfuuŋ gɛ̀ jiiŋ wù nyu gɛh fo wu maa. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Geenɛ kife kiyu le, ŋguh gɛ̀ bee wa fɛ joo ntɛnɛɛ je yì ndefe le kwa, joo kɛde bɛ wu, nje fii gɛ̀ too je fwe yi chide wu. <verse eid="MAT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Lɛ to nyume wa an'yule, Jiso ja wu too fɛ bo le wu jiɛnyi yi joo le. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo doo bo yɛŋ no wu jiɛnyi yi joo le, njaŋ koo bo. Bo tu bo duu lɛ, “Le kiyi kimu.” Bo tu bo wanɛ fɛwɛɛwe bɛ nfaaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Kimimia Jiso mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ jîjɛ muntele mwɛna le, le mɛ. Keefɛ bɛŋ fâane gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Bita jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Tada nɛ le wo, wo jɛmɛ njiɛnyɛ tɛ yi joo le nto fɛ wo le.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo, tôo la!”</char> Noo, Bita mo wu bu a ŋguh le wu tu wu jiɛnyi yi joo le wu gɛɛne fɛ Jiso le. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>No wu gɛ̀ jiɛnyi wu gɛɛne, wu doo wu yɛŋ no fii gee, wu tu wu faane, wu kɛ wu tu wu shiide a joo. No wu shiide wu mo wu bee lɛ, “Tada fi mɛ!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Kimimia Jiso noŋ kibo wu jijɛ wu le, wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“O oo, mbɛmɛ wo baaŋ shige! Wo be kɛme kimaŋɛ nje la?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Bɛ wu mo bo bɛɛŋ bo lee a ŋguh le, fii yiyu mo yi lu. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba gɛ̀ bee a ŋguh le bo mo bo nya ŋgvunɛ wu le bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Nchiɛɛŋ, wo le Mwa Nyo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ bamii ba binchɛŋ Gɛnesalɛt</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliku 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Bo daŋ mamasi bo bu kimbe ki Gɛnesalɛt le kwa. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Bamii ba yo yɛŋ wu le, bo kɛɛ wu, bo mo bo chiiŋsɛ ntuŋ kimbe kiyu le kichii, bamii tu bo too bɛ bamii ba binchɛŋ bachii fɛ Jiso le, <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>bo lɛge lɛ wu chînɛ bo kuŋ gɛh nyu jwe wù nju ye le. Muh wuchii wù gɛ̀ kune, mo wu tɛmɛ.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kune kinche ki woŋ bɛ jɛ yi Nyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliku 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Bafalashii bɛ bamii bamu ba gɛ̀ duunyi banchi ba Nyo gɛ̀ ja Yɛlusalɛm bo to fɛ Jiso le bo biih wu le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Le nje la wù booŋ buŋ ba ŋgoo chɛŋe bɛ kinche ki woŋ ki bachiji besa ba fweele? Gɛ bo chuge chiaaŋ a je yì nchi goone le, fɛ bo jii mwɛɛ gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Le nje la wù bɛŋ ŋgode fiena banchi ba Nyo, bɛŋ bii nyu kinche kena ki woŋ le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/><char style="wj">Njɛme nɛ, nje Nyo le wu du lɛ, ‘Ŋgvuuŋ chijo bɛ bwoo.’ Wu ka wu du tɛ lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh naŋ lo chiji kɛnɛ bwee, ba yuuyɛ lo mwɛdɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, bɛŋ tu bɛŋ duu fiena lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh ja wu jɛme chiji le kɛnɛ bwee le lɛ, “Fiɛɛ fì wo bee wo kɛme chiaaŋ yaŋ le nnya wa Nyo le”, tu gɛ taŋlo bɛŋ ka bɛŋ jo fiɛɛ fiyu bɛŋ fih chiji wene yu kɛnɛ bwee wene yu gɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/><char style="wj">Le nɛ no bɛŋ bii kinche kena ki woŋ le bɛŋ gee jɛ yi Nyo tuu fiɛɛ fì achiji.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/><char style="wj">Bamii ba jɛme yeye bo gee yeye banɛ. Fiɛɛ fì muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Yosaya gɛ̀ jɛme kune bɛŋ le nchiɛɛŋ, no wu gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">‘Bamii banɛ ŋgvuune mɛ gɛh fɛmu fɛmu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="wj">muntele muboo nyu je yì ndefe le fɛ mɛne.</char><verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Bo yuuse mɛ nyu achiji,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="wj">nje bo jode mwɛɛ mù bamii kwaji bo yɛyi lɛ le jɛ yaŋ.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fiɛɛ fì taŋlo fi chɛŋɛ bɛ muh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliku 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Jiso ja wu tɛɛŋ bamii bo to. Wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, bɛŋ kɛ̂ɛ chuule. </char> <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/><char style="wj">Gɛ fiɛɛ fì lese a muh mu taŋlo fi yiisɛ wu gɛ. Le fiɛɛ fì bude lo a muh mu fì taŋlo fi yiisɛ wu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo ja bo to bo jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Wo kee gɛ lɛ Bafalashii be bo yu fiɛɛ fì wo be jɛme fiɛɛ fì gwe fɛ fitele fiboo le?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Wu chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Kite kichii kì le njɛ yile chii wù le fɛwe sɛŋ ba lé ba bâa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ daayɛ a bo le, le binfeeŋ bì duunyi je bamii le. Nɛ kinfeeŋ duunyi je kimi le, tu bo bachii lé bo gɛ̂ɛŋ bo gwe a kintuge le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Bita jɛmɛ Jiso le lɛ, “Gɛh yuusɛ bee fiɛɛ fì ŋgaŋ wɛɛ jɛme.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Jiso biih lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ bɛŋ tɛ kee mwɛɛ gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/><char style="wj">Gɛ bɛŋ kee lɛ fiɛɛ fichii fì lese a muh mu boge a shɛŋ fi ge fi fe fi bu lo gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, fiɛɛ fì bude jwe wu muh le jade nyu fɛ fitele le. Le fi fì yiise muh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/><char style="wj">Fi jade nyu fɛ fitele le fɛ muh kɛme ŋkwajɛ wù befe, ki muh yu muh, ki muh jo kwɛ muh kɛnɛ juma muh, muh jaŋ kinjaŋ, ki muh choŋ bvuchoŋ, ki muh bɛɛ jiŋ yi nsa wu chimbiaŋ, kɛnɛ ki muh chɛŋɛ bɛ jee chi muh.</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/><char style="wj">Munɛ le mwɛɛ mù taŋlo mu yiisɛ muh. Gɛ ki muh ji bɛ chiaaŋ njɛ wu chugɛ sɛŋ taŋlo fi yiisɛ muh gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɛse wumu wù gɛ̀ bee ntolo leesɛ fitele yi Jiso le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliku 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Jiso ja fo wu kɛŋsɛ yo wu gɛɛŋ kimbe ki Taya bɛ Sidoŋ le. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ kwɛse wumu wu Kanan wù gɛ̀ bee yo gɛ̀ ja wu to wu yɛŋ Jiso le, wu bee fɛ wu le lɛ, “O Tada, mwa Nfoŋ Dabi, koo yii fɛ mɛne. Mwa yaŋ wù kwɛse le nchɛndaa wu debele fiinɛ bɛ wu baaŋ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Geenɛ Jiso yu wu gɛ ghaa lo gɛ. Booŋ be ba ŋgoo kɛŋsɛ bo to bo lɛgɛ wu bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Du kwɛse wunɛ le lɛ wu gɛ̂ɛne. Wu bii wu nyaa njiɛɛsɛ bee le.” <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Jiso chvuu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ba gɛ̀ tuŋ mɛ nyu fɛ bamii ba Ishwala le maa ba le njɛ shóŋ yi ja wa yi lɛsɛ lo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Geenɛ kwɛse wɛɛ ja gɛh wu to wu tuŋ anyuu a Jiso jii wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Tada, fih gɛh mɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ fi nyu chuule ki jo ŋgu yi booŋ noŋ bvú le gɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Kwɛse wuyu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Le nchiɛɛŋ chii. Geenɛ bvú to yi boonyi munchvuge mu chiji bo sege wu jii mu gweeyi.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Jiso mo wu chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“O kwɛse wunɛ, mbɛmɛ wo tɛɛme lo. Fi kooshɛ fɛ wo le no wo goone.”</char> Gɛh noo mwa ye mo wu tɛmɛ.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso nyaŋɛ bamii banchvuge banɛh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja fo wu gɛɛne, wu fede mbebe Mamasi wu Galalee le, bo bɛɛŋ bo gɛɛŋ yi mbegɛ le, wu shii fo. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Kinchvu kì bamii ki baaŋ to fɛ wu le nɛ gɛmm. Bamu gɛ̀ too bɛ bamii ba le batɛŋlaase, mo ba le biŋkɛlɛ, mo ba le binfeeŋ, mo ba le binchifɛ, mo bamu ba chɛne wesee. No bo too bɛ bo, bo gɛɛde a wu jii wu fɛde bo. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Kinchvu kiyu tu ki kɛme lo kimaŋe no bo gɛ̀ yɛde binchifɛ jɛme, bamii ba le biŋkɛlɛ tɛɛme, batɛŋlaase jiɛnyi tɛ chaaŋ, binfeeŋ yɛde mwɛɛ le. Bo tu bo tume maŋkuŋ ma Nyo wu bamii ba Ishwala.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliku 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Jiso tɛɛŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ŋkɛme yii fɛ kinchvu kinɛ le, nje bo le wa besa bo aju atade, fiɛɛ fì bo ji nyume gɛ yu gɛ. Gɛ ŋkoŋe lɛ nchinɛ bo le bo gɛɛne jɛŋ gɛ, nje taŋlo bo gɛɛŋ bo gwe jɛŋ aje.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Taŋlo besabɛŋ jo faaŋ mwɛɛ munjile nchvuuŋ kfunɛ mù kojɛ ki ba nyaŋɛ kfuu chi kinchvu ki bamii kinɛ yu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Jiso biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kɛme chefe yi blɛd yimiɛɛ?” </char> Bo chvuu lɛ, “Le bvusooshwi bɛ bíɛŋ nɛ shige.” <verse eid="MAT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Jiso mo wu du lɛ kinchvu ki bamii kiyu shii fɛkuu <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Bo shiiyɛ, wu jo chefe yi blɛd yi bvusooshwi chiɛɛ mo bíɛŋ chiɛɛ, wu nya kiyone Nyo le, wu bwɛɛyɛ wu nya booŋ be ba ŋgoo le, bo gajɛ bamii bayu le. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Muh wuchii ji, wu fuu. Bo baanyɛ bimbɛge bì gɛ̀ shɛshɛ, bi yisɛ ŋkáa bvusooshwi. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Bamii ba gɛ̀ ji gɛ̀ bee bilɛŋsɛ banchvuge banɛh, fɛ nyu bikɛse bɛ booŋ. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Wu mo wu chinɛ kinchvu kiyu le ki kwɛɛde. Wu lee a ŋguh le wu gɛɛŋ kimbe ki Magadaŋ le.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Bamii bamu goone lɛ Jiso ge kiŋgha ki fiɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliku 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Bafalashii bɛ Basadushii ja bo to fɛ Jiso le ki bo moŋ wu, bo mo bo jɛmɛ lɛ wu ge fiɛɛ fì duunyi bvuŋga bvù ja fɛwe. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ge doo nyume sege juu seele kibvulɛ yɛɛde lo, bɛŋ du lɛ, ‘Akfuuŋ bude wo joŋ’, nje bɛŋ le bɛŋ yɛŋ lɛ kibvulɛ yɛɛde lo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/><char style="wj">Ge doo nyume sege juu saane, kibvulɛ yɛɛde, kimbɛ shugɛ, bɛŋ du lɛ, ‘Nfuŋ lé wu fê abɛŋ’, nje bɛŋ le bɛŋ yɛŋ kibvulɛ yɛɛde kimbɛ shugɛ. Bɛŋ kee ki bɛŋ jîŋɛ kibvulɛ bɛŋ mo bɛŋ kɛɛ no akfuuŋ lé a nyûme, geenɛ bɛŋ ya kee gɛ banjiŋɛ ba mwɛɛ mù kooshi yi kife kinɛ le duunyi gɛ nje la?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/><char style="wj">Kiŋgogɛ kì befe kinɛ kì le ki chinɛ wa Nyo le ki tu njɛ kwɛse wu kinjikuu, ki goone fiɛɛ fì duunyi bvuŋga bvu jade fɛwe. Gɛ taŋlo ndunyɛ fiɛɛ ki le, fede fi muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Jona gɛ.”</char> No wu jɛmɛ noo wu mo wu chinɛ bo le wu ja wu gɛɛne.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso teefɛ booŋ be lɛ bo yɛ̂ne kune gee chi Bafalashii bɛ Basadushii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliku 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo doo bo fɛsɛ wuŋ kwege bo yɛŋ lɛ bo le bo daayɛ ki bo jo blɛd. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yɛ̂ne, bɛŋ ka jode kife yi kinshilɛ ki Bafalashii mo ki Basadushii le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo mo bo kɛ bo jɛme lɛbolɛbo kune fiɛɛ fiyu, bo duu lɛ, “Wu jɛme kinshilɛ kinɛ nɛ nje besabɛŋ baaŋ to gɛ bɛ blɛd gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Jiso kɛɛ fiɛɛ fì bo jɛme kune fi wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“O oo bamii ba mbɛmɛ wù shige banɛ! Bɛŋ jɛme lɛbɛŋlɛbɛŋ kune blɛd wù bɛŋ baaŋ kɛme gɛ nje la?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ baaŋ mwɛɛ le a yɛŋ gɛ? Gɛ bɛŋ kwaji chefe yi blɛd yishɛŋ yì bamii chi ji banchvuge batɛŋ gɛ? Bimbɛge bì bɛŋ chi baanyɛ chi bee ŋkáa yimiɛɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/><char style="wj">Gɛ bɛŋ ka kwaji tɛ chefe yi blɛd yì bvusooshwi yì bamii chi ji banchvuge banɛh gɛ? Bɛŋ chi bɛŋ baanyɛ bimbɛge bu ŋkáa yimiɛɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/><char style="wj">Ge la lɛ bɛŋ baaŋ kɛɛ gɛ lɛ njɛme nyu kune blɛd gɛ? Ŋka njɛme gɛh lɛ bɛŋ jôde kife kune kinshilɛ ki Bafalashii bɛ Basadushii.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>No wu jɛme noo bo mo bo kɛɛ lɛ gɛ wu jɛme lɛ bo jode kife nyu kune kinshilɛ kì ba toji blɛd yu gɛ, lɛ wu jɛme nyu kune n'yɛyɛ wu Bafalashii bɛ Basadushii.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bita chiɛɛyɛ lɛ Jiso le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliku 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Jiso gɛ̀ gɛɛŋ wu bu kimbe ki woŋ wù Kasalia wu Filibi le, wu ja wu biih booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bamii duu lɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh le yɛɛŋ?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Bo chvuu wu le lɛ, “Bamii bamu duu lɛ wo le Joŋ Nlesɛajoo, bamu lɛ le Alaja, bamu duu lɛ wo le Yɛlimia kɛnɛ muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wumu.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/><char style="wj">Wu biih bo le lɛ, “Bɛŋ duu fiena lɛ nle yɛɛŋ?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Samoŋ Bita chvuu lɛ, “Wo le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka wu le Mwa Nyo, Nyo wù kɛme kinche.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Samoŋ mwa Jona, Nyo le wu buu wo, nje gɛ finɛ sɛŋe muh wu wuŋ wo le gɛ, sɛŋe chii wù le fɛwe wo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/><char style="wj">Ntu jɛme wo le lɛ wo le Bita,</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jee chi Bita chinɛ le lɛ, “Tɛdɛ”.</char></note><char style="wj">le yi kimbaaŋ kinɛ le kì nlé ŋgê njooŋ kintaashɛ kaŋ ki bamii ba mbɛmɛ yu. Gɛ bvuŋga bvu woŋ wu baŋkfu taŋlo bvu yu bvu ya kintaashɛ kiyu gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/><char style="wj">Nlé nnyâ biŋgwenyɛ bi bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe wo le. Fiɛɛ fì wo le wo kaaŋ fɛkuu fɛnɛ, tu ba le ba kaaŋ wa fɛwe. Fiɛɛ fì wo le wo faanyɛ fɛkuu fɛnɛ, tu ba le ba faanyɛ wa fɛwe.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>No Jiso jɛmɛ noo, wu mo wu chiisɛ lo booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ keefɛ bo môŋ bo sɛ̂ɛŋ muh le lɛ wu le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka gɛ.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso jɛmɛ kune kfuu chi kwe yì wu le wu ge wu kwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliku 8:31–9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Kɛge yi kife kɛɛ le, Jiso mo wu kɛ wu duunyi booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ wu kɛme ki wu gɛ̂ɛŋ gɛh Yɛlusalɛm. Wu gɛɛŋ wu yɛŋ baŋgɛ ba duude chiaaŋ yi bamii ba sage woŋ bɛ bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ mo bamii ba duunyi banchi ba Nyo. Bo mo bo yuuyɛ wu, aju atade wu kaasɛ wu bu yi kwe le. <verse eid="MAT 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Bita mo wu jo wu bɛ wu kɛŋsɛ. Wu mo wu kɛ wu wame wu yi fiɛɛ fiyu le, wu duu lɛ, “Tada, Nyo ŋgaŋsɛ. Gɛ finɛ fiɛɛ nyu fi yu fi kooshɛ bɛ wo gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Jiso kaasɛ ye wu jɛmɛ Bita le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ja a mɛ jiŋ Sataŋ! Wo jeese lo mɛ nje gɛ wo lɛme yi kimbe ki Nyo le gɛ. Wo lɛme nyu yi ki muh wu wuŋ le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>No Jiso jɛme noo, wu mo wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Muh nɛ goone ki wù nyu muh waŋ wu ŋgoo, tu wù kɛme ki wu fâŋ kikwɛɛ ke, wu tuu kintaaŋ ke wu bii mɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ muh wu baji kinche ke lé wu lɛ̂sɛ lo ki. Geenɛ muh wu le wu lɛsɛ kinche ke nje mɛ, lé wu gê wù kɛme kinche.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/><char style="wj">Nɛ ba banyi woŋ kfunɛ wuchii, ba nya muh le lɛ wu ji, wu to wu lɛsɛ kinche ke, mbe we nyume la? Noo, fiɛɛ le yu fì taŋlo muh suuŋ kiyo ke yu le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gê wu tô bɛ banchɛndaa be a bvukugɛ bvu chiji le, wu mo wu laŋɛ muh wuchii yi fiɛɛ fì muh le wu ge le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ bamii bamu lɛme fɛnɛ gɛ bo nyu bo to bo yu wuŋ wu kwe gɛ, fuge njɛ bo yɛŋ muh wu jee che le Mwamuh too bɛ bvunfoŋ bwe gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso dunyɛ bvukugɛ bwe bvù wu gɛ̀ kɛme fɛwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliku 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Aju fe bvusoo, Jiso jo Bita bɛ Jɛm mo Joŋ wù mwa bwe Jɛm, bɛ bo bɛɛŋ yi mbegɛ wumu wù ndefe fɛwe le, bo tu bo nyu fo lɛbolɛbo. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Bo ja bo yɛŋ nfiɛɛnɛ ye kusɛ a bo jii, bvushi bwe tu bvu baaŋ bvu lale njɛ juu, njú ye baaŋ tɛ yi lale nɛ mwamwamwa. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ Musɛ bɛ Alaja gɛ̀ ja bo bunɛ fɛ bo le, bo tu bo jɛme bɛ Jiso. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Bita mo wu ja gɛh nɛ wu jɛmɛ Jiso le lɛ, “Tada, fi joŋe no bee le fɛnɛ. Nɛ wo koŋe lo njooŋ chúŋ fɛnɛ yishɛde, yimi nyu yo, yimi yi Musɛ, yimi yi Alaja.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Gɛh no wu baaŋ wu jɛme, fi kooshɛ lɛ kimbɛ kì baaŋ nɛ bvuuu ja ki to ki baŋɛ bo, jɛ jɛmɛ a kimbɛ kiyu le lɛ, “Wunɛ le mwa yaŋ, wu le fitele fiaŋ. N'yuge njoŋ bɛ wu baaŋ. Bɛŋ yûge nyu wu le.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo doo bo yu jɛ yiyu njaŋ koo bo, bo gwe fɛkuu bo tuŋ manshi fɛkuu. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Geenɛ Jiso gɛɛŋ wu kuŋ bo le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ jâ we! Keefɛ bɛŋ fâane gɛ!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Bo doo bo chiaasɛ ajii we bo gɛ ka bo yɛŋ muh mu le gɛ nyu gɛh Jiso.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Bo ja yi mbegɛ wɛɛ le bo doo bo boge, Jiso lejɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Keefɛ bɛŋ môŋ bɛŋ sɛ̂ɛŋ fiɛɛ fì ajii a wene be yɛŋ le njɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh le wu bu wa yi kwe le sɛŋ gɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Booŋ be ba ŋgoo biih wu le lɛ, “Le nje la wu bamii ba duunyi banchi duu lɛ Alaja kɛme ki wu yâ wu to fɛ Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka ge wu to?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Le nchiɛɛŋ lɛ Alaja kɛme ki wu yâ wu to wu kɛnyɛ mwɛɛ munchii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ Alaja le wu to wa bo baaŋ wu kɛɛ gɛ, bo mo bo ge fiɛɛ fì bo koŋe bɛ wu. Nyu gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gê wu yɛŋ ŋgɛ chiaaŋ yiboo le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>No wu jɛmɛ noo, booŋ be ba ŋgoo mo bo kɛɛ lɛ wu jɛme nyu kune Joŋ Nlesɛajoo.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso fɛ mwa wumu wù gɛ̀ gwee kika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliku 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luka 9:37-43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ boh bo fɛsɛ fɛ kinchvu ki bamii gɛ̀ bee fo. Muh mu ja wu to wu tuŋ anyuu a Jiso fwe, wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>“Tada, koo yii fɛ mwa yaŋ le. Wu gwee kika, wu yɛne ŋgɛ baaŋ. Wu jade wu gwe fɛntaŋ, wu ja wu gwe a joo le. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Mbe nto bɛ wu fɛ booŋ buŋ ba ŋgoo le bo moŋ sɛŋ ki bo fɛ wu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Jiso jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“O oo! Kiŋgogɛ kì achiji kì baaŋ lee gɛ fitele yi Nyo le gɛ. Nlé ŋgê nyûme bɛ bɛŋ ŋgɛ̂ɛŋ mbû nɛɛ? Nlé ŋkâaŋ shɛ́ŋ bɛ bɛŋ ŋgɛ̂ɛŋ mbû nɛɛ? Bɛŋ to bɛ mwa wuyu fɛnɛ bɛŋ nya mɛne.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Bo gɛɛŋ bɛ wu, Jiso waŋ nchɛndaa wu debele wù gɛ̀ bee yi mwa wɛɛ le wu bu, wu mo wu tɛmɛ lo kimimia.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ gɛɛŋ fɛ wu le ajiŋ ajiŋ, bo biih wu le lɛ, “Le nje la wù bee be moŋ sɛŋ ki be bvusɛ nchɛndaa wu debele wɛɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Wu chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Le nje mbɛmɛ wene le shige. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, bɛŋ nɛ be kɛme mbɛmɛ wù le gɛh njɛ shaŋ yi nsuu,</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nsuu wunɛ le a jɛ yi bala le lɛ, “mustard”.</char></note><char style="wj">taŋlo bɛŋ du mbegɛ wunɛ le lɛ wu mugɛ fɛnɛ wu gɛɛŋ wu lɛɛŋ fɛge, wu mugɛ, fiɛɛ gɛ ya fi nyu yu fì taŋlo fi ya bɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/><char style="wj">[Geenɛ, gɛ kfuu chi wunɛ nchɛndaa wu debele taŋlo wu bu njɛ muh buune wu shee yuuŋ chi mwɛɛ munjile sɛŋ gɛ.]”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛ baŋwa ba kege bamu ba ba gɛ̀ ya saŋ jɛ yi Nyo yo kɛme kinchiŋ kinɛ gɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso ka wu jɛmɛ kune kfuu chi kwe yì wu le wu ge wu kwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliku 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luka 9:43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>No Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ taashɛ Galalee, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé ba nyû ba ge ba nyâ wu chiaaŋ yi bamii le,</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/><char style="wj">ba yûuyɛ wu, doo nyume aju atade, wu bû yi kwe le.”</char> Lɛ bo yu noo, ye wooŋ bo baaŋ.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kune ŋkolɛ wu ŋwa wu yeh yi kintanyɛ le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛɛŋ bo bu Kafanahum, bamii ba gɛ̀ koode ŋwa wu yeh yi kintanyɛ le gɛ̀ to bo yɛŋ Bita le bo soge wu le lɛ, “Muh wene wu n'yɛyɛ too gɛh wu nooŋ ŋwa wu yeh yi kintanyɛ le?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa kfunɛ gɛ̀ bee njɛ nlaŋe wu kiŋgade ki juu lɛ chi mu wu lɛme.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Wu bɛɛŋ lɛ, “Ɛɛŋ.” Bita gɛ̀ doo wu tu fɛ yeh le, yaŋsɛ Jiso wu giŋsɛ fiɛɛ fiyu fɛkuu, wu biih wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Samoŋ, wo yɛde fiuŋ lɛ la? Banfoŋ ba fɛkuu fɛnɛ to bo koode ŋwa, bo ka bo fii kinsu nyu a baaŋ le? Bo to bo fii a booŋ baboo le noo, a bantolo le le?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Bita chvuu lɛ, “Bo to bo fii nyu a bantolo le.” Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Tu gɛ booŋ baboo kɛme ki bo laaŋe gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, fi le lɛ keefɛ besa wo tɛnɛ muntele mu bamii banɛ gɛ, gɛnɛ wo noŋ ŋgwe a mamasi le, biɛŋ yì wo le wo ya wo koo, wo gwênyɛ jwe wuyu, wo yɛŋ jise chi bige le yo, wo mo wo bvusɛ wo gɛɛŋ wo nya bo le ki wo lâŋɛ ŋwa wese besa wo yu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Muh wù kuge antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliku 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Kife kiyu le, booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo biih wu le lɛ, “Muh wù kuge wu fede muh wuchii antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le, le wù la?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Jiso mo wu tɛɛŋ mwa wu shige wu leesɛ a bo ntɛnɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, bɛŋ baaŋ kusɛ gɛ bɛŋ tu njɛ booŋ ba shige shige gɛ, tu gɛ bɛŋ nyu bɛŋ to bɛŋ lee fɛ bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/><char style="wj">Nɛ le yɛɛŋ wu le wu jo kikwɛɛ ke fɛkuu wu tu njɛ mwa wunɛ, tu wu le muh wù kuge antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh fii mwa njɛ wunɛ a jee chaŋ le, tu wu fii nyume mɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliku 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>
    <char style="wj">Geenɛ, kɛnɛ nyume yɛɛŋ wù ge mwa wù shige wù lese fitele ye yaŋ le, wu ge kimbefɛ, fi joŋe fɛ wuwɛɛ muh le lɛ ba shɛŋshɛ kibwee ki jɛnɛ a kindoŋ ke le, ba tooŋsɛ wu wu shii wu gɛɛŋ a joo yì baaŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/><char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le fɛ bamii ba yi woŋ kfunɛ le. Mwɛɛ mù tele bamii fɛ bo gee bimbefɛ kɛme gɛh ki mu nyûme yu. Geenɛ, ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le fɛ muh wù too bɛ mu le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/><char style="wj">Nɛ kibo kuŋ kɛnɛ kikaa kuŋ gee wo gee kimbefɛ, wo suunɛ kibo kiyu kɛnɛ kikaa kiyu wo noŋ. Fi joŋe lɛ wo ge wo lee kinche kì kage gɛ le bɛ kibo kɛnɛ kikaa kiŋkfunɛ, fede ki wo kɛ̂me chiaaŋ yichii kɛnɛ bikaa bichii ba to ba jo wo ba noŋ yi ŋgu wù kage gɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/><char style="wj">Nɛ jise chuŋ gêe wo gee kimbefɛ, wo bvûsɛ jise chiyu wo noŋ. Fi joŋe lɛ wo lee kinche kì kage gɛ le bɛ jise chimimia, fede ki wo kɛ̂me ajii achii, ba noŋ wo ŋgu wù baaŋ le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune shoŋ yì gɛ̀ lɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yɛ̂ne lɛ keefɛ bɛŋ jôde booŋ ba shige shige banɛ fɛkuu gɛ. Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ fɛwe banchɛndaa ba Nyo ba shee bɛ bo, bo nyu segechii fwe a Chii wu fɛwe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/><char style="wj">[Muh wù jee che le Mwamuh gɛ̀ to ki wu bvûsɛ bamii ba lɛsɛ wa.]</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛ baŋwa kege bamu ba ba gɛ̀ ya saŋ jɛ yi Nyo yo kɛme kinchiŋ kinɛ gɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ la? Nɛ muh kɛme shóŋ gwii, yimimia nɛ le yi lɛsɛ a yi ntɛnɛɛ, wu gɛ ya wu chinɛ yi mbaŋbvuugɛ ncho bvuugɛ le, mbegɛ le, wu gɛɛŋ wu gooŋ shoŋ yi yimimia yì lɛsɛ yɛɛ sɛŋ gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, nɛ wu le wu gooŋ wu yɛŋ, wu yuge njoŋ bɛ shoŋ yi yimimia yɛɛ fede yi mbaŋbvuugɛ ncho bvuugɛ yì be baaŋ lɛsɛ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/><char style="wj">Le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ tɛ no Chijaŋ wù le fɛwe goone gɛ lɛ muh wu mumwaa ŋgoo yi booŋ ba shige shige banɛ le wu lɛsɛ gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">No taŋlo muh najɛ mwɛɛ bɛ mwa bwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Nɛ mwa bwoo le wu ge fiɛɛ fì befe fɛ wo le, wo gɛɛŋ wo yɛŋ wu le wo dunyɛ jialɛ che wu le gɛh bena wu bafɛɛ. Wu nɛ le wu yu fiɛɛ fì wo jɛme, tu wo le wo kaasɛ wa wo kɛme mwa bwoo jiŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/><char style="wj">Wu nɛ baaŋ yu gɛ fiɛɛ fì wo jɛme gɛ, wo jo muh wu mumwaa kɛnɛ bafɛɛ bena bo kaasɛ bɛŋ gɛɛŋ fɛ wu le, fi le lɛ njɛmɛ wuchii kɛ̂me bamii bafɛɛ kɛnɛ batɛde bo bɛɛ jiŋ yi nsa wuyu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/><char style="wj">Wu nɛ le wu gɛɛŋ wu faŋ ki wu yû fiɛɛ fì bo jɛme, wo jo wu mɛɛse wo gɛɛŋ fɛ kintaashɛ ki bamii ba mbɛmɛ le. Wu faŋ ki wu yû mo fɛ kintaashɛ ki bamii ba mbɛmɛ le, wo jo wu njɛ muh wù kee gɛ Nyo gɛ kɛnɛ njɛ muh wù koode ŋwa.</char><verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ le bɛŋ kaaŋ fɛkuu fɛnɛ, tu ba le ba kaaŋ wa fɛwe, fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ le bɛŋ faanyɛ fɛkuu fɛnɛ, tu ba le ba faanyɛ wa fɛwe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/><char style="wj">Ŋka njɛme bɛŋ le lɛ, nɛ bamii bafɛɛ a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ nɛ bɛme yi fiɛɛ le fɛkuu fɛnɛ, bo lɛgɛ a buunɛ le, tu Chii wù le fɛwe lé wu gê fiɛɛ fiyu fɛ bo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ fɛ bamii bafɛɛ kɛnɛ batɛde le bo taashɛ fo a jee chaŋ le, tu nle a bo ntɛnɛɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune muh wu fioo wù koode gɛ yii gɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Bita mo wu kɛŋsɛ wu biih Jiso le lɛ, “Tada, le kiŋgane kimɛɛ kì mwa bwɛɛŋ gee mwɛɛ mù mbefe mɛne, nlɛɛshɛ gɛh lo? Taŋlo wu ge, gɛɛŋ bu kiŋgane kinsooshwi?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ taŋlo ndu wo le lɛ, taŋlo nyu gɛh kiŋgane kinsooshwi maa gɛ. Taŋlo nyu kiŋgane mbaŋbvusooshwi chikɛ bvusooshwi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/><char style="wj">Nɛ fiɛɛ fì ba taŋlo ba fe bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe bɛ Nfoŋ wumu wù gɛ̀ goone ki wu sêesɛ bɛ bamii be ba lɛme ba kwa we gɛ̀ bee chiaaŋ yiboo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/><char style="wj">No wu gɛ̀ kɛ ki wu tâade, bo to bɛ muh mu, ye fioo gɛ̀ bee bikɛɛ bi bige banchvuge yuufe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/><char style="wj">No bi gɛ̀ ya wu ki wu lâŋɛ, Nfoŋ wɛɛ mo wu jɛme lɛ ba jo wu bɛ kwɛɛ mo booŋ mo mwɛɛ mwe munchii ba gesɛ ba to bɛ bige biyu ba laŋɛ fioo ye yu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/><char style="wj">No Nfoŋ wɛɛ jɛme noo, muh wɛɛ gwe a wu jii wu ku chiaaŋ wu le, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Tada, koo gɛh yii bɛ mɛ, nlé ŋgê nlâŋɛ fiɛɛ fichii.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/><char style="wj">Yii koo chiji kikwɛɛ wɛɛ wu chinɛ wu le wu daayɛ lo a fioo yɛɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, muh wɛɛ kibɛɛ bu wu doo wu gɛɛne, wu bu yi muh mu le wù bɛ bo gɛ̀ lɛne Nfoŋ wɛɛ le, wu gɛ̀ kɛme wu fioo kikɛɛ ki bige kimimia.</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kikɛɛ ki bige kinɛ le a jɛ́ Glek le njɛ badanale gwii.</char></note><char style="wj">Wu mo wu jijɛ wu yi finse le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Laŋɛ fioo yo.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/><char style="wj">Muh wu lɛme wɛɛ mo wu gwe tɛ a wu jii, wu lɛgɛ wu, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Koo gɛh yii bɛ mɛ, nlé ŋgê nlâŋɛ wo.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/><char style="wj">Wu faŋ, wu jo wu wù gɛɛŋ wu faa wu yeh yi ncha le, lɛ wu nyûme yu gɛɛŋ bu sege wu laŋɛ fioo ye yɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/><char style="wj">Bamii bamu ba bɛ bo gɛ̀ lɛne doo bo yɛŋ fiɛɛ fì kooshi le, fi lujɛ bo baaŋ. Bo mo bo gɛɛŋ bo sɛɛŋ fiɛɛ fichii fì kooshi Nfoŋ wɛɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/><char style="wj">Nfoŋ tɛɛŋ wu wu to, wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, ‘Wo le fiɛɛ fì achiji. Mbe ndaayɛ a yo fioo le yichii nje wo be wo ku chiaaŋ mɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/><char style="wj">Gɛ be taŋlo tɛ wo koo yii fɛ muh wù bena bo lɛne le no mbe ŋkolɛ tɛ fɛ wo le gɛ?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/><char style="wj">Nfoŋ wɛɛ toonyɛ shɛ́ŋ, wu nya wu lɛ ba fâa wu yeh yi ncha le, ba nyîɛge bɛ wu, gɛɛŋ bu sege wu lé wu gê wu laŋe fioo ye yɛɛ yichii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/><char style="wj">Noo, le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no Chijaŋ wù le fɛwe lé wu gê bɛ muh wu mumwaa wu mumwaa bɛŋ le, nɛ muh baaŋ lɛɛshɛ gɛ bɛ fitele fie fichii fiɛɛ fì befe fì mwa bwee le wu ge fɛ wu le gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune ki muh kuŋ bɛ kwɛse</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliku 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Jiso jɛmɛ mwɛɛ munɛ wu mɛsɛ, wu mo wu ja kimbe ki woŋ kì Galalee le, wu gɛɛŋ a kì Judia le, Joo yì Jodaŋ le wuŋ kwege. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>No wu gɛnɛ, binchvu bi bamii baanyi bi bi wu le, wu fɛ bo bachii ba gɛ̀ chɛne yo.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliku 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Bafalashii ja bo to fɛ wu le ki bo moŋ wu, bo mo bo biih wu le lɛ, “Nchi le wu bɛɛŋ lɛ taŋlo muh kuŋ bɛ kwɛɛ yi fiɛɛ le kɛnɛ nyu fì la lɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ baaŋ a tɛɛŋ gɛ fiɛɛ fì ba gɛ̀ saŋ wa lɛ, ‘Gɛ̀ bee fɛŋkɛɛ muh wù gɛ̀ fɛ bamii, wu gɛ̀ fɛ bo nyu jwɛŋsɛ bɛ kwɛse gɛ?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/><char style="wj">Wu gɛ̀ fɛ noo, wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Le nje finɛ fì jwɛŋsɛ lé wu gê wu chinɛ chiji bɛ bwee le, wu taashɛ bɛ kwɛɛ, bo bafɛɛ mo bo tu wa muh wu mumwaa.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/><char style="wj">Noo, gɛ bo baaŋ bamii bafɛɛ gɛ, bo le wa muh wu mumwaa. Fi mo fi nyu lɛ, fiɛɛ fì Nyo le wu taashɛ wa, keefɛ muh moŋ ki wu gâsɛ gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Bamii baa mo bo biih Jiso le lɛ, “Tu le nje la fì Musɛ gɛ̀ duu lɛ muh taŋlo wu saŋ ŋwa wu nya kwɛɛ le wù duunyi lɛ wu le wu kuŋ wa bɛ wu, wu mo wu kuŋ bɛ wu?” <verse eid="MAT 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Jiso chvuu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ̀ bee nje bintuŋ biɛna bì tɛmɛ wù Musɛ gɛ̀ chinɛ lɛ muh taŋlo wu kuŋ bɛ kwɛɛ. Geenɛ, gɛ nyu no fi gɛ̀ bee fɛŋkɛɛ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/><char style="wj">Njɛme fiaŋ bɛŋ le lɛ, muh ja wu kuŋ bɛ kwɛɛ wu jo wumu, baaŋ nyu gɛ lɛ kwɛse wɛɛ le wu ja wu tu wu jiɛnyi wu jaŋe kinjaŋ sɛŋ gɛ, tu wu le wu ge kimbefɛ njɛ ki wu jâŋ kwɛse wumu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo yu wunɛ njɛme bo mo bo du wu le lɛ, “Nɛ fi le noo kune jwɛŋsɛ bɛ kwɛse, tu fi be joŋe lɛ muh mɛ fie noo fɛ wu taashɛ bvuguu gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ nyu muh wuchii wù taŋlo wu bɛɛŋ fiɛɛ finɛ gɛ. Taŋlo bɛɛŋ gɛh bamii ba Nyo le wu ge lɛ bo bɛɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ bamii bamu le yu bo goone gɛ bikɛse gɛ, le no ba gɛ̀ boyɛ bo, bo nyume noo. Bamu nyu noo ge bamii bɛ chiaaŋ lɛ bo nyume noo. Bamu nyu fiboo noo ge bo bɛ bikwɛɛ biboo lɛ bo nyume noo nje bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe. Muh wù taŋlo wu bɛ̂ɛŋ finɛ, wu bɛ̂ɛŋ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso noŋ kimbonɛ yi booŋ ba shige shige le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Bamii ja bo too bɛ booŋ fɛ Jiso le lɛ wu kuŋ bo le, wu buunɛ fɛ bo le, booŋ be ba ŋgoo tu bo wame lo bamii baa. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Jiso jɛmɛ fie lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ chinɛ booŋ bayu too fɛ mɛne. Keefɛ bɛŋ jêese bo gɛ, nje bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le nyu fɛ bamii ba le njɛ booŋ banɛ le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>No wu jɛmɛ noo, wu mo wu gɛɛ chiaaŋ yi bo le, wu mo wu ja wu gɛɛne.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso bɛ muh wu kwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliku 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ muh wu kwa wumu gɛ̀ ja wu to fɛ Jiso le, wu biih wu le lɛ, “Muh wù N'yɛyɛ, fiɛɛ fì joŋe fì ŋkɛme ki ŋge fɛ ŋkɛmɛ kinche kì kage gɛ le la?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Jiso biih wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo biide nyu mɛne kune fiɛɛ fì joŋe nje la? Muh wù joŋe mɛ gɛh wu wù maa. Nɛ wo goone ki wo gê wo kɛmɛ kinche kì kage gɛ, wo mo wo gɛɛde banchi ba Nyo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Muh wuyu biih Jiso le lɛ, “Banchi ba Nyo le ba la?” Jiso chvuu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Keefɛ wo yûuyɛ muh gɛ, keefɛ wo jâŋ kwɛ muh gɛ, keefɛ wo chôŋ bvuchoŋ gɛ, keefɛ wo bɛ̂ɛ jiŋ yi nsa wu chimbiaŋ gɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/><char style="wj">wo ŋgvûune chijo bɛ bwoo, bɛ lɛ wo kôŋe muh wù mbebe yo le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Chumu wɛɛ mo wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Banchi banɛ bachii nchi gɛɛde wa lo. Ka shɛshi la?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nɛ wo fɛnɛ goone ki wo nyûme muh wù joŋe wu gɛɛne wu mɛɛse, wo gɛɛŋ wo gesɛ mwɛɛ mu wo kɛme, wo ga bige biyu ba fuude le, wo mo wo ge wo kɛ̂me nchvu yo nyu yi fɛwe. Wo nɛ lé wo gê noo wo mo wo to wo bîi mɛne.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Sege chumu wuyu yu noo, wu mo wu ja wu gɛɛne wu nyume lo yii yii, nje wu gɛ̀ kɛme kwa baaŋ.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Jiso mo wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, fi tɛɛme fɛ muh wu kwa lee fɛ bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/><char style="wj">Ŋka nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ, fi le chige fɛ nyambala lee a jise chi nsala le, fede fɛ muh wu kwa lee fɛ bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo le.”</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nyambala yinɛ le ba tɛŋe a jɛ́ yi bala le lɛ “camel”.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Sege booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo yu finɛ fiɛɛ, jwe yuŋ bo baaŋ. Bo biih lɛ, “Nɛ finɛ le noo, yu to bonɛ yɛɛŋ?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Jiso bijɛ bo nɛɛ, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nɛ le fɛ muh wu wuŋ le, tu fi taŋlo fi ya. Geenɛ fɛ Nyo le gɛ fiɛɛ taŋlo fi ya wu gɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Bita jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Bîjɛ yɛ̂ŋ, bee le be chinɛ wa fiɛɛ fichii, be bii wo le. Bee lé be gê be kɛme la?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ sege muh wu jee che le Mwamuh le wu shii wa yi kala we wu bvukugɛ bvu yi woŋ wu fwɛŋ le, bɛŋ banɛ ba gɛ̀ bii mɛne, bɛŋ shiiyɛ tɛ yi bakala le yuufe ncho bafɛɛ bɛŋ sâge chikfuu chi Ishwala chi yuufe ncho chifɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/><char style="wj">Muh wuchii wù le wu chinɛ la che le, kɛnɛ booŋ ba bwee le, kɛnɛ jɛ́me ye le, kɛnɛ chiji le, kɛnɛ bwee le, kɛnɛ booŋ le, kɛnɛ ŋɛɛ le, wu chinɛ nje mɛ, tu wu lé wu kɛ̂mɛ bamii bɛ mwɛɛ kiŋgane gwii fede no wu gɛ̀ kɛme. Wu lé wu kɛ̂mɛ tɛ kinche kì kage gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, bamii ba duude ba le fwe mɛɛse lé bo gê bo tu ajiŋ, ba duude ba le ajiŋ mɛɛse lé bo gê bo nyu fwe.”</char><verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune muh wù gɛ̀ jo bamii ba lɛme wu leesɛ mwɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>Jiso ka wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe le njɛ chiji la wumu wù gɛ̀ bu wu ja antaana wu gɛɛŋ ki wu jô bamii ba lɛme wu leesɛ a wu mwɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/><char style="wj">No wu gɛ̀ gɛnɛ wu yɛŋ bo le, bɛ bo mo bo kamɛ lɛ wu lé wu gê wu laŋɛ bo nchvuge nchvuge yi juu le.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Danali wu mumwaa le jise chi bige chi ba to ba laŋɛ muh yu yi lɛme chi yi juu le.</char></note><char style="wj">Wu mo wu chiiŋsɛ bo, bo gɛɛŋ bo lɛne a wu mwɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/><char style="wj">Gɛh njɛ juu bikaa bvuugɛ, wu bu wu gɛɛŋ wu yɛŋ bamii bamu le bo lɛme fɛ waaŋ bo laame.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/><char style="wj">Wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ tɛ bɛŋ lɛ̂ŋ a mɛ mwɛne, nlé nlâŋɛ bɛŋ bɛ nlaŋɛ wù kooji.’ Bo mo bo gɛɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/><char style="wj">Wu ka wu bu njɛ fɛnshɛ fɛ ntɛnɛɛ, wu ka wu kaasɛ wu bu njɛ juu bikaa bitɛde, wu jode gɛh bamii ba lɛme.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/><char style="wj">Lɛ nyu njɛ juu bikaa bitɛŋ fɛnfu, wu ka wu bu wu gɛɛŋ wu yɛŋ bamii ba lɛme bamu le. Wu bii bo le lɛ, ‘Le nje la fi bɛŋ to bɛŋ she bɛŋ lɛme fɛnɛ juu chi chile achiji?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/><char style="wj">Bo chvuu lɛ, ‘Le nje muh baaŋ jo gɛ̀ bee lɛme le gɛ.’ Wu mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ tɛ bɛŋ lɛ̂ŋ a mɛ mwɛne.’</char><verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>
    <char style="wj">Lɛ to nyume fɛnfu, chiji mwɛ kwɛɛ mo wu to wu du chiji kikwɛɛ ki bamii be ba lɛme le lɛ, wu tɛɛŋ bamii ba lɛme, wu nya nlaŋɛ wuboo, wu kɛ fɛ bamii ba be to ajiŋ le, wu gɛɛŋ wu mɛsɛ fɛ ba be to fwe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/><char style="wj">Wu mo wu kɛ wu laaŋe. Bamii ba wù gɛ̀ jo bo yi lɛme le juu bikaa bitɛŋ to wu laŋɛ bo nchvuge nchvuge.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/><char style="wj">Bamii ba wu gɛ̀ ya jo bo doo bo too bo mo bo kwaji lɛ ba lé ba lâŋɛ bo ba fe bamu baa. Geenɛ, ba laŋɛ tɛ bo danale danale.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/><char style="wj">No bo fi nlaŋɛ wuboo bo mo bo kɛ bo tu bo shuŋshi, chiji la wɛɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/><char style="wj">bo duu lɛ, ‘Bamii banɛ ba wo be jo ajiŋ bo le bo lɛŋ gɛh ntaŋ wu kife kimimia maa, geenɛ wo laŋɛ besa bo yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ bee le be shɛ bee gose ye bɛ lɛme juu chi chile muu suŋe bee.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/><char style="wj">Chiji mwɛ wuyu chvuu muh mu bo le lɛ, ‘Nsaa yaŋ, mbaaŋ njiaa gɛ fiɛɛ besa wo gɛ. Besa wo be kamɛ gɛ lɛme chinɛ yi nchvuge le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/><char style="wj">Joo nlaŋe wo wo gɛ̂ɛne. Koŋ mɛ lɛ nlaŋɛ muh wu ajiŋ yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ njɛ no nlaŋɛ wo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/><char style="wj">Gɛ ŋkɛme bvuŋga ki ŋge fiɛɛ fì ŋkoŋe bɛ fiɛɛ fì le fiaŋ gɛ? Noo wo bɛɛne kindoŋ nje nle ŋgwenyɛ chiaaŋ yaŋ fɛ bamii le?’”</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>No Jiso jɛmɛ nɛ, wu mo wu mɛsɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Le gɛh no bamii ba le ajiŋ mɛɛse lé bo gê bo tu ba fwe, ba fwe tu ba ajiŋ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso ka wu jɛmɛ kune kfuu chi kwe yì wu le wu ge wu kwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliku 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Jiso gɛ̀ bɛɛne Yɛlusalɛm bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ bo bu a je, wu tɛɛŋ bo bɛ bo kɛŋsɛ yo, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/><char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, bee bɛɛne wa bee gɛɛne Yɛlusalɛm, ba lé ba gɛ̂ɛŋ ba nya muh wù jee che le Mwamuh chiaaŋ yi bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ le mo bamii ba duunyi banchi ba Nyo, ba sa wu ba suunɛ lɛ ba yuuyɛ wu,</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/><char style="wj">ba mo ba nya wu chiaaŋ yi bituŋ le, ba chwɛɛse wu, ba taane wu bɛ munte, ba mo ba ta wu yi kintaaŋ le, doo nyume aju atade Nyo kaasɛ wu bvusɛ wu yi kwe le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bwe Joŋ bɛ Jɛm lɛgɛ binta bi booŋ be a Jiso le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliku 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Bwe booŋ ba Jɛbɛdi gɛ̀ ja wu to fɛ Jiso le bɛ booŋ be, wu tuŋ anyuu a wu jii ki wu lɛ̂gɛ fiɛɛ. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Jiso bii wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo be goone lɛ la?”</char> Wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Kaa lɛ lé gê doo nyume sege wo sage bvunfoŋ bwuŋ, booŋ baŋ ba bafɛɛ banɛ shii mbebe yo le, wumu a kibo kuŋ kinchiɛɛŋ le, wumu a kiŋkoŋo le.” <verse eid="MAT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Jiso chvuu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Gɛ bɛŋ kee fiɛɛ fì bɛŋ biide gɛ. Taŋlo bɛŋ mu fiŋkoo fi ŋgɛ fi nlé ŋgê mu?”</char> Bo chvuu lɛ, “Bee taŋlo be mu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ mû fiŋkoo fiaŋ nchiɛɛŋ. Geenɛ ki bɛŋ shîi a kibo kaŋ kinchiɛɛŋ le bɛ kiŋkoŋo le, gɛ nyume kijusɛ kaŋ ki nya bɛŋ le gɛ. Manjuu mayu le fɛ bamii ba Chii le wu seesɛ wa wu gɛɛ bo le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Kimbɛge ki booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Jiso ba yuufe doo bo yu kune fiɛɛ fiyu, shɛ́ŋ toonyɛ bo bɛ booŋ ba bafɛɛ bayu. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Geenɛ Jiso tɛɛŋ bo bachii, bo to wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kee lɛ bamii ba sage bituŋ to bo shiide lo yi bamii baboo le, bamii ba baaŋ baaŋ baboo duunyi bvuŋga bvuboo a bo we.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/><char style="wj">Gɛ fifiɛɛ kɛme ki fi nyume a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ gɛ. Muh wu goone ki wu nyûme muh wù baaŋ a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ wù kɛme ki wu nyûme muh wù lɛne lo bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/><char style="wj">Muh nɛ goone ki wu nyûme muh wù fwe a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ, tu wù kɛme ki wu nyûme nfwa wene.</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/><char style="wj">Le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no muh wù jee che le Mwamuh gɛ̀ baaŋ to gɛ lɛ bamii lɛ̂ne lo wu le gɛ. Wu gɛ̀ to ki wu lɛ̂ŋ lo bamii le, wu nyâ kinche ke ki wu sûuŋ muh wù duude yi kwe le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso gwenyɛ ajii a binfeeŋ bifɛɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliku 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ gɛɛŋ bo doo bo fede Jɛliku, kinchvu ki bamii tu ki kfuunɛ ki bii a wu ajiŋ. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ binfeeŋ bimi bifɛɛ, nyu bilɛŋsɛ bì gɛ̀ too gɛh bi shiide jwe wu je le, bi doo bi yu lɛ Jiso fede lo, bi mo bi tu bi wanɛ bi duu lɛ, “Tada, Mwa Nfoŋ Dabi, koo yii fɛ bee le.” <verse eid="MAT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Kinchvu ki bamii tu ki wanɛ ki duu lɛ bo baŋ lo. Geenɛ bo ka bo waŋ lo bo gɛɛŋ fwe fwe lɛ, “Tada, Mwa Nfoŋ Dabi koo yii fɛ bee le.” <verse eid="MAT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Jiso mo wu lɛɛŋ, wu tɛɛŋ bo, bo to, wu biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ goone lɛ ŋgê la fɛ bɛŋ le?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Bo chvuu lɛ, “Tada, fɛɛ lɛ ajii a wese gwenyɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yii koo Jiso, wu kuŋ ajii aboo le. Kimimia bo mo bo tu bo yɛde mwɛɛ le, bo mo bo ja bo bii Jiso le.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso lee Yɛlusalɛm njɛ Nfoŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliku 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joŋ 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ doo bo fɛɛse Yɛlusalɛm, bo nyu wa ntɛ wù Bɛfash le, bo nyume mbebe yi mbegɛ wu Bite bi Olif le, wu mo wu tuŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo bamu bafɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>wu jɛme bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ gɛɛŋ ntɛ wù fwe wege le. Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ gɛɛŋ, bɛŋ yɛŋ bwe jaki le ba shuudɛ mwa ye nyume mbebe ye le, bɛŋ faanyɛ, bɛŋ to bɛ bo fɛ mɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh lé wu jɛ̂mɛ fiɛɛ bɛŋ le, bɛŋ chvuu lɛ Chiji Kikwɛɛ gôone lo, wu mo wu chînɛ lo kimimia bɛŋ to yu.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Finɛ fiɛɛ gɛ̀ kooshɛ noo ki fi gê fi to fi kojɛ no muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wumu gɛ̀ jɛmɛ, wu du lɛ,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Muh du kilaantɛŋ kì Sayoŋ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sayoŋ le jee chi Yɛlusalɛm chimi.</char></note> le lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, Nfoŋ wene too fɛ bɛŋ le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">Wu le wu shiishɛ kikwɛɛ ke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">wu bɛɛŋ yi jaki le, nyu mwa jaki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">jaki wu baaŋ shige.’”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo baa gɛɛŋ, bo ge gɛh no wu be jɛmɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Bo to bɛ jaki wɛɛ mo mwa, bo nooŋ bikuŋ biboo yu wege, Jiso bɛɛŋ wu shii yu we, wu tu wu gɛɛne. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Kinchvu ki bamii ki duude tu ki dɛŋe tɛ bikuŋ biboo a je, bamu shwage chɛ́ yi bite bo dɛŋe. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Kinchvu kì gɛ̀ gɛɛne Jiso fwe bɛ kì gɛ̀ bii ajiŋ tu ki wuule lɛ, “Yilili Yilili, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biwule binɛ le a jɛ́ yi Glek le lɛ Hosana.</char></note> mbɛɛŋsɛ nyûme fɛ mwa Nfoŋ Dabi le lɛɛɛ! Nyo le wu noŋ kimbonɛ yi muh wu too a jee chi Tada le lɛɛɛ! Yilili Yilili, mbɛɛŋsɛ nyûme fɛ Nyo wu fɛwe le lɛɛɛ!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Jiso gɛɛŋ wu fɛsɛ Yɛlusalɛm, kilaantɛŋ kɛɛ ki shiŋshɛ kichii. Bamii tu bo maŋe, bo biide lɛ, “Wunɛ le yɛɛŋ?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>kinchvu kɛɛ chvuu lɛ, “Le muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Jiso wù ja ntɛ wu Nasalɛ le, Galalee.” <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus enter Jerusalem" file="CN01782C.TIF" size="span" loc="Mch 21:1-11" copy="David C Cook" ref="21:11">Jiso lee Yɛlusalɛm</figure><verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso kuŋ bamii ba kame waaŋ fɛ yeh yi kintanyɛ ki Nyo le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliku 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joŋ 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Jiso gɛ̀ gɛɛŋ fɛ yeh yi kintanyɛ ki Nyo le, wu kuŋ bamii bachii ba gɛ̀ gese bɛ ba gɛ̀ gude mwɛɛ fo, wu baaji bidaŋ bi bamii ba gɛ̀ kuse bige, bɛ binta bi bamii ba gɛ̀ gese bibɛmbɛ. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Wu gɛ̀ kuŋe wu duu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Fi le ba saŋ lɛ Nyo duu lɛ, ‘Ba lé ba tɛ̂ŋe yeh yaŋ lɛ yeh yi buunɛ.’ Bɛŋ kaasɛ yi tu bvuta bvu bachoŋ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Jiso tu wù nyu fɛ yeh yi kintanyɛ le, binfeeŋ bɛ bantɛŋelase too wu fɛde bo. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Geenɛ, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba gɛ̀ duunyi banchi ba Nyo gɛ̀ doo bo yɛŋ biŋgha bi mwɛɛ bì wu gɛ̀ gee le, bɛ no booŋ ba shige shige gɛ̀ wuule fɛ yeh yi kintanyɛ le, bo duu lɛ, “Yilili Yilili, mbɛɛŋsɛ nyûme fɛ mwa Nfoŋ Dabi le lɛɛɛ”, fi tu fi toonyi lo bo. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Bo mo bo waŋ lo Jiso lɛ, “Gɛ wo yuge fiɛɛ fì booŋ banɛ duu gɛ?” Wu chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛɛŋ, n'yuge lo. Fi le lɛ bɛŋ gɛ̀ baaŋ a tɛɛŋ gɛ wa fiɛɛ fì ba gɛ̀ saŋ lɛ, ‘Nyo lé wu gê mbɛɛŋsɛ wù joŋe wu gɛɛne wu mɛɛse wu tu wu bude de yi booŋ ba shige shige le, bɛ de yi booŋ bo baaŋ bo yaane ambɛŋ le gɛ?’”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Jiso gɛ̀ ja wu chinɛ bo le, wu bu a kilaantɛŋ kɛɛ le, wu gɛɛŋ ntɛ wu Bɛtani le, wu che yo.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso noŋ loŋ kite kimi le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliku 11:12-14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Lɛ to nyume antaana, no Jiso gɛ̀ kaase wu tuu jiŋ a kilaantɛŋ ki Yɛlusalɛm le, jɛŋ tu yi yuu wu. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Wu yɛŋ kite kimi le mbebe yi je le ba to ba jii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kite kinɛ gɛ̀ bee ba tɛŋe a jɛ́ yi bala le lɛ, “fig”.</char></note> wu mo wu gɛɛŋ fo, geenɛ wu gɛ̀ baaŋ yɛŋ gɛ fiɛɛ le yi ki le gɛ, wu yɛŋ gɛh nyu biŋkamɛ le maa. Wu mo wu noŋ loŋ kite kɛɛ le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Keefɛ fintaŋ ka fi yuŋ yi wo le gɛ!”</char> Kimimia, kite kɛɛ mo ki bobɛ lo. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Jiso doo bo yɛŋ noo, jwe yuŋ bo. Bo tu bo ghaade lɛ, “Kite kinɛ jiɛnyi nɛɛ fɛ ki bobɛ lo kimimia nɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, nɛ bɛŋ leese fitele yi Nyo le, bɛŋ maŋe gɛ, bɛŋ gɛ ge gɛh nyu fiɛɛ fì ŋge bɛ kite kinɛ le maa gɛ. Nɛ bɛŋ jɛme mbegɛ wunɛ le lɛ, ‘Mugɛ ye fɛnɛ wo gɛɛŋ wo gwe a joo yì baaŋ le’, fi kooshɛ gɛh noo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/><char style="wj">Mo nyume la fì bɛŋ lɛge a buunɛ le, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ kɛ̂mɛ nɛ bɛŋ le bɛŋ leesɛ fitele yi Nyo le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bo biih fɛ bvuŋga bvu Jiso ja fo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliku 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Jiso gɛ̀ kaasɛ wu lee fɛ yeh yi kintanyɛ le, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ wu Bajuu gɛ̀ to bo yɛŋ no wu yɛyi bamii, bo mo bo biih wu le lɛ, “Wo jo faaŋ bvuŋga fɛ wo gee mwɛɛ munɛ? Nya yɛɛŋ bvuŋga bvuyu wo le?” <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Mɛ tɛ nlé mbîih bɛŋ fiɛɛ. Nɛ bɛŋ chvuse lo, mɛ mo nsɛɛŋ bɛŋ muh wù nya mɛ bvuŋga ki ŋgee mwɛɛ munɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/><char style="wj">Joŋ gɛ̀ leese bamii a joo bvuŋga bvuyu ja faaŋ? Bvu gɛ̀ ja fɛwe noo gɛ̀ nya muh wu wuŋ le?”</char> No wu bile noo, bo tu bo tɛɛnyi lɛbolɛbo lɛ, “Nɛ bee chvuse lɛ gɛ̀ nya Nyo, wu biih bee le laa gɛ̀ ge la lɛ keefɛ bee bɛɛŋ Joŋ le gɛ? <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Geenɛ, gɛ nyu no bee chvuu lɛ, ‘Gɛ̀ nya muh wu wuŋ gɛ’, nje bee faane kinchvu ki bamii, no bo bachii le bo bɛɛŋ lɛ Joŋ gɛ̀ bee muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Noo, bo mo bo chvuu Jiso le lɛ, “Gɛ bee kee gɛ.” Jiso mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Tu gɛ mɛ nyu nsɛɛŋ tɛ bɛŋ muh wù nya mɛ bvuŋga lɛ ŋgêe mwɛɛ munɛ gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune booŋ ba bilɛŋsɛ bafɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Jiso gɛɛŋ fwe wu biih lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ la kune finɛ? Muh mu gɛ̀ kɛme booŋ ba bilɛŋsɛ bafɛɛ. Wu gɛ̀ ja wu gɛɛŋ fɛ mwa wù ŋgamu le, wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, ‘Mwa yaŋ, gɛnɛ wo she wo lɛ̂ne mwɛne abɛŋ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/><char style="wj">Wu chvuu lɛ, ‘Gɛ mɛ nyu ŋgɛɛŋ gɛ.’ Geenɛ wu ja wu kaasɛ wu kusɛ fitele fie wu mo wu gɛɛŋ mwɛne kwɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/><char style="wj">Muh wɛɛ gɛɛŋ fɛ wù ajiŋ le wu jɛmɛ gɛh fiɛɛ fì wu be jɛmɛ wa wu ŋgamu le. Wu chvuu wu le lɛ, ‘Nlé ŋgɛ̂ɛŋ chii.’ Geenɛ, wu faŋ ki wu gɛ̂ɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/><char style="wj">Antɛnɛɛ a booŋ bafɛɛ banɛ, le wu la wù gɛ̀ ge fiɛɛ fì chiji goone?”</char> Bo chvuu lɛ, “Le wù ŋgamu.” Jiso mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛɛŋ bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, bamii ba koode ŋwa mo bikɛse ba jiikuu bo leese wa fɛ bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo le fwe a bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/><char style="wj">Njɛme nɛ nje Joŋ Nlesɛajoo gɛ̀ to ki wu dûnyɛ je yì chaaŋ bɛŋ le, bɛŋ faŋ ki bɛŋ bɛ̂ɛŋ wu le, geenɛ bamii ba koode ŋwa bɛ bikɛse ba jiikuu bo bɛɛŋ wu le. Bɛŋ gɛ̀ doo bɛŋ yɛŋ no bo bɛmɛ noo, bɛŋ baaŋ kusɛ gɛ muntele mwɛna lɛ bɛŋ bɛɛŋ tɛ wu le gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune muh wù gɛ̀ gɛlɛ bamii mwɛne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliku 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Jiso mo wu ja wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yû ŋgaŋ wumu. Muh mu gɛ̀ bee wu lɛŋ mwɛ wu muntaŋ mù ba fɛde mbvuuŋ yu, wu tuŋ kitaŋ ki kɛnɛ, wu fɛ kiso kì ba lé ba sôone mbvuuŋ bude yo, wu tuŋ kitale ki muh wu chiɛɛne mwɛ kwɛɛ, wu mo wu gɛɛ mwɛ kwɛɛ bamii le, wu ja wu gɛɛŋ kituŋ kimi le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/><char style="wj">Kife kì ba to ba kege muntaŋ gɛ̀ to ki kojɛ, wu tuŋ booŋ be ba lɛme fɛ bamii ba wu gɛ̀ gɛlɛ mwɛ kwɛɛ bo le, lɛ bo gɛɛŋ bo fi mwe muntaŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/><char style="wj">Bo gɛɛŋ, bamii ba wu gɛ̀ gɛlɛ mwɛ kwɛɛ bo le, bo koo bo, bo suŋ wumu, bo yuuyɛ wumu, bo tumɛ wumu bɛ ata.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/><char style="wj">Wu ka wu tuŋ bamii bamu ba lɛme ba duude bo fede ba fwe baa, bamii baa ka bo ge gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no bo gɛ̀ ge bɛ ba fwe baa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/><char style="wj">Ajiŋ ayu wu tuŋ wa nyume mwa ye, wu kwaji lɛ bo lé bo gɛ̂ɛŋ bo ŋgvuuŋ mwa ye wunɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, wu gɛɛŋ, bamii bayu doo bo yɛŋ wu le, bo jɛmɛ lɛbolɛbo lɛ, ‘Wunɛ le njibvushɛ bvu muh wu mwɛ kfunɛ. Bɛŋ to bee yuuyɛ wu bee mo be jo bvushɛ bvunɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/><char style="wj">Bo mo bo koo wu bo bvusɛ mwɛne kwɛɛ, bo yuuyɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>No Jiso ma nɛ, wu mo wu biih lɛ, <char style="wj">“Muh mwɛ kfunɛ ge doo wu to wu ge nɛɛ bɛ bamii banɛ?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Bo chvuu lɛ, “Wu lé wu tô wu lɛ̂ɛshɛ lo munyamɛ muyu, wu gɛ̂ɛ mwɛ kwɛɛ bamii bamu bo lé bo gê bo nyaa mwe muntaŋ sege bo kege.” <verse eid="MAT 21:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Jiso biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ gɛ̀ baaŋ a tɛɛŋ gɛ a Ŋwa wu Nyo le lɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Tɛdɛ chiɛɛ chì bamii ba njonɛ gɛ̀ faŋ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">gɛ̀ kaasɛ chi tu tɛdɛ chi buu chi yeh.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">Finɛ gɛ̀ ge Tada,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="wj">bamii jîiŋe bo kɛme ŋgha?’</char><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>
    <char style="wj">Mɛ mo nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ, Nyo le wu fi bvunfoŋ bwe chiaaŋ yene le, wu nya nyu kituŋ ki lé ki gêe no wu goone le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/><char style="wj">[“Tɛdɛ chiyu chinɛ muh gwe yi chì le, wu chiaafɛ lo, chi gwe yi muh le, chi baajɛ lo mwɛdɛ.]”</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛ baŋwa ba kege bamu ba ba gɛ̀ ya saŋ jɛ yi Nyo yo kɛme kinchiŋ kinɛ gɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>No Jiso ma ŋgaŋ wunɛ nɛ, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ mo Bafalashii doo bo yu, bo mo bo kɛɛ lɛ wu ma nyu kune bo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Bo tu bo goone ki bo koo wu, geenɛ, bo kaasɛ bo faŋ kinchvu ki bamii, nje kinchvu kɛɛ gɛ̀ kɛme Jiso njɛ muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Olive tree" file="hk00111c.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 21:33-46" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="21:46">Kite ki Olif</figure><verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune ŋka wu bvuguu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Jiso ka wu jɛmɛ bo le a baŋgaŋ le, wumu nyu lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/><char style="wj">“Bvunfoŋ bvu fɛwe taŋlo ba beji bɛ nfoŋ wumu wù gɛ̀ seesɛ ŋka wu bvuguu bvu mwa ye wù jwɛŋsɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/><char style="wj">Wu tuŋ booŋ be ba lɛme lɛ bo gɛɛŋ bo tɛɛŋ bamii ba wu chi be bo fɛ ŋka wu bvuguu le lɛ bo tôo. Geenɛ, booŋ bayu gɛɛŋ bamii bayu faŋ lɛ gɛ bo to gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/><char style="wj">Wu tuŋ banchɛndaa bamu wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ gɛɛŋ bɛŋ jɛmɛ bamii ba nchi ntɛŋe fɛ ŋka wu bvuguu wunɛ le lɛ bo yegɛ bo yu, nle seesɛ wa mwɛɛ munjile, nsɛɛyɛ nyáŋ yì ba bvuushɛ bɛ booŋ ba banaa ba faŋ. Nle nseesɛ wa mwɛɛ munchii, lɛ bo tôo fɛ ŋka le.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, bo gɛɛŋ bamii bayu chiaasɛ lo, bo ja fiboo bo gɛɛne. Muh mu la a wu mwɛne, muh mu la waaŋ we.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/><char style="wj">Kimbɛge ki bamii koo booŋ bayu bo nyiɛ bɛ bo, bo mo bo yuuyɛ bo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/><char style="wj">Fitele bɛdɛ nfoŋ wɛɛ, wu tuŋ bamii be ba jɛŋ, bo gɛɛŋ bo lɛɛshɛ lo bamii ba yuuyi booŋ be ba lɛme baa, bo mo bo toŋ kilaantɛŋ kiboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/><char style="wj">No wu ge noo wu mo wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba lɛme bamu le lɛ, ‘Nle nseesɛ wa ŋka wu bvuguu. Geenɛ bamii ba nchi mbe chi bee gɛ bamii gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ gɛɛŋ ntasɛ yi jé le yichii, bɛŋ tɛɛŋ bamii bachii ba bɛŋ le bɛŋ yɛŋ, lɛ bo to fɛ ŋka wu bvuguu wunɛ le.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/><char style="wj">Banchɛndaa baa mo bo gɛɛŋ jé le yichii bo kuŋ bamii bachii ba bo gɛ̀ yɛŋ le bamii ba joŋe bɛ ba befe bo to. Yeh yi bvuguu mo yi yisɛ bɛ bamii.</char><verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>
    <char style="wj">Nfoŋ ja wu lee yeh yi bvuguu yiyu le ki wu yɛ̂ŋ bamii ba to fɛ ŋka le, wu mo wu yɛŋ muh mu le yu wu baaŋ jii gɛ njú yi ŋka wu bvuguu gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/><char style="wj">Wu biih wu le lɛ, ‘Nsaa yaŋ, wo jiɛnyi nɛɛ fɛ wo lee yeh kfunɛ njɛ wo le bɛ njú yi ŋka sɛŋ?’ Muh wɛɛ mɛ jwe wu chile.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/><char style="wj">Noo, nfoŋ mo wu jɛmɛ banchɛndaa be le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ kaaŋ chiaaŋ ye mo bikaa, bɛŋ noŋ wu kijibɛ le akfuuŋ, yo bamii lé bo gê bo beede bo ŋgeji bige.’”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>No Jiso jɛme noo, wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kêe lɛ Nyo le wu tɛɛŋ bamii ba duude, geenɛ wu cha gɛh nyu ba shige.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bo telɛ Jiso kune ŋwa wu laŋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliku 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Bafalashii mo bo ja bo gɛɛŋ bo seesɛ no bo lé bo gê fɛ Jiso loŋsɛ njɛme bo koo wu. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Bo mo bo tuŋ booŋ baboo ba ŋgoo mo ŋgoo yi bamii ba Nfoŋ Hɛlod fɛ Jiso le. Bo gɛɛŋ bo jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Muh wu N'yɛyɛ, bee kee lɛ wo le muh wù nchiɛɛŋ, wo yɛyi bamii bɛ jɛ yi Nyo a je yì nchiɛɛŋ le. Gɛ wo jode lɛ muh mu le yeye gɛ, nje gɛ wo jiiŋe muh yi fiɛɛ fì wu le fi le gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Gɛh sɛɛŋ bee wo ŋkwajɛ. Nchi le wu bɛɛŋ lɛ bee lâaŋe ŋwa Kaisa Nfoŋ wu Lum le, noo keefɛ bee lâaŋe gɛ le?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Jiso kɛɛ fiɛɛ fì bo wɛɛne bɛ fi, wu mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye banɛ, bɛŋ tele mɛ nje la?</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ to bɛ bige bì bɛŋ to bɛŋ laaŋe ŋwa yu n'yɛŋ.”</char> Bo to bɛ danale bo nya wu le. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Jiso biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Kikwɛɛ kinɛ kì le yu le ki yɛɛŋ? Jee chinɛ chì le yu le chi yɛɛŋ?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Bo chvuu lɛ, “Le ki Kaisa lɛ, jee le tɛ che.” Wu mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ nyâa Kaisa le fiɛɛ fì le fi Kaisa, bɛŋ nyâa Nyo le fì le fi Nyo.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Bo yu noo, jwe yuŋ lo bo. Bo mo bo chinɛ wu le bo ja bo gɛɛne.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba telɛ Jiso kune mbu yi kwe le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliku 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Gɛh abvu, Basadushii ja bo to fɛ Jiso le. Basadushii banɛ gɛ̀ bee ŋgoo yi bamii ba gɛ̀ duu lɛ gɛ bamii nyu bo ge bo bu yi kwe le gɛ. No bo to, bo biih wu le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>“Muh wu N'yɛyɛ, Musɛ gɛ̀ saŋ lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh kwe lo mwa sɛŋ, tu mwa bwee kɛme ki wu gɛ̂ɛ kwɛse wuyu bɛ wu boo booŋ a jee chi ŋkfu mwa bwee le.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Mɛɛse, booŋ ba muh mu gɛ̀ chee besa bo yanɛ bvusooshwi. Wù ŋgamu gɛ̀ jo kwɛse, wu jiɛnyɛ wu kwe bɛ wu baaŋ kɛme gɛ mwa gɛ, wu chinɛ kwɛse wuyu wù bii wu le. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Fi kooshɛ gɛh noo bɛ wù ka bii wɛɛ le mo wù bii wu wɛɛ le, gɛɛŋ bu fɛ wu bvusooshwi le. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Ajiŋ ayu, kwɛse wɛɛ kwe tɛ. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Noo, mɛɛse no bo bachii bvusooshwi gɛ̀ jo kwɛse wɛɛ, lé gê doo nyume sege bamii bude yi kwe le, kwɛse wɛɛ nyû kwɛ yɛɛŋ?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ le bɛŋ jiaa, nje gɛ bɛŋ kee fiɛɛ fì ba saŋ a Ŋwa wu Nyo le gɛ. Gɛ bɛŋ kee tɛ bvuŋga bvu Nyo gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ lé tô nyume sege bamii bude yi kwe le, gɛ bilɛŋsɛ bɛ bikɛse baaŋ bo ka bo taashi bvuguu gɛ, gɛ bamii baaŋ bo ka bo nyaa booŋ bo taashi bvuguu gɛ. Bo lé bo tô bo nyume wa njɛ banchɛndaa ba Nyo fɛwe</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/><char style="wj">Doo nyume kune mbu wu bamii lé bo gê bo bude yi kwe le, bɛŋ gɛ̀ baaŋ a tɛɛŋ gɛ a Ŋwa wu Nyo le bɛŋ yu fiɛɛ fì wu jɛme bɛŋ le gɛ? Nyo gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/><char style="wj">‘Le mɛ wù Nyo wu Ablaham bɛ Nyo wu Asik mo Nyo wu Yakob.’ Fi le lɛ gɛ Nyo nyume Nyo wu baŋkfu gɛ, le Nyo wu bamii ba baaŋ yu.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Kinchvu ki gɛ̀ lɛme fo yu nchvusɛ wù Jiso chvuse, jwe yuŋ lo bo bɛ n'yɛyɛ we.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nchi wù fede banchi bachii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliku 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Bafalashii gɛ̀ doo bo yu lɛ Jiso le wu baŋɛ lo jwe wu Basadushii, bo mo bo banyɛ ye bo to fɛ wu le. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Muh mu bo le wù gɛ̀ kee banchi ba Nyo chuule wu mo wu telɛ wu bɛ mbilɛ wumu lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Muh wù n'yɛyɛ, nchi wù kuge wu fede banchi bachii le wù la?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Jiso chvuu wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nchi wù kuge le wù duu lɛ, ‘Wo kôŋe Tada wù Nyo wo bɛ fitele fiuŋ fichii, wo nyâ ye yo wu le yichii, wo gɛ̂ɛ bvufee bwuŋ yi wu le bvuchii.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/><char style="wj">Wunɛ le nchi wù fwe wù kuge wù fede banchi bachii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/><char style="wj">Wù bii wu le nyume njɛ wunɛ. Fì le lɛ, ‘Wo kôŋe muh wu le mbebe yo le no wo koŋe kikwɛɛ kuŋ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/><char style="wj">Mwɛɛ munchii mù le a Ŋwa wu banchi le, mo mù le a Baŋwa ba bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo le, mu lɛme nyu yi banchi ba bafɛɛ banɛ le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka le mwa yɛɛŋ?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliku 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>No Bafalashii gɛ̀ taashɛ fo, Jiso mo wu ja wu biih mbilɛ wumu bo le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ la kune Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka? Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ le mwa yɛɛŋ?”</char> Bo chvuu wu le lɛ, “Le mwa Nfoŋ Dabi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Jiso kaasɛ wu biih bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“No le mwa Nfoŋ Dabi, fi jiɛnyi nɛɛ fɛ Kiyo ki Yuude ge Dabi tu wu tɛŋe wu lɛ Tada we? Dabi gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ,</char><verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>
    <char style="wj">‘Tada Nyo gɛ̀ be wu jɛmɛ Tada waŋ le lɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">wu shîi a kibo ke kinchiɛɛŋ le,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">gɛ̂ɛŋ bû sege wu lé wu gê wu gîiŋsɛ bamii be ba kimbanɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="wj">wu tomɛ bikaa bie yi bo le.’</char><verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>
    <char style="wj">Nɛ Dabi tɛŋe wu lɛ Tada we, fi ka fi jiɛnyɛ nɛɛ fɛ wu tu wù nyu mwa ye?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>No Jiso jɛmɛ nɛ, muh gɛ ka wù nyu yu wu mumwaa wu chvuu fiɛɛ wu le gɛ. Kɛge tɛ abvu, muh gɛ ka wu moŋ lo wu biih fiɛɛ wu le gɛ.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso chiɛɛnyɛ kinyi ki bamii ba duunyi banchi mo ki Bafalashii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliku 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Jiso mo wu ja wu jɛmɛ kinchvu ki bamii le bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/><char style="wj">“Bamii ba duunyi banchi bɛ Bafalashii le bamii ba le ba jo kinta ki Musɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ, bɛŋ yûge fiɛɛ fichii fì ba sɛŋe bɛŋ le, bɛŋ mo bɛŋ gêe. Geenɛ, keefɛ bɛŋ gêe fiɛɛ fì bo gee gɛ, nje bo feeji yeye, bo gee yeye.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/><char style="wj">Bo jade bo yilɛ bvujijɛ bvù fede bvuŋga bvu bamii bo yigɛ bamii yu, ta bo kibɛɛ moŋ ki bo la nyi yi kwaaŋ bo fi bo yu gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/><char style="wj">Mwɛɛ mù bo gee munchii le gɛh ki bo ge lɛ bamii yɛ̂ne bo le. Muŋku muboo mu Ŋwa wu Nyo le lo mù kuge.</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muŋku munɛ le mù bo gɛ̀ gɛɛde banchi ba Nyo bamu yo, bo jiide manshi le bɛ ŋkɛŋe le.</char></note> <char style="wj">Munchaŋa mu de yi njú yiboo le lo mù ndefe.</char><figure style="fig" alt="Pharisee" file="hk00274c.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 23:5" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="23:5">Falashii</figure> <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/><char style="wj">Bo to bo gɛɛne fɛ ŋka le bo koŋe ki bo shiide nyu fɛ bamii ŋgvuune bo fo, bo ka gɛɛne yéh yi buunɛ le bo koŋe ki bo shiide nyu yi binta bì fwe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/><char style="wj">Bo ka koŋe tɛ njiɛnyɛ wu fɛ waaŋ lɛ bamii yɛ̂ɛse bo le, bo ka koŋe lɛ bamii tɛ̂ŋe bo lɛ Balabai.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, keefɛ muh bɛɛŋ lɛ bamii tɛ̂ŋe wu lɛ Labai gɛ, nje bɛŋ kɛme Muh wu N'yɛyɛ gɛh wu mumwaa maa, bɛŋ bachii nyu booŋ ba bwe mwa lɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ bɛŋ tɛ̂ŋe muh mu yi nshɛŋ le fɛnɛ lɛ le chiji wene gɛ, nje bɛŋ kɛme Chiji wene wu mumwaa wù le fɛwe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ muh bɛɛŋ lɛ ba tɛŋe wu lɛ Chiji Kikwɛɛ gɛ, nje Chiji Kikwɛɛ wene le gɛh wu mumwaa wù le Kletu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/><char style="wj">Muh wù baaŋ a bɛŋ ntɛnɛɛ kɛme ki wu nyû muh wù lɛne lo bɛŋ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/><char style="wj">Mo yɛɛŋ wù bɛɛŋse kikwɛɛ ke, tu Nyo lé wu shîishɛ lo wu, mo yɛɛŋ wù shiishi kikwɛɛ ke, Nyo lé wu bɛ̂ɛŋsɛ lo wu.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso choojɛ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo Bafalashii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliku 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:44-52">44-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>
    <char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ le bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye! Bɛŋ lɛme a bamii jii bɛŋ baŋe je yì leese fɛ bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe le. Gɛ bɛŋ koŋe ki bɛŋ lêe bvu le gɛ, bɛŋ ka baŋe je lɛ keefɛ bamii ba koŋe bo lee fo gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>
    <char style="wj">[Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ shiishi lo bakwɛŋkfu, bɛŋ gee chibuunɛ chì ndefe chi kinchiaasɛ ye. Bɛŋ kêe lɛ wene ŋgɛ lé wu fô lo.]</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gɛ baŋwa ba ba kege bamu ba bo gɛ̀ ya saŋ jɛ yi Nyo yo kɛme kinchiŋ kinɛ gɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/><char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ le bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye! Bɛŋ jade bɛŋ jiɛnyɛ woŋ wuchii bɛŋ daŋe jóo yì baaŋ baaŋ lɛ bɛŋ goone muh wu mumwaa wù bɛŋ fiisɛ wu tu muh wene wu mbɛmɛ. Nɛ wu le wu tu wa muh wene wu mbɛmɛ, bɛŋ kaasɛ bɛŋ ge fie mɛsɛ fi fo lo, wu tu wu nyu wa muh wu ŋgu wù baaŋ gɛh njɛ bɛŋ.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>
    <char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene. Bɛŋ le binfeeŋ bɛŋ duu lɛ bɛŋ duunyi je bamii le! Bɛŋ nyu bamii ba duu lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh jɛme fiɛɛ, wu kaŋ jee chi yeh yi kintanyɛ, tu gɛ nyu fiɛɛ gɛ. Geenɛ, muh nɛ jɛme fiɛɛ wu kaŋ nyu jee chi kichwa ki bige kì yɛɛde ki yeh yi kintanyɛ le, tu wù kɛme ki wu gê no wu jɛme wu kaŋ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/><char style="wj">Binfeeŋ binɛ! Bɛŋ le biyuŋ! Fiɛɛ fì kuge fì fede fimi le fì la? Baaŋ kuge kichwa ki bige kì yɛɛde noo, yeh yi kintanyɛ yì gee kichwa kiyu fɛ ki nyu fiɛɛ fì le fi Nyo le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ jɛme tɛ lɛ, ‘Nɛ muh jɛme fiɛɛ wu kaŋ jee chi kitana ki kintanyɛ, tu gɛ nyu fiɛɛ gɛ. Geenɛ muh jɛme fiɛɛ wu kaŋ nyu jee chi fiɛɛ fì muh nya kintanyɛ yu, tu wù kɛme ki wu gê no wu jɛme wu kaŋ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/><char style="wj">Binfeeŋ binɛ! Fiɛɛ fì kuge fì fede fimi le fì la? Baaŋ le nnya yì kuge noo, kitana ki kintanyɛ kì gee nnya yiyu nyume fiɛɛ fì le fi Nyo le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/><char style="wj">Fiɛɛ fì le, le lɛ nɛ muh kaŋ jee chi kitana ki kintanyɛ, tu wu kaŋ noo wu kaŋ mo mwɛɛ munchii mù nyume yu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh kaŋ jee chi yeh yi kintanyɛ, tu wu kaŋ noo wu kaŋ mo Nyo wù chee yu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/><char style="wj">Nɛ muh kaŋ woŋ wu we, tu wu kaŋ nyu kala wù Nyo mo wu wù Nyo wù shiide yì wu le.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>
    <char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ le bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye! Bɛŋ to bɛŋ nyaa kimbe kimimia Nyo le a ntɛnɛɛ a bimbe yuufe bi mwɛɛ yeye yeye mù bɛŋ kege bɛŋ gɛɛde a mbáa le lɛ yi yege, geenɛ bɛŋ nooŋe fiɛɛ fì jiji fì nchi jɛme kune fi lɛ bɛŋ gêe, fì le ki bɛŋ gêe mwɛɛ mù kooji fɛ bamii le, bɛŋ kôode yii fɛ bamii le mo ki bɛŋ lêese fitele yi Nyo le. Bɛŋ be kɛme ki bɛŋ gêe mwɛɛ munɛ munchii bɛŋ chinɛ gɛ fimi le gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/><char style="wj">Binfeeŋ bì duunyi je bamii le! Bɛŋ kuuji munyinyi bɛŋ bvuuse a mbvuuŋ le, geenɛ bɛŋ ka mii nyaŋ yì baaŋ ashɛŋ!</char><verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ le bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye! Bɛŋ chuge muŋkoo bɛ shú ye le, geenɛ mwɛɛ mù yisɛ yo le mù bɛŋ lode a bamii le mo mù bɛŋ yɛɛde ajii yu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/><char style="wj">Binfeeŋ bi Bafalashii, bɛŋ ya bɛŋ chugɛ muŋkoo bɛ shú nyu antɛŋ, mu mo mu yuude tɛ ye le.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>
    <char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ le bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye! Bɛŋ le njɛ jɛ́ŋ yì ba le ba seesɛ ba yefɛ yi tu yi baaŋ yi chuunyi ajii yi joŋe, geenɛ antɛŋ ayu nyu a yisɛ bɛ biŋkufɛ bi biŋkwe bi bamii mo mwɛɛ munchii mù yiide.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/><char style="wj">Le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no bɛŋ chuunyi ajii lɛ bɛŋ le bamii ba chaaŋ, geenɛ antɛŋ nyu bɛŋ yisɛ bɛ kinlɛlɛ mo gee chì befe.</char><verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>
    <char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le wene bɛŋ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bɛŋ Bafalashii. Bɛŋ le bamii ba jɛme yeye, bɛŋ gee yeye! Bɛŋ ba joone jɛ́ŋ yi bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo, bɛŋ yeefe tɛ jɛ́ŋ yi bamii ba gɛ̀ kɛme kinche kì chaaŋ bɛŋ seese yi joŋe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ gee noo bɛŋ duu lɛ, ‘Nɛ gɛ̀ bee bee nyu wa yu kife ki bachiji chiji le, tu bee gɛ̀ baaŋ lɛɛŋ gɛ fiesa fɛ fiɛɛ fì bo gɛ̀ ge fɛ ba yuuyɛ bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo gɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ jɛme noo, bɛŋ jɛme nyu kune bikwɛɛ biɛna bɛŋ mo toone bɛ de yene lɛ bɛŋ le booŋ ba bamii ba gɛ̀ yuuyi bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ mo bɛŋ gɛɛŋ lo fwe bɛŋ mɛsɛ bɛ lɛme chì bachiji chiji bena gɛ̀ kɛ!</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/><char style="wj">Yó chinɛ! Kiŋgogɛ ki yó lɛ kinɛ! Bɛŋ kwaji lɛ bɛŋ lé bɛŋ nyûme njɛ ba leesɛ bɛŋ yi ŋgu wu baaŋ le sɛŋ?</char><verse eid="MAT 23:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>
    <char style="wj">No fi le noo, mɛ mo ntune bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo fɛ bɛŋ le mo bamii ba bvufee bɛ bamii ba duunyi banchi. Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ yûuyi bamu, bɛŋ taayi bamu yi bintaaŋ le, bɛŋ suŋe bamu yéh yene yi buunɛ le, bɛŋ boone bikaa a bamu jiŋ a bilaantɛŋ le bichii bì bo gɛɛne bi le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gêe noo lɛ kilɛmɛ ki bamii bachii ba gɛ̀ chee kinche kì chaaŋ yi nshɛŋ yinɛ le ba bo gɛ̀ yuuyɛ ki nyû fɛ bɛŋ fwa. Kilɛmɛ kinɛ lé ki nyû fɛ bɛŋ fwa kɛge yi ki Abɛ wù ba gɛ̀ yuuyɛ njɛ wù kɛme jialɛ sɛŋ, to bu yi ki Sakiya wù mwa Belekaya wù bɛŋ gɛ̀ yuuyɛ antɛnɛɛ a yeh yi kintanyɛ bɛ kitana ki kintanyɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, loŋ wu mwɛɛ munɛ munchii lé wu gê wu koo kiŋgogɛ ki mɛɛse kinɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso kɛŋ ye fɛ bamii ba Yɛlusalɛm le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>No Jiso jɛmɛ nɛ, wu mo wu kɛŋ ye lɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛɛbɛɛ Yɛlusalɛm! Yɛɛbɛɛ Yɛlusalɛm! Wo wù yuuyi bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo, wo ka tume bamii ba Nyo tuŋ fɛ wo le bɛ ata! Le wa kiŋgane kimɛɛ no mɛ moŋ ki mbanyɛ booŋ buŋ njɛ no bweshii to wu banyɛ booŋ be yi kfugɛ a bibɛɛ bie le, wo faŋ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/><char style="wj">Bîjɛ yɛ̂ŋ yeh yo lé yi gê yi tu kinfu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe lo wo le lɛ gɛ wo baaŋ wo ka wo yɛŋ mɛne gɛ, gɛɛŋ bu kife kì wo le wo du lɛ, ‘Nyo le wu noŋ kimbonɛ yi muh wù too a jee chi Tada Nyo le.’”</char><verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso sɛɛŋ lɛ ba lé ba gê ba sa yeh yi kintanyɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliku 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Jiso bu yeh yi kintanyɛ le, wu doo wu gɛɛne, booŋ be ba ŋgoo kɛŋsɛ bo to mbebe ye le bo duunyi yéh yi fɛ yeh yi kintanyɛ le wu le. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Geenɛ, Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yɛde yéh chinɛ le? Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ gɛ tɛdɛ chimimia nyu chi shɛɛ yi chimi le njɛ ba kɛsɛ chi fɛkuu sɛŋ gɛ.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Jiso doo wu gɛɛŋ wu bɛɛŋ wu shii yi Mbegɛ wu Bite bi Olif le, booŋ be ba ŋgoo kɛŋsɛ bo to lɛbolɛbo fɛ wu le bo biih lɛ, “Gɛh sɛɛŋ bee kife kì fiɛɛ fiyu finɛ lé fi gê fì kooshɛ, mo njiŋɛ wù lé wu gê wu dûnyɛ kife kì wo lé wo gê wo kaasɛ wo to mo no lɛ woŋ kage wa lo?” <verse eid="MAT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Jiso chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ yɛ̂ne keefɛ muh to wu lɛɛ bɛ bɛŋ, bɛŋ jiaa je gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ bamii ba duude lé bo gê bo too bo jode jee chaŋ bo tɛyi fɛ jii, muh duu lɛ wu le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka. Bo doo bo gee noo bo lɛɛde bɛ bamii ba duude bo jiaade je.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ gê bɛŋ yuge lɛ ba tune jɛŋ, bɛŋ ka yuge tɛ basaaka lɛ jɛŋ le yi nyume. Bɛŋ doo bɛŋ yuge noo, keefɛ fitele gûde bɛŋ gɛ. Munɛ lé mwɛɛ mù kɛme ki mu gê mu kooshɛ. Geenɛ gɛ mu mo duunyi lɛ woŋ kage wa lo gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/><char style="wj">Kituŋ lé ki gê ki tune jɛŋ bɛ kimi, nfoŋ wumu tune jɛŋ bɛ wumu. Jɛŋ lé yi gê yi koode, nshɛŋ lé yi gê yi shîiŋshi manjuu le manjuu le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/><char style="wj">Mwɛɛ munɛ munchii baaŋ gɛh lo nsasɛ njɛ sege kwɛse kɛ lume.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>
    <char style="wj">Bamii lé bo gê bo nya bɛŋ ba nyiɛge bɛ bɛŋ, ba yuuyɛ bɛŋ. Bituŋ bichii lé bi gê bi banɛ bɛŋ nje jee chaŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/><char style="wj">Noo, bamii ba duude mo bo chii bikaa a mɛ jiŋ, bo banɛ bikwɛɛ biboo, bo gese bikwɛɛ biboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/><char style="wj">Bamii ba duude ba mbiane lɛ tuŋ Nyo bo, bo lé bo jâ bo bunɛ bo lɛɛde bɛ bamii wesee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/><char style="wj">No kimbefɛ lé ki gê ki duude ki gɛɛne lo fwe, ki ge kiŋkoŋɛ ki bamii ba duude mo ki tu wɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, muh wù lé wu gê wu kaaŋ shɛ́ŋ gɛɛŋ bu fɛkimɛsɛ lé wù gê wu bonɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/><char style="wj">Bo kɛme gɛh ki bo ge bo fêjɛ saaka wù joŋe wunɛ wù kune bvunfoŋ bvu Nyo gɛɛŋ bu yi kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ le kichii bituŋ bichii yu, noo, fɛ woŋ ge wu ka.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune kife ki ŋgɛ wù baaŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliku 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>
    <char style="wj">Noo sege bɛŋ yɛŋ kiŋgha ki fiɛɛ kì taŋlo ki chɛŋɛ bɛ kijusɛ kì muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo wù Danyɛ gɛ̀ jɛme kune ki, ki lɛme wa yeh yi kintanyɛ le, muh wù tɛŋe ŋwa wunɛ yu finɛ chuule,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/><char style="wj">bamii ba le Judia mo bo fɛɛ lo bo bɛɛŋ yi bambegɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ muh wù le kigo ki yeh le ka wu shii wu lee ki wu jô fiɛɛ fì le yeh gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/><char style="wj">Keefɛ muh wu le mwɛne ka wu kaase wu kwɛɛde lɛ wu to ki wu jô kikuŋ wu noŋ ye le gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/><char style="wj">Ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le yi aju kaa le, lé wu gê wù nyu wu bikɛse ba le bɛ chifwe, mo ba yaŋse booŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ bûune lɛ keefɛ kinlegɛ kinɛ ki nyû yi kife ki nfuŋ le, kɛnɛ juu chi yuuŋ gɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/><char style="wj">nje ŋgɛ wù baaŋ lé wu gê wu nyûme kife kɛɛ le, kfuu chi wu wɛɛ ŋgɛ gɛ̀ baaŋ a nyu gɛ yu gɛ, kɛge no woŋ gɛ̀ kɛ too bude mɛɛse, gɛ kfuu chi wu wɛɛ baaŋ wu ka wu yu wù nyu yu gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/><char style="wj">Nɛ Nyo gɛ̀ baaŋ gade gɛ aju a ŋgɛ ayu gɛ, tu muh wu wuŋ wu mumwaa bee gɛ wu bonɛ gɛ. Geenɛ wu gɛ̀ gade aju ayu nje bamii be ba wu gɛ̀ cha.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/><char style="wj">Lé doo nyûme sege kɛɛ nɛ muh lé wu jɛ̂mɛ bɛŋ le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka nɛ wu wunɛ fɛnɛ!’ Kɛnɛ lɛ, ‘Nɛ wu wege fege!’ Keefɛ bɛŋ bɛ̂ɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ bamii lé bo gê bo too bo mbiane lɛ bo le bambvusɛ ba Nyo gɛ̀ ka, bamu duu lɛ bo le bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo, bo mo bo gee mwɛɛ mù tɛɛme mù duunyi bvuŋga bvuboo, bo gee tɛ mwɛɛ mù jwe yune, ki bo lɛ̂ɛde bɛ bamii bo jiaade je, bo lɛ̂ɛde mo tɛ bɛ bamii ba Nyo gɛ̀ cha wa, nɛ je le yu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, nle nsɛɛŋ wa mwɛɛ munɛ bɛŋ le fɛ mu ge mu kooshi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/><char style="wj">Noo, bamii ja bo duu bɛŋ le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka nɛ wu wege chvuuŋ’, keefɛ bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ fo gɛ. Kɛnɛ lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, nɛ wu wunɛ yeh antɛŋ’, keefɛ bɛŋ bɛ̂ɛŋ bo le gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ no jaŋ to yi lale we kimbe kì juu saane le, yi baaŋ yi gɛɛŋ yi bu a juu seele yo, le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no nto wu muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gê wu nyûme.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/><char style="wj">‘Mo nyu faaŋ fɛ gvunɛ chi fiɛɛ to chi nyume fo, le gɛh fo fɛ baŋgvuluŋ to bo taashi fo.’</char><verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kune no Jiso lé wu gê wu tô</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliku 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>
    <char style="wj">Kimimia, sege kife ki ŋgɛ wù baaŋ wunɛ to wa ki fe, juu ja gɛh nɛ chi jimɛ, kwii gɛ ka wu baaŋ gɛ, jóŋ jade fɛwe yi gweeyi, mwɛɛ mù fɛwe munchii mù kɛme bvuŋga shiiŋshi.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/><char style="wj">Njiŋɛ wu muh wù jee che le Mwamuh mo wu bunɛ yi kibvulɛ le. Bituŋ bichii bi yi nshɛŋ le mo bi kɛ bi fuge lo bɛ kwe. Bamii lé bo gê bo yɛŋ no muh wù jee che le Mwamuh too yi kimbɛ le fɛwe bɛ bvuŋga mo bvukugɛ bvù baaŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/><char style="wj">Sege soŋ yì baaŋ ge doo yi jɛmɛ fɛwɛɛwe, wu mo wu chiiŋsɛ banchɛndaa be bo gɛɛŋ abu a woŋ le ana mo fɛwe, bo banyɛ bamii be ba wu le wu cha wa.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliku 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>
    <char style="wj">Bɛŋ yɛ̂yɛ fiɛɛ yi kiŋgvuŋ le. Chɛ́ too yi boji, biŋkamɛ kɛ bi choone yi chɛ́ yiyu le, bɛŋ mo bɛŋ kɛɛ lɛ akfuuŋ kuse wa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/><char style="wj">Le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no bɛŋ ge doo bɛŋ yɛne mwɛɛ munɛ le munchii, bɛŋ mo bɛŋ kêe lɛ wu le wa mbebe le, mo a yeh fwɛɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ gɛ kiŋgogɛ ki mɛɛse kinɛ nyu ki to ki ka, njɛ mwɛɛ munɛ munchii kooshɛ sɛŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/><char style="wj">Kibvulɛ bɛ nshɛŋ lé ki tô ki ka, geenɛ gɛ̀ jɛ yaŋ nyu yi to yi shiiŋshɛ gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gɛ muh nyu yu wù kee juu chì Jiso lé wu gê wu tô gɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliku 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>
    <char style="wj">Geenɛ gɛ muh nyu yu wù kee juu chiyu kɛnɛ kife kiyu gɛ. Gɛ banchɛndaa ba Nyo ba fɛwe kɛnɛ Mwa Nyo kee tɛ gɛ. Kee gɛh Nyo wù Chiji maa.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/><char style="wj">Gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no fi gɛ̀ bee kife ki Nyua le, nyu gɛh no fi lé fi gê fi nyume kife kì muh wù jee che le Mwamuh kaase wu too.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/><char style="wj">Gɛ̀ bee joo baaŋ a yisɛ gɛ yi kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ le gɛ, bamii nyu fiboo bo jii mwɛɛ bo ka muu, bikɛse bɛ bilɛŋsɛ taashi bvuguu, bamii nyaa booŋ ba bilɛŋsɛ bo taashi bvuguu bɛ bo, gɛɛŋ bu juu chì Nyua gɛ̀ lesɛ a ŋguh le,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/><char style="wj">bamii bayu gɛ̀ baaŋ kɛɛ gɛ fiɛɛ fì lé fi kôoshɛ gɛ̀, gɛɛŋ bu sege joo gɛ̀ yisɛ yi nshɛŋ le, yi kudɛ bo bachii yi gɛɛŋ bɛ bo. Le gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no fi lé fi gê fi nyume juu chì muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gê wu tô.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/><char style="wj">Bilɛŋsɛ bafɛɛ lé bo nyû mwɛne, ba jô wu mumwaa wu mumwaa shɛ̂ɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/><char style="wj">Bikɛse bafɛɛ lé bo gê bo goge bvulɛɛŋ fɛ jɛɛŋ, ba jô wu mumwaa wu mumwaa shɛ̂ɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/><char style="wj">Noo, bɛŋ mo bɛŋ chîɛɛne nje gɛ bɛŋ kee juu chì Tada wene lé wu gê wu tô gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ chiji yeh nɛ kee kife kì choŋ lé wu gê wu tô antaŋ, wu chîɛɛne, wu gɛ ka wu chinɛ lɛ wu to wu ŋgode yeh ye gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ, bɛŋ tɛ kɛme ki bɛŋ chîɛɛne nje muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gê wu kaasɛ wu to kife kì bɛŋ kee gɛ le.</char><verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune mwa lɛme wù nchiɛɛŋ mo wù le gɛ wù nchiɛɛŋ gɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>
    <char style="wj">Mwa lɛme wù le wù nchiɛɛŋ wù ka kɛme bvufee le wù la? Gɛ nyume muh wɛɛ wù chiji kikwɛɛ ke le wu gɛɛ wu lɛ wu jîiŋe fɛ yeh ye le, sege kife doo ki kojɛ, wu nya mwɛɛ munjile booŋ be ba lɛme le gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/><char style="wj">Kinlaŋye kì baaŋ lé ki gê ki nyume ki mwa lɛme wù chiji kikwɛɛ ke, sege wu doo wu too wu yɛŋ wù gee lɛme gɛh yɛɛŋyɛɛŋ no wu bee ki wù gee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ chiji kikwɛɛ ke lé wu gê wu bɛɛŋsɛ wu, wu jiiŋe fɛ mwɛɛ mwe le munchii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, nɛ mwa lɛme wɛɛ ja wù kɛme kiŋge kì befe, wu jɛmɛ kikwɛɛ ke le lɛ, ‘Gɛ chiji kikwɛɛ kaŋ nyu wu yaŋsɛ wu kaasɛ wu to gɛ’,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/><char style="wj">wu mo wu kɛ wu suŋe booŋ ba lɛme bamu ba bɛ bo lɛne, wu jii mwɛɛ wu ka muu bɛ bamii ba yaane mbvuuŋ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/><char style="wj">tu chiji kikwɛɛ ke lé wu gê wu ja gɛh wu bunɛ juu chimi chì wu be kwaji gɛ, bɛ kife kì wu be kee gɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/><char style="wj">Wu doo wu bu noo, wu mo wu gwoojɛ lo mwa ye wu lɛme wɛɛ, wu chiiŋsɛ wu wu gɛɛŋ wù nyu bɛ bamii ba jɛme yeye, bo gee yeye le, nyu fo fɛ bamii lé bo gê bo beede bo ŋgeji bige.”</char><verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune ŋgóoŋ yi bikɛse yimi yuufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>
    <char style="wj">“Lé tô nyû kife kɛɛ le taŋlo ba beji bvunfoŋ bvù fɛwe bɛ ŋgóoŋ yi bikɛse yimi yuufe ba gɛ̀ jo bin'yesɛ biboo, bo bu ki bo gɛɛŋ bo fi chiji bvuguu wumu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/><char style="wj">Bo gɛ̀ bee noo batɛŋ nyu biyuŋ, batɛŋ nyu bafeefe.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/><char style="wj">Fì le lɛ ba gɛ̀ bee biyuŋ gɛ̀ jo bin'yesɛ biboo bo gɛ ka bo jo mɛɛ mamu mbebe le gɛ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/><char style="wj">geenɛ ba gɛ̀ feefe baa jo biboo bin'yesɛ bo ka bo jo mɛɛ mamu mbebe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/><char style="wj">Bo gɛɛŋ bo chiɛɛne chiji bvuguu wɛɛ, wu she yo wesee fɛ wu to, lefɛ mo chi kɛ chi jode bo, bo mo bo lee.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/><char style="wj">Lɛ nyume antaŋ antɛnɛɛ, bo ja bo yu muh wuule lɛ, ‘Yilili Yilili, bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, chiji bvuguu wunɛ lɛɛɛ! Bɛŋ bû bɛŋ tô bɛŋ fî wu lɛɛɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/><char style="wj">Ŋgóoŋ yi bikɛse baa bachii mo bo ja we bo bɛɛŋsɛ bin'yesɛ biboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/><char style="wj">Ŋgóoŋ yi bikɛse ba gɛ̀ bee biyuŋ baa bo jɛmɛ ba gɛ̀ feefe baa le lɛ, ‘Kii bɛŋ, bɛŋ nya bee bɛ mɛɛ mɛna mamu. Bin'yesɛ biɛsa shiide wa lo.’</char><figure style="fig" alt="Lamp" file="hk00151c.tif" size="col" loc="Mch 25:8" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="25:8">Kin'yesɛ</figure> <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, ba gɛ̀ feefe baa chvuu lɛ, ‘Gɛ mo nyu mo kojɛ fɛ bee le bachii gɛ. Bɛŋ gɛɛŋ nyu fɛ bamii ba gese le, bɛŋ gu mɛna.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/><char style="wj">No bo gɛ̀ gɛɛne ki bo gu, chiji bvuguu mo wu shɛɛ wu fɛsɛ. Baa ba gɛ̀ bee bo seesɛ wa ye yiboo bo chiɛɛne, bo mo bo gɛɛŋ bo lee bɛ wu yeh yi ŋka wu bvuguu le, bo mo bo faa kimbuŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/><char style="wj">Ajiŋ ayu ŋgóoŋ yi bikɛse yimi chiɛɛ bo gɛ̀ gɛnɛ ki bo gu mɛɛ fɛsɛ tɛ, bo lɛɛŋ a nfwɛɛŋ bo tu bo duu lɛ, ‘Chiji kikwɛɛ, chiji kikwɛɛ, gwenyɛ kimbuŋ bee lee.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, wu chvuu bo le lɛ, ‘Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ gɛh ŋkee bɛŋ gɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/><char style="wj">Fi mo fi nyu lɛ, bɛŋ sêesɛ ye, bɛŋ chîɛɛne, nje gɛ bɛŋ kee juu kɛnɛ kife kiyu gɛ.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋgaŋ kune booŋ ba lɛme batɛde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>
    <char style="wj">Kife kiyu le fi lé fi gê fi nyu njɛ muh mu wù gɛ̀ gɛɛne njiɛnyɛ, wu tɛɛŋ booŋ be ba lɛme lɛ wu gɛɛ kwa we chiaaŋ yiboo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/><char style="wj">Wu gɛ̀ nya mwa wu lɛme wumu bikɛɛ bi bige bitɛŋ, wu nya wumu bikɛɛ bifɛɛ, wu nya wumu kikɛɛ ki bige kimimia. Wu gɛ̀ nyaa wu bii no bvuŋga bvu muh le. No wu gɛ̀ nya noo, wu mo wu la njiɛnyɛ we.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/><char style="wj">Mwa wu lɛme wù gɛ̀ fi bikɛɛ bi bige bitɛŋ mo wu gɛɛŋ kimimia wu ge waaŋ yu, wu ji mbe bikɛɛ bitɛŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/><char style="wj">Wù gɛ̀ fi bikɛɛ bifɛɛ wu ge tɛ waaŋ, wu ji mbe bikɛɛ bifɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, mwa lɛme wù gɛ̀ fi kikɛɛ kimimia wɛɛ, gɛɛŋ fie wu chiŋ fɛkuu wu nyilɛ bige bi chiji kikwɛɛ wɛɛ fo.</char><verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Chiji kikwɛɛ wu booŋ ba lɛme baa gɛ̀ la njiɛnyɛ we, wu gɛɛŋ wu che yo wesee. Wu gɛ̀ doo wu kaasɛ wu to, wu mo wu tɛɛŋ booŋ be ba lɛme lɛ bɛ bo najɛ mwɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/><char style="wj">Mwa lɛme wù gɛ̀ fi bikɛɛ bi bige bitɛŋ mo wu to nyu bɛ bikɛɛ yuufe, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Chiji kikwɛɛ, wo gɛ̀ nya mɛ bikɛɛ bi bige bitɛŋ, bîjɛ yɛ̂ŋ, nle nshɛɛ ŋge waaŋ yu, ŋkɛme bimi bikɛɛ bitɛŋ yu we.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/><char style="wj">Chiji kikwɛɛ wɛɛ jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, ‘Kiyone baaŋ. Wo le mwa lɛme wù joŋe wo ka nyume wù nchiɛɛŋ! Wo le wo shɛɛ wo kɛɛ ki wo bîjɛ fɛ fiɛɛ fì shige le. Noo, nlé ŋgɛ̂ɛ wo mɛɛse wo jîiŋe nyu fɛ fì kuge le. Lêe antɛnɛɛ a bvujoŋɛ bvu chiji kikwɛɛ kuŋ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/><char style="wj">Mwa lɛme wù bie bige gɛ̀ bee bikɛɛ bifɛɛ to tɛ, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Chiji kikwɛɛ, wo gɛ̀ nya mɛ bikɛɛ bi bige bifɛɛ. Bîjɛ yɛ̂ŋ, nle nshɛɛ ŋge waaŋ yu, ŋkɛme bimi bikɛɛ bi bige bifɛɛ yu we.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/><char style="wj">Chiji kikwɛɛ wɛɛ jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, ‘Kiyone baaŋ wo le mwa lɛme wù joŋe wo ka nyume wù nchiɛɛŋ! Wo le wo shɛɛ wo kɛɛ ki wo bîjɛ fɛ fiɛɛ fì shige le. Noo, nlé ŋgɛ̂ɛ wo mɛɛse wo jîiŋe nyu fɛ fì kuge le. Lee antɛnɛɛ a bvujoŋɛ bvu chiji kikwɛɛ kuŋ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/><char style="wj">Mwa lɛme wumu wɛɛ wù gɛ̀ fi kikɛɛ ki bige kimimia to tɛ, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Chiji kikwɛɛ, ŋkee lɛ wo le muh wù tɛɛme ajiŋ. Wo to wo gweji wo baaŋ booŋ gɛ, wo gwode agiŋ wo baaŋ a noŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/><char style="wj">Noo, mɛ mo nfaaŋ ŋgɛɛŋ nyilɛ bige biuŋ fɛkuu. Bîjɛ wo yɛŋ, nɛ bige biuŋ binɛ, kô.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ chiji kikwɛɛ wɛɛ chvuu wu le lɛ, ‘Wo le mwa lɛme wù befe, wo le kiŋkwɛŋ! Wo gɛ̀ kee lɛ nto ŋgweji mbaaŋ mbooŋ gɛ, mbaanyi agiŋ mbaaŋ noŋ gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/><char style="wj">No wo gɛ̀ kee noo, tu wo gɛ̀ bee wo gɛɛ bige biaŋ a chvu le lɛ sege ŋkaasɛ nfi bige biaŋ biyu bɛ mbe yu we.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/><char style="wj">No wu jɛme noo, wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ ba fî kikɛɛ ki bige kiyu a wu le, ba nyâ wù gɛ̀ kɛme bikɛɛ bi bige yuufe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ muh wù kɛme ba lé ba bîsɛ lo wu kɛme fi duude. Geenɛ muh wù kɛme gɛ, lé ba nyû ba fî mo fiɛɛ fì shige fì wu kɛme.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/><char style="wj">No wu jɛme noo wu mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ nôŋ kinɛnɛ ki mwa lɛme kinɛ kijibɛ le akfuuŋ, fɛ bamii lé bo gê bo beede fo bo ŋgeji bige.’</char><verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛyɛ kune nsa wù fɛkimɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>
    <char style="wj">Doo nyume kife ki muh wù jee che le Mwamuh kaase wu too bɛ bvukugɛ bwe, wu too bɛ banchɛndaa ba Nyo bachii, wu mo wu shii yi kala we wu bvukugɛ le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/><char style="wj">Bituŋ bichii bi yi kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ le banyɛ a wù fwe, wu mo wu ga bo njɛ no muh wu chiɛɛne to wu ga shóŋ wu bvusɛ yi a bí ntɛnɛɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/><char style="wj">Wu lé wu gɛ̀ɛ shóŋ kibo kinchiɛɛŋ le, wu gɛɛ bí kibo kiŋkoŋo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/><char style="wj">Wu wù Nfoŋ mo wu du baa bo le kibo kinchiɛɛŋ le lɛ, ‘Bamii ba chii le wu noŋ kimbonɛ yi bo le, bɛŋ to bɛŋ kɛme kijusɛ antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvu wu gɛ̀ seesɛ fɛ bɛŋ le kɛge no ba gɛ̀ fɛ woŋ,</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/><char style="wj">nje jɛŋ gɛ̀ yuu mɛ, bɛŋ nya mɛ bɛ mwɛɛ munjile. Kindoŋ gɛ̀ yune mɛ, bɛŋ nya mɛ bɛ fiɛɛ fì mɛ muu. Ŋgɛ̀ bee ntolo, bɛŋ fi mɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/><char style="wj">Ŋgɛ̀ bee kichinɛ kiyɛse, bɛŋ jii nju ye yaŋ le. Ŋgɛ̀ chɛne bɛŋ to bɛŋ yɛsɛ mɛne. Ŋgɛ̀ bee yeh yi ncha le, bɛŋ to bɛŋ yɛsɛ mɛne.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/><char style="wj">Wu doo wu ge wu jɛme noo, bamii ba chaaŋ bayu mo bo biih wu le lɛ, ‘Tada, le sege la wù bee gɛ̀ yɛŋ wo le jɛŋ yuu wo, bee nya wo mwɛɛ munjile, kɛnɛ sege la wù kindoŋ gɛ̀ yune wo bee nya fiɛɛ fì wo mu?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/><char style="wj">Le sege la wù bee gɛ̀ yɛŋ wo le wo nyu ntolo, bee fi wo, kɛnɛ kichinɛ kiyɛse, bee jii nju ye yo le?</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/><char style="wj">Le sege la wù bee gɛ̀ yɛŋ wo le wo chɛne kɛnɛ wo nyu yeh yi ncha le, bee to be yɛsɛ wo le?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/><char style="wj">Nfoŋ mo wu chvûu bo le lɛ, ‘Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ no bɛŋ gɛ̀ gee mwɛɛ munɛ, fɛ muh wù shige le fɛ booŋ ba bwɛɛŋ banɛ le, tu bɛŋ gɛ̀ ge nyu fɛ mɛne.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/><char style="wj">Noo, wu mo wu du baa bò le a kibo kiŋkoŋo le lɛ, ‘Bɛŋ ba loŋ le wu koo, bɛŋ jâ lo a mɛ jii, bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ lêe yi ŋgu wù kage gɛ le, wù ba gɛ̀ seesɛ fɛ debele le bɛ banchɛndaa be,</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/><char style="wj">nje jɛŋ gɛ̀ yuu mɛ, bɛŋ gɛ nya mɛ bɛ fiɛɛ fijile gɛ. Kindoŋ gɛ̀ yune mɛ, bɛŋ gɛ nya mɛ bɛ fiɛɛ lɛ mɛ mu gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/><char style="wj">Ŋgɛ̀ bee ntolo, bɛŋ gɛ fi mɛ gɛ. Ŋgɛ̀ bee kichinɛ kiyɛse, bɛŋ gɛ jii mɛ nju gɛ. Ŋgɛ̀ nchɛne, ŋka nyu yeh yi ncha le, bɛŋ gɛ to bɛŋ yɛsɛ mɛne gɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/><char style="wj">Bo tɛ mo bo ge bo biih wu le lɛ, ‘Tada, le sege la wù bee gɛ̀ yɛŋ wo le jɛŋ yuu wo, kɛnɛ kindoŋ yune wo, kɛnɛ wo nyu ntolo, kɛnɛ kichinɛ kiyɛse, kɛnɛ wo chɛne, kɛnɛ yeh yi ncha le, bee gɛ fih wo gɛ?’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/><char style="wj">Wu mo wu chvuu bo le lɛ, ‘Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, no bɛŋ gɛ̀ baaŋ ge gɛ mwɛɛ munɛ, fɛ muh wù shige le fɛ booŋ ba bwɛɛŋ banɛ le gɛ, tu bɛŋ gɛ̀ baaŋ ge gɛ nyu fɛ mɛne gɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/><char style="wj">Bobaa bamii mo bo gɛ̂ɛŋ bo lêe ŋgɛ wù kage gɛ le. Geenɛ, baa bò le chaaŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bo lêe fiboo nyu kinche kì kage gɛ le.”</char><verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Bo ka munaŋ a Jiso jiŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliku 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joŋ 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Jiso jɛmɛ mwɛɛ munɛ munchii wu mɛsɛ, wu jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/><char style="wj">“Bɛŋ kêe lɛ shɛge wa aju afaa, mo nyume Ŋka wu Ndaŋfe, ba lé ba nyâ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh chiaaŋ yi bamii le ba ta wu yi kintaaŋ le.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Gɛh kife kiyu le, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ mo bo gɛɛŋ bo banyɛ ye a nto wu Kayfa wù gɛ̀ bee kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ le, <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>bo chu ntaŋ no bo lé bo gê bo wɛɛnɛ fɛ bo koo Jiso, bo yuuyɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Bo doo bo chude ntaŋ noo, bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Keefɛ bee moŋ fiɛɛ finɛ kife ki Ŋka wunɛ le gɛ, nje bee moŋ lo, fi to bɛ jwe a bamii ntɛnɛɛ.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwɛse wumu yefɛ Jiso bɛ mɛɛ mà gwee wuŋ Bɛtani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliku 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joŋ 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Jiso gɛ̀ bee ntɛ wù Bɛtani le, a Samoŋ yeh wù gɛ̀ bee muh goŋ yì baaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Bo shii bo jii mwɛɛ, kwɛse wumu ja wu lee bɛ fikaaŋ fimi ba kɛnyi bɛ tɛdɛ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fikaaŋ finɛ le ba gɛ̀ kɛnyi bɛ tɛdɛ chi ba tɛŋe lɛ, “alabasta”.</char></note> nyu fi mɛɛ mamu mà gwee wuŋ, mò tɛɛme kwa baaŋ, wu mo wu fuushɛ yi kikwɛɛ ki Jiso le. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo yɛŋ noo fiɛɛ fiyu toonyɛ lo bo. Bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Wu chɛŋe bɛ mɛɛ mayu nɛ nje la? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Bee taŋlo ba gesɛ mɛɛ manɛ yi bige le wesee, ba nya bige biyu bamii ba fuude le.” <verse eid="MAT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Geenɛ, Jiso kɛɛ ŋkwajɛ wuboo, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ nyaa ŋgɛ kwɛse wunɛ le nɛ nje la? Wu le wu ge nyu fiɛɛ fì joŋe fɛ mɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ kêe lɛ bamii ba fuude lé bo gê bo nyu bena bo segechii, geenɛ gɛ mɛ nyu ŋge nyume bɛ bɛŋ segechii gɛ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/><char style="wj">Wu fuushi mɛɛ manɛ ye yaŋ le nɛ wu seese nyu njiiyɛ waŋ.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ mo nyu faaŋ fɛ ba lé ba gê ba feeji saaka wù joŋe wunɛ yi kikwɛɛ ki nshɛŋ le kichii fiɛɛ fì kwɛse wunɛ ge ba lé ba sɛ̂ŋe tɛ ki ba kwaji wu.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Juda gesɛ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliku 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joŋ 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Muh mu ŋgoo yi booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Jiso ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ le, wù ba gɛ̀ tɛŋe lɛ Juda Ɛkaliot mo wu ja wu gɛɛŋ fɛ bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ le, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>wu biih bo le lɛ, “Mɛ nɛ nyâ Jiso chiaaŋ yene le, bɛŋ nyâ mɛ la?” Bo mo bo taŋ bige mbanshɛ bì ba kɛnyi bɛ kichwa kì baaŋ, bo nya wu le. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Kɛge sege kɛɛ le, wu mo wu kɛ wu goone je yì wu lé wu nyâ Jiso chiaaŋ yiboo le.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ji Ŋka wu Ndaŋfe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliku 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:30">Joŋ 13:30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Lɛ doo nyume juu chi fwe chi Ŋka wu Blɛd wù ba baaŋ gɛɛ gɛ Kinshilɛ yo gɛ, booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Jiso to fɛ wu le, bo biih wu le lɛ, “Wo goone lɛ bee gɛɛŋ be seesɛ fɛ wo lé wo jî Ŋka wu Ndaŋfe fo nyu faaŋ?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Wu chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ alaantɛŋ, bɛŋ lé bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ muh mu le, bɛŋ du wu le lɛ, ‘Muh wu N'yɛyɛ duu lɛ kife ke le ki kojɛ ka. Wu lé wu ji Ŋka wu Ndaŋfe bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo nyu a wo yeh.’”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Booŋ ba ŋgoo bayu gɛɛŋ bo ge gɛh no Jiso be jɛmɛ bo le, bo mo bo seesɛ mwɛɛ munjile mu Ŋka wu Ndaŋfe wuyu fo. <verse eid="MAT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Lɛ to nyume fɛnfu, wu shii bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ ki bo jii. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Lɛ bo doo bo jii mwɛɛ, wu ja wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe bɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ lɛ, muh mu bɛŋ le, lé wu gê wu gêsɛ mɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>No wu jɛmɛ noo, booŋ be ba ŋgoo tu bo nyume yii yii, bo kɛ bo biide wu le wu mumwaa wu mumwaa lɛ, “Le mɛ Tada?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Wu chvuu bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Muh wù lé wu gêsɛ mɛ le wù leesɛ kibo a shu le besa wu.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/><char style="wj">Muh wù jee che le Mwamuh lé wu gɛ̂ɛŋ gɛh no ba gɛ̀ saŋ kune wu. Geenɛ, ŋgɛ wù baaŋ le fɛ muh wu le wu gesɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh le. Fi be joŋe fɛ wuwɛɛ muh le lɛ keefɛ ba bôo wu gɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Juda wù gɛ̀ bee ki wu gêsɛ Jiso biih tɛ wu le lɛ, “Muh wu N'yɛyɛ le mɛ?” Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo le wo jɛmɛ bɛ jwe wo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso bɛ booŋ be ji ntɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliku 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kolɛŋ 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>No bo jii mwɛɛ, Jiso ja wu jo blɛd, wu nya kiyone Nyo le, wu bweeyɛ wu nya booŋ be ba ŋgoo le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ ko bɛŋ ji, finɛ le ye yaŋ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Wu ka wu jo tɛ fiŋkoo, wu nya kiyone Nyo le wu mo wu nya fiŋkoo fiyu bo le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ mu bɛŋ bachii.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/><char style="wj">Finɛ le kilɛmɛ kaŋ kì Nyo le wu gwo maŋkaŋ yu ki bu nje bamii ba duude, wu lɛ wu lé wu lɛ̂ɛshɛ bimbefɛ biboo.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/><char style="wj">Nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ gɛ mbaaŋ ŋka mu mbvuuŋ ma nchwɛŋ wu kite kì laane manɛ gɛ, kɛge mɛɛse gɛɛne bude juu chì nlé ŋgê mû manfɛŋ besabɛŋ antɛnɛɛ a bvunfoŋ bvu Chii gɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ mɛsɛ, bo yɛɛŋ ŋkee wu mbɛɛŋsɛ, bo mo bo bu bo bɛɛŋ bo gɛɛŋ yi Mbegɛ wu Bite bi Olif le.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso jɛmɛ lɛ Bita lé wu gê wu faŋ wu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliku 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joŋ 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>No Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ gɛɛne, wu ja wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Kintaŋ ki abɛŋ kinɛ le bɛŋ bachii lé bɛŋ gê bɛŋ chii bikaa a mɛ jiŋ nje fiɛɛ fì lé fi gê fi kooshɛ bɛ mɛ. Le no ba le ba saŋ lɛ Nyo duu lɛ, ‘Nlé ŋgê n'yûuyɛ nchiɛnɛ shóŋ, ŋgoo yi shóŋ saaŋɛ.’</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, sege Nyo bvusɛ mɛ yi kwe le, nsa bɛŋ fwe Galalee.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Bita mo wu jɛmɛ lo fie wu le lɛ, “Nɛ bamii bachii nɛ chile lo bikaa a wo jiŋ nje fiɛɛ fì lé fi gê fi kooshɛ bɛ wo, tu gɛ taŋlo n'yu nto nchii bikaa a wo jiŋ gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛŋe wo nchiɛɛŋ lɛ kintaŋ ki abɛŋ kinɛ le, nyishii lé yi gê yi toŋ, wo nyu wo faŋ wa mɛ kiŋgane kintɛde.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Bita jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Mo fi nyume lɛ nlé ŋkwê lo besa wo, tu gɛ taŋlo n'yu nfaŋ wo gɛ.” No wu jɛmɛ noo, booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Jiso bamu baa bachii jɛmɛ gɛh tɛ noo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso buunɛ Gɛsɛmani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliku 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Jiso bɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo gɛ̀ gɛɛŋ bo lee Gɛsɛmani fɛ mwɛ wu muntaŋ wumu le, Jiso jɛmɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ shii fɛnɛ ŋkɛŋsɛ fege mbuunɛ.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Wu jo Bita bɛ booŋ ba Jɛbɛdi ba bafɛɛ, bɛ bo gɛɛŋ. Wu kɛ wu tu wù nyu yii yii, fitele fie fuuŋse wu. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Wu mo wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Fitele fiaŋ le yii yii baaŋ njɛ ŋkwe lo. Bɛŋ shɛ̂ɛ fɛnɛ bɛŋ chîɛɛne!”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>No wu jɛmɛ noo, wu mo wu kɛŋsɛ wu gɛɛŋ fwe shige, wu gwe wu tuŋ bvushi fɛkuu wu mo wu buunɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Chii, nɛ je bee yu yì taŋlo wo ge fiŋkoo fi ŋgɛ finɛ fe lɛ keefɛ mɛ mu gɛ, wo ge. Geenɛ, keefɛ wo gê no ŋgoone gɛ, gêe no wo goone.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Wu gɛ̀ ja wu kaasɛ wu tu jiŋ fɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le, wu yɛŋ bo lefe. Wu biih Bita le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Fi le lɛ gɛ taŋlo bɛŋ shii bɛ mɛ we gɛɛŋ bu ntaŋ wu kife wu mumwaa gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ nyûme we, bɛŋ bûune lɛ keefɛ moŋ ge wu to fɛ bɛŋ le gɛ. Le nchiɛɛŋ lɛ fitele koŋe lo, geenɛ nyaŋ yi ye wɛɛyi.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Wu ka wu kaasɛ wu gɛɛŋ kiŋgane kinfɛɛ wu buunɛ lɛ, <char style="wj">“Chii, nɛ fi le lɛ gɛ fiŋkoo finɛ taŋlo fi fe lɛ keefɛ mɛ mu gɛ, wo ge gɛh no wo koŋe.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Wu doo wu kaasɛ wu tu jiŋ wu ka wu yɛŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo lefe nje lefɛ gɛ̀ bee bo ajii baaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Wu ka wu chinɛ bo le, wu kaasɛ wu gɛɛŋ wu ka wu buunɛ kiŋgane kintɛde, wu buune wu jɛme gɛh nyu fiɛɛ fì wu be jɛmɛ wa. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Wu ka wu kaasɛ wu tu jiŋ fɛ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ baaŋ gɛh bɛŋ lefe bɛŋ fufe shɛŋ? Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, kife le ki kojɛ ka. Ba lé ba gêsɛ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh bamii ba befe le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ jâ we besabɛŋ gɛ̂ɛne. Bɛŋ jîŋɛ bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ, nɛ muh wù gesɛ mɛ wunɛ wu too wa.”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bo koo Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliku 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joŋ 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Gɛh no Jiso gɛ̀ baaŋ wu jɛme noo, Juda wù gɛ̀ bee muh wu ŋgoo yi booŋ ba Jiso ba yuufe ncho bafɛɛ mo wu bu. Wu gɛ̀ too bɛ kinchvu ki bamii kì baaŋ, bo kɛme nyó bɛ bimbuge, gɛ̀ tuŋ bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ mo bamii ba sage woŋ. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Gɛ̀ bee muh wù gɛ̀ gesɛ Jiso wu seesɛ wa njiŋɛ bɛ bamii bayu, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Muh wù nlé ŋgê, ŋkfugɛ nshiŋɛ, tu le wu, bɛŋ mo bɛŋ koo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>No bɛ bo to, wu mo wu gɛɛŋ lo fɛ Jiso le kimimia wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “N'yɛɛse wo le Muh wu N'yɛyɛ.” No wu jɛmɛ noo, wu mo wu kfugɛ wu wu shiŋɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Jiso jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsaa yaŋ, gee lo fiɛɛ fì wo to ki wo gê.”</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kɛnɛ le, “Nsaa yaŋ, wo ge fì wo bee ki ge la.” </char></note> Bamii baa mo bo gɛɛŋ lo fɛ Jiso le bo koo wu, bo fajɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ muh mu wù gɛ̀ bee bɛ Jiso wu mo wu bvusɛ nyo yi jɛŋ, wu chuŋ kintuŋ ki nfwa wu kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ yu, ki suunɛ. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Jiso jɛmɛ muh wuyu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Kaasɛ chvuu nyo yo fɛ kijusɛ ke le. Wo kêe lɛ muh wuchii wù chiaase nyo we, lé wu gê, wu kwe yi nyo le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/><char style="wj">Wo kwaji lɛ gɛ taŋlo ndu Chii chiiŋsɛ banchɛndaa be fɛnɛ kimimia banchvuge le, bo fede ŋgoo yuufe ncho yifiɛɛ gɛ?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, nja ŋge noo, fi ge fi jiɛnyɛ nɛɛ fɛ fi kooshɛ no ba gɛ̀ saŋ a Ŋwa wu Nyo le, no fi kɛme ki fi nyume?”</char><verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Sege kɛɛ, Jiso mo wu biih kinchvu kɛɛ le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛŋ to ki bɛŋ kôo mɛ, bɛŋ tu too nyu bɛ nyó yi jɛŋ mo bimbuge njɛ bɛŋ too ki bɛŋ kôo nyume muh wu too bɛ ŋgɛ woŋ le? Nchi nshee lɛ juu lɛ juu nshiide yeh yi kintanyɛ le n'yɛyi bamii fo, fɛ bɛŋ koo mɛ sɛŋ, nje la?</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/><char style="wj">Geenɛ, finɛ fichii jo kijusɛ ki fi to fi kojɛ no bamii ba ntuŋ wu Nyo gɛ̀ saŋ.”</char> Booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo bachii mo bo noŋ wu fo, bo fɛɛ lo.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso lɛɛŋ yeh yi nsa le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliku 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Joŋ 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Bamii ba gɛ̀ kolɛ Jiso mo bo jo wu bo gɛɛŋ bɛ wu fɛ Kayfa wù gɛ̀ bee chiji kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ. Bamii ba duunyi banchi ba Nyo bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ gɛ̀ taashɛ wa fo. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Bo gɛ̀ gɛɛne bɛ Jiso, Bita bii lo ajiŋ je yì ndefe le. Wu gɛɛŋ wu bu fɛ lakfulɛ chi kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ le, wu lee wu gɛɛŋ wu shii bɛ bamii ba gɛ̀ chiɛɛne la chiyu ki wu yɛ̂ŋ no fi lé fi gê fi jiɛnyɛ fi lɛɛŋ. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii bachii ba gɛ̀ sage bansa tu bo goone mwɛɛ mu chimbiaŋ mù bo kooyi yi Jiso le mù lé no mû ge ba yuuyɛ lo wu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Geenɛ, bo gɛ̀ baaŋ kɛme gɛ fiɛɛ gɛ, mo no bamii ba duude gɛ̀ too fwe bo bɛɛyi jiŋ yi nsa wu chimbiaŋ. Fi gɛ̀ jiɛnyɛ nɛ, bamii bamu bafɛɛ to bo lɛɛŋ fwe, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Fimbwɛ finɛ chi fi du lɛ fi taŋlo fi sa yeh yi kintanyɛ yi Nyo fi kaasɛ fi jooŋ yi aju le atade.” <verse eid="MAT 26:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ mo ki ja we ki biih Jiso le lɛ, “Gɛ wo kɛme fiɛɛ fì wo chvuu gɛ? Wo yuge gɛ̀ mwɛɛ mù bamii banɛ kooyi ye yo le?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Jiso mɛ gɛh jwe wu chile. Kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ kaasɛ ki jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “A jee chi Nyo wù kɛme kinche le, nɛ wo fɛnɛ le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka wu le Mwa Nyo, wo sɛɛŋ bee le.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Jiso chvuu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Fi le no wo jɛme. Geenɛ nsɛŋe bɛŋ le lɛ, ajiŋ a kife kinɛ bɛŋ lé bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ muh wù jee che le Mwamuh, wu shii a kibo kinchiɛɛŋ ki Muh wù kɛme Bvuŋga, bɛŋ ka bɛŋ yɛŋ no wu too yi kimbɛ le fɛwe”</char> <verse eid="MAT 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Kikwɛɛ ki bachiji kintanyɛ yu noo, wu mo wu saayɛ njú ye, wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Wu jode kijusɛ ki Nyo. Bee ka goone muh lɛ wu lɛɛŋ fɛnɛ wu jɛmɛ lɛ la? Bɛŋ le bɛŋ yu wa no wu jode kijusɛ ki Nyo. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Bɛŋ le bɛŋ suunɛ lɛ la?” Bo chvuu lɛ, “Le muh wù ba yuuyɛ lo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Bo mo bo kɛ bo chuuyi nchwene yi bvushi bvu Jiso le, bo kfuunyi wu bɛ muŋko, bo suŋe wu bɛ chiaaŋ bo duu wu le lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>“Wo le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka, gɛh gêe la muh wu ntuŋ wu Nyo kuŋ bee le mɛɛse. Gɛh sɛ̂ɛŋ muh wù suŋ wo.”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bita faŋ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliku 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joŋ 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Gɛ̀ bee Bita shii akfuuŋ fɛ lakfulɛ. Mwa wù kwɛse wumu wù gɛ̀ lɛne fɛ la chiyu le, ja wu to mbebe ye le wu jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Wo tɛ be bee bena Jiso wu Galalee wege.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Geenɛ, Bita faŋ a bamii bachii fwe wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Gɛ ŋkee fiɛɛ fì wo jɛme gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Bita mo wu ja wu bu wu gɛɛŋ wu tu wù nyu jwe wu kitaŋ le. Mwa wù kwɛse wumu wù gɛ̀ lɛne tɛ fo, wu yɛŋ wu le, wu mo wu jɛmɛ bamii ba gɛ̀ lɛme fo le lɛ, “Muh wunɛ bee bɛ Jiso wu Nasalɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Bita ka wu faŋ, wu lejɛ lo wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Gɛ ŋkee muh wuyu gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Lɛ kife kɛŋsɛ shige, bamii ba gɛ̀ lɛme fo kɛŋsɛ bo gɛɛŋ mbebe Bita le bo jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Yi nchiɛɛŋ le, wo le tɛ muh mu bo le, nje njɛmɛ wo gɛɛne njɛ wuboo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Bita mo wu kaŋ, wu tɛɛŋ loŋ yi kikwɛɛ ke le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Gɛ ŋkee muh wunɛ gɛ.” Kimimia nyishii mo yi toŋ. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Bita kwajɛ njɛme wù Jiso be jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nyishii lé yi gê yi toŋ, wo nyu wo faŋ wa mɛ kiŋgane kintɛde.” Wu ja fo wu bu akfuuŋ, wu bee kwe baaŋ.</char><verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Juda shɛɛŋ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliku 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Joŋ 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Akfuuŋ gɛ̀ doo a yuude a too, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ, bo shii bo chu ntaŋ kune Jiso ki bo yuuyɛ wu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Bo mo bo kaaŋ wu, bo jo wu bo gɛɛŋ bo nya chiaaŋ yi Balɛt le wù gɛ̀ bee muh wù sage kimbe kiyu le.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Juda wù gɛ̀ gesɛ Jiso gɛ̀ doo wu yɛŋ lɛ ba le ba suunɛ wa lɛ ba le ba yuuyɛ wu, shɛ́ŋ tu yi sage wu yi fiɛɛ fì wu ge le wu mo wu jo bige bi mbaanshɛ biɛɛ wu kaasɛ wu gɛɛŋ bɛ bi ki wu chvûu bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ le. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Lɛ wu gɛɛŋ, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, “Nle ŋge kimbefɛ ki ŋgesɛ muh wù kɛme gɛ jialɛ gɛ.” Bo chvuu wu le lɛ, “Fifiɛɛ kɛme la ki fi gê bɛ bee? Kee wo fiɛɛ fiyu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Juda bwaŋ bige biyu fɛkuu yeh yi kintanyɛ le, wu mo wu bu, wu gɛɛŋ wu shɛɛŋ. <verse eid="MAT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ tajɛ bige biyu bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Binɛ le bige bi kilɛmɛ, nchi baaŋ bɛɛŋ gɛ lɛ ba gɛɛ binɛ a nchvu wu yeh yi kintanyɛ le gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Bo shii bo chu ntaŋ, bo gɛɛŋ bo gu gwɛŋ wu muh wù maa sháaŋ ki bo jiiyi bantolo fo. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Le fiɛɛ fì ba tɛŋe gwɛŋ wuyu bude abɛŋ lɛ, “Gwɛŋ wu Kilɛmɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Fi gɛ̀ kooshɛ noo lɛ fiɛɛ fì muh wu ntuŋ wu Tada Nyo wù Yɛlimia gɛ̀ jɛmɛ mo fi to fi kojɛ no wu gɛ̀ jɛmɛ lɛ, “Bo gɛ̀ jo bige bi mbaanshɛ bì gɛ̀ bee ŋgesɛ we no booŋ ba Ishwala gɛ̀ kamɛ kikwɛɛ ke le, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>bo gu gwɛŋ wu muh wù maa shíaaŋ le yu, gɛh no Tada Nyo gɛ̀ jɛme mɛne.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso lɛɛŋ a Balɛt fwe muh wù sage bala wu Lum</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliku 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Joŋ 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>No Jiso gɛ̀ lɛme a Balɛt muh wù sage fwe, Balɛt biih wu le lɛ “Le wo wu le Nfoŋ wu Bajuu?” Jiso chvuu lɛ, <char style="wj">“Le no wo jɛme.”</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Geenɛ, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ gɛ̀ doo bo kɛ bo chuunyi mwɛɛ yi wu le, wu gɛ ka wu chvuu lo fiɛɛ gɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Balɛt mo wu biih wu le lɛ, “Gɛ wo yuge kfuu chi mwɛɛ munɛ mù ba chuunyi wo le gɛ?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Geenɛ, Jiso gɛ chvuu lo fiɛɛ wu le mo fimimia fi bo kooyi wu le gɛ. Muh wù sage wuyu bijɛ nɛɛ jwe yuŋ wu baaŋ.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>To nyume kife ki Ŋka wu Ndaŋfe, muh wù sage wunɛ bvusɛ muh wu mumwaa yeh yi ncha le, nyu wu wù bamii goone lɛ wu bvusɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Gɛ̀ bee kife kiyu le, muh mu gɛ̀ bee yeh yi ncha le, ba gɛ̀ kee lo wu yi gee che chì befe le, jee che nyu lɛ Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Bamii gɛ̀ doo bo taashɛ, Balɛt biih bo le lɛ, “Bɛŋ goone lɛ mbvusɛ nyu yɛɛŋ yeh yi ncha le? Bɛŋ goone lɛ mbvusɛ Balaba noo, Jiso wù ba tɛŋe lɛ le Mbvusɛ wù Nyo gɛ̀ ka la?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Wu gɛ̀ biide noo nje wu gɛ̀ kee lo lɛ ba gɛ̀ nya Jiso chiaaŋ ye le, nyu nje bo gɛ̀ bɛɛne kindoŋ bɛ wu. <verse eid="MAT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Fì taade fo le sege wu gɛ̀ shilɛ fɛ ba gɛ̀ sage bansa fo, kwɛɛ tuŋ ntuŋ fɛ wu le wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Keefɛ wo gê fiɛɛ bɛ muh wɛɛ gɛ. Le muh wù chaaŋ. Njɛme nɛ nje kifilɛ le ki njiiŋsɛ bɛ mɛ kintaŋ ki abɛŋ le baaŋ kune wu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>No Balɛt biide noo, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba sage woŋ bɛɛse bamii lɛ bo du lɛ wu bvusɛ nyu Balaba, ba lɛɛshɛ lo Jiso. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Muh wù sage ka wu ja wu biih bo le lɛ, “Muh wù bɛŋ goone lɛ nchinɛ antɛnɛɛ a bamii ba bafɛɛ banɛ le, le wù la?” Bo chvuu lɛ, “Balaba!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Balɛt ka wu biih bo le lɛ, “Nɛ ndoo nchinɛ noo, ŋge nɛɛ bɛ Jiso wù ba tɛŋe lɛ Kletu?” Bo bachii jɛmɛ lɛ, “Ba ta lo wu yi kintaaŋ le.” <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Wu ka wu biih lɛ, “Ba ta wu nje la? Fiɛɛ fì befe fì wu ge le la?” Bo ka bo wanɛ bo gɛɛne gɛh lo fwe fwe lɛ, “Ba ta lo wu yi kintaaŋ le.”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Balɛt gɛ̀ doo wu yɛŋ lɛ gɛ je nyu yu gɛ, lɛ wu luume bɛ fiɛɛ finɛ, jwe ja wu bu. Wu fi joo, wu chugɛ chiaaŋ ye yu a kinchvu ki bamii fwe wu jɛmɛ lɛ, “Gɛ chiaaŋ yaŋ nyu fɛ kwe yi muh wunɛ le gɛ. Kee bɛŋ bɛ fi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Bamii bachii chvuu wu le lɛ, “Ɛɛŋ, chinɛ kilɛmɛ ke nyûme yi bikwɛɛ biɛsa le mo yi booŋ besa le.” <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Balɛt mo wu bvusɛ Balaba no bo gɛ̀ goone, wu jɛmɛ ba taaŋ Jiso, bo mo bo nya lɛ ba gɛɛŋ ba ta yi kintaaŋ le.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamii ba nchi tu bo chwɛɛse Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliku 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joŋ 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Bamii ba nchi ba muh wù sage wɛɛ mo bo jo Jiso bo lee bɛ wu a nto we le fɛ ba gɛ̀ tɛŋe lɛ Bletoliuŋ, bo mo bo kuŋ kimbɛge ki ŋgoo yi bamii ba nchi bachii bo taashɛ bo tuŋkigaŋ bo kɛnɛ Jiso. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Bo baayɛ njú ye, bo jo njú yi bvunfoŋ yì yɛɛde lo bo susɛ ye ye le, <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>bo lu kifo ki bvunfoŋ ki nyu mbiaŋmbiaŋ bo booŋ a wu fwa, bo nya kimbaŋ a kibo ke kinchiɛɛŋ le, lɛ le kitoomi. Bo mo bo too bo ŋgvuume a wù fwe bo chwɛɛse wu bo duu lɛ, “Biaa bimbaaŋ! Nfoŋ Bajuu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>No bo gee noo, bo chuuyi chwɛne ye ye le, bo fii kimbaŋ bo shɛde wu yu a fwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Bo chwɛɛsɛ bo mɛsɛ, bo baa nju yi bvunfoŋ yɛɛ, bo kaasɛ bo jii wa nyu njú ye ye ye le, bo mo bo jo wu bo gɛɛne bɛ wu ki bo gɛɛŋ bo ta yi kintaaŋ le.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba ta Jiso yi kintaaŋ le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliku 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joŋ 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>No bo gɛ̀ gɛɛne, bo bu yi muh mu wu a kilaantɛŋ kì Sɛliŋ le jee che nyu lɛ Samoŋ. Bo tooŋsɛ muh wɛɛ wu tuu kintaaŋ ki Jiso. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Bo gɛɛŋ bo bu kijusɛ kimu ki ba tɛŋe lɛ Golgota, jee chi kijusɛ kinɛ nyu lɛ Ŋgboge wu Kikwɛɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>bo mo bo nya mbvuuŋ ma ba fiiŋsɛ bɛ fiɛɛ fimi fì luji njɛ lele lɛ Jiso mu. Geenɛ wu doo wu moŋ, wu faŋ ki wu mû. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Bo mo bo ta wu yi kintaaŋ le, bo jo njú ye bo tuŋ kaŋ yu ki bo ga bikwɛɛ biboo le. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>No bo ge noo bo mo bo shii fo bo tu bo chiɛɛne wu. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Bo saŋ ŋwa wù duunyi fiɛɛ fì bo ta wu yi kintaaŋ le nje fi, bo mo bo ta yi kintaaŋ le a kikwɛɛ ke we lɛ, “Wunɛ le Jiso, Nfoŋ Bajuu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Bo ta tɛ bachoŋ bafɛɛ yi bintaaŋ le bɛ Jiso, wumu a kibo kinchiɛɛŋ ki Jiso le, wumu a kiŋkoŋo le.<figure style="fig" alt="Jesus on the cross" file="lb00328c.tif" size="span" loc="Mch 27:38" copy="Louis Bass" ref="27:38">Jiso yi kintaaŋ le</figure> <verse eid="MAT 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Bamii tu bo fede bo yɛde Jiso le bo bɛme bɛ bikwɛɛ, bo baade wu bɛ banchuŋ, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>bo duu lɛ, “Wo wù chi bee ki wo sâ yeh yi kintanyɛ wo kaasɛ wo jooŋ yi aju le atade, gɛh fi la kikwɛɛ kuŋ! Nɛ wo fɛnɛ le Mwa Nyo, wo shii la yi kintaaŋ kɛɛ le.” <verse eid="MAT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ bamii ba duunyi banchi mo bamii ba sage woŋ tu bo chwɛɛse tɛ wu bo duu lɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Wu chi fii bamii bamu njɛ taŋlo wu fi kikwɛɛ ke sɛŋ. Gɛ wu nyu Nfoŋ wu bamii ba Ishwala gɛ? Wu shii la yi kintaaŋ le mɛɛse bee mo be bɛɛŋ wu le. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Wu chi gɛɛde kikwɛɛ yi Nyo le. Nɛ Nyo fɛnɛ koŋe wu, wu fi la wu mɛɛse no wu chi duu lɛ wu le Mwa Nyo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Bachoŋ baa tɛ ba bo gɛ̀ ta yi bintaaŋ le bɛ Jiso, bo tu bo baade tɛ wu bɛ banchuŋ gɛh noo.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso kwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliku 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joŋ 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Juu gɛ̀ bɛɛŋ chi leesɛ, akfuuŋ ja ajiiŋ woŋ wuchii gɛɛne bude juu bikaa bitɛde fɛnshɛ. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Lɛ nyu njɛ juu bikaa bitɛde, Jiso ja wu jaŋ fɛwɛɛwe lɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛli, Ɛli, lama sabatani.</char>” Fì le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Nyo waŋ, Nyo waŋ, wo noŋ mɛ nɛ nje la?”</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Bamii bamu ba gɛ̀ lɛme fo doo bo yu, bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Muh wuyu tɛŋe Alaja.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Muh mu bo le mo wu legɛ lo kimimia wu jo kfusha, wu fuuŋ a mbvuuŋ ma ŋgbwamɛ le, wu booŋ yi finte le wu chiaasɛ lɛ wu mu. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Geenɛ bamii bamu jɛmɛ lɛ “Gɛh lɛɛŋ nɛ, besabɛŋ yɛŋ laa Alaja le wu to wu fi wu la.”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Jiso ka wu waŋ fɛwɛɛwe, wu mo wu nya kiyo ke Nyo le. <verse eid="MAT 27:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Fi ja fi kooshɛ lɛ, nju yì gɛ̀ gade yeh yi kintanyɛ antɛŋ gɛ̀ badɛ antɛnɛɛ kɛge fɛwe boge bude fɛkuu bimbe bifɛɛ. Nshɛŋ shiŋshɛ, ata baajɛ, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>jɛ́ŋ tɛ gwenyɛ bamii ba gɛ̀ bee ba Nyo ba duude ba gɛ̀ kweeyɛ wa mo bo kaasɛ bo bu yi kwe le. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Jiso gɛ̀ doo wu bu yi kwe le, bamii bayu ja bo gɛɛŋ a kilaantɛŋ kì yuude le Yɛlusalɛm, bamii wesee yɛŋ bo le. <verse eid="MAT 27:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Chiji kikwɛɛ ki bamii ba nchi bɛ bamii ba bɛ bo gɛ̀ bee fo bo chiɛɛne Jiso, gɛ̀ doo bo yɛŋ no nshɛŋ shiŋshɛ, bɛ fiɛɛ fì kooshi le, nfaaŋ koo bo baaŋ. Bo jɛmɛ lɛ, “Yi nchiɛɛŋ nchiɛɛŋ le, muh wunɛ chi bee Mwa Nyo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Bikɛse ba duude gɛ̀ lɛme tɛ fo je yì ndefe le bo jiiŋe. Bikɛse banɛ le ba gɛ̀ ja Galalee bo bii Jiso le bo fii wu. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Ŋgoo yiboo gɛ̀ bee Mɛɛle Madaleŋ mo Mɛɛle wù bwe Jɛm bɛ Yosɛf, mo bwe booŋ ba Jɛbɛdi.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba jiiyɛ Jiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliku 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joŋ 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Lɛ nyu fɛnfu, muh wu kwa wumu wu Alimatia ja wu to, jee che nyu lɛ Yosɛf. Wu tɛ gɛ̀ bee muh wu ŋgoo yi Jiso le. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Wu gɛɛŋ wu yɛŋ Balɛt le wu lɛgɛ lɛ wu nyâ gvunɛ chi Jiso wu le wu gɛ̂ɛŋ wu jîiyɛ. Noo, Balɛt mo wu jɛmɛ lɛ bo gɛ̂ɛŋ bo nyâ wu le. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yosɛf fi gvunɛ chiyu wu kujɛ a nju yì yuude le, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>wu mo wu gɛɛŋ wu giŋsɛ a jɛŋ ye yì baaŋ yifiɛŋ le. Wu gɛ̀ cho jɛŋ yiyu yi kimbaaŋ le, wu mo wu biŋsɛ kibwee ki tɛdɛ wu baŋɛ jwe wu jɛŋ yɛɛ yu, wu mo wu ja. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Mɛɛle Madaleŋ bɛ Mɛɛle wumu wɛɛ gɛ̀ bee fo, bo shii mbebe jɛŋ yiyu le, kimbe kege le.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bo tu bo chiɛɛne jɛŋ yi Jiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Akfuuŋ bu ayuu, juu chi bo to bo seese mwɛɛ mu yuuŋ chiboo gɛ̀ fe wa, bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ bɛ Bafalashii gɛɛŋ bo yɛŋ Balɛt le, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>bo jɛmɛ wu le lɛ, “Muh wù baaŋ, bee be kwaji fiɛɛ fì muh wu chimbiaŋ wɛɛ gɛ̀ jɛme sege wu gɛ̀ baaŋ yu. Wu gɛ̀ bee wu jɛmɛ lɛ, le to bu aju atade wu kaasɛ wu bu yi kwe le. <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>No fi le noo, wo du bamii gɛɛŋ bo chîɛɛne jɛŋ yɛɛ gɛɛŋ bu aju atade, nje bee faane lɛ taŋlo booŋ be ba ŋgoo bo ja bo gɛɛŋ bo choŋ gvunɛ che bo ja bɛ chi bo mo bo sɛŋe bamii le lɛ, ‘Wu le wu bu yi kwe le.’ Nɛ bo ge noo, chimbiaŋ chi mɛɛse chinɛ mo chi fo chi fe lo chi fwe.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Balɛt du bo le lɛ, “Bɛŋ jô bamii ba nchi bena bo gɛɛŋ, bɛŋ du bo chiɛɛne jɛŋ yɛɛ chuule no taŋlo bo chiɛɛne.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Noo bo mo bo gɛɛŋ bo baŋɛ jwe wu jɛŋ yiyu chuule bo gɛɛ njiŋɛ yi tɛdɛ chì bo gɛ̀ baŋɛ jwe wu jɛŋ yɛɛ yu, bo mo bo gɛɛ bamii ba nchi bo chîɛɛne.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:66 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Njiŋɛ wunɛ gɛ̀ bee ki bo ge lɛ keefɛ muh fe lo fo gɛ.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Jiso bu yi kwe le</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliku 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joŋ 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Juu chi yuuŋ gɛ̀ fe, akfuuŋ yuude atoo, nyu juu chi fwe yi kimaa le, Mɛɛle Madaleŋ bɛ Mɛɛle wumu wɛɛ gɛɛŋ ki bo bijɛ jɛŋ. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Fi kooshɛ lɛ, nshɛŋ gɛ̀ be yi ja yi shiŋshɛ bɛ bvuŋga, nje nchɛndaa Tada gɛ̀ shii we wu to wu biŋsɛ kibwee ki tɛdɛ chiɛɛ chì ba gɛ̀ baŋɛ jwe wu jɛŋ yɛɛ yu wu mo wu shii yu. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Nchɛndaa wuyu le bvushi bwe gɛ̀ lale njɛ jaŋ, njú ye baaŋ nɛ bvuuu. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Bamii ba gɛ̀ chiɛɛne jɛŋ baa yɛŋ wu le bo faaŋ baaŋ, bo koge nɛ kikikiki, bo gweeyɛ fɛkuu bo leefɛ njɛ biŋkwe bi bamii. <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Nchɛndaa wu Nyo wuyu jɛmɛ bikɛse baa le lɛ, “Keefɛ bɛŋ fâane gɛ. Ŋkee lo lɛ bɛŋ goone nyu Jiso wù ba chi ta yi kintaaŋ le. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Gɛ wu baaŋ fɛnɛ gɛ, wu le wu bu wa yi kwe le, no wu gɛ̀ jɛme. Bɛŋ to bɛŋ yɛŋ fɛ wu chi gime fo. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Bɛŋ mo bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ chige bɛŋ sɛɛŋ booŋ be ba ŋgoo le lɛ wu le wu bu wa yi kwe le, lɛ wu le wu sa wa bɛŋ fwe Galalee. Bɛŋ lé bɛŋ yɛ̂ŋ wu le yo. Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, bɛŋ le bɛŋ yu wa no nsɛŋe bɛŋ le.” <verse eid="MAT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Bikɛse baa mo bo ja fɛ jɛŋ chige chige bɛ nfaaŋ, geenɛ bo kɛme tɛ njoŋ wù baaŋ, bo tu bo lege bo gɛɛne ki bo gɛɛŋ bo sɛɛŋ booŋ ba Jiso ba ŋgoo le. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>No bo gɛ̀ gɛɛne, fi kooshɛ lɛ bɛ ba Jiso gɛ̀ tasɛ, wu jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“N'yɛɛse bɛŋ le.”</char> Bo mo bo to mbebe ye le, bo gwe bo kfugɛ bikaa bie, bo ŋgvuuŋ wu. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Jiso jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Keefɛ bɛŋ fâane gɛ. Bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ bɛŋ dû booŋ ba bwɛɛŋ le lɛ bo gɛ̂ɛne Galalee bo lé bo yɛ̂ŋ mɛne yo.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bamii bo gɛ̀ chiɛɛne jɛŋ sɛɛŋ fiɛɛ fì gɛ kooshɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Sege bikɛse baa gɛ̀ ja bo doo bo gɛɛne, fi kooshɛ lɛ bamii ba nchi ba gɛ̀ chiɛɛne jɛŋ bamu gɛ̀ ja bo gɛɛne alaantɛŋ bo gɛɛŋ bo sɛɛŋ fiɛɛ fichii fì kooshi bachiji kintanyɛ ba baaŋ baaŋ le. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Bachiji kintanyɛ bayu mo bo kuŋ bamii ba sage woŋ bɛ bo shii bo chu ntaŋ, bo mo bo baŋɛ jwe wu bamii ba nchi baa bɛ bige bì duude, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>bo jɛmɛ bo le lɛ, “Bɛŋ sɛ̂ŋe bamii le lɛ bɛŋ chi lefe lo booŋ be ba ŋgoo to bo choŋ gvunɛ che bo gɛɛŋ bɛ chi. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Nɛ bɛŋ sɛŋe noo, fi lee bintuŋ bi muh wù sage le, wu nɛ goone ki wu nyâ bɛŋ ŋgɛ le, bee seesɛ bɛ wu, wu gɛ ka wu nya bɛŋ ŋgɛ gɛ.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Noo bo mo bo fi bige biyu bo tu bo sɛŋe gɛh no ba be jɛmɛ bo le. Kinfɛ kiyu kinɛ mo ki laaŋ antɛnɛɛ a Bajuu too bude abɛŋ lɛ ba gɛ̀ choŋ lo gvunɛ chi Jiso.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jiso tuŋ bamii be yi woŋ le wuchii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliku 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joŋ 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Lɛme 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Booŋ ba ŋgoo ba Jiso ba yuufe ncho wu mumwaa mo bo ja bo gɛɛŋ Galalee, bo bɛɛŋ bo gɛɛŋ yi mbegɛ wù Jiso gɛ̀ jɛmɛ bo le. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Bo doo bo yɛŋ wu le, bo ŋgvuuŋ wu. Geenɛ bamu tu bo maŋe wu. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Jiso ja wu kɛŋsɛ wu to wu du bo le lɛ, <char style="wj">“Chii le wu nya wa bvuŋga bvuchii bvu fɛwe mo bvu fɛkuu mɛne.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/><char style="wj">Noo, bɛŋ gɛ̂ɛŋ woŋ le wuchii, bɛŋ gêe bamii nyu bamii baŋ ba ŋgoo, bɛŋ lêese bo a joo a jee chi Nyo wu Chii le, bɛ chi Mwa mo a chi Kiyo ki Yuude le.</char> <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/><char style="wj">Bɛŋ yɛ̂yi bo lɛ bo gêe fiɛɛ fichii fì nle n'yɛyɛ bɛŋ yu. Bɛŋ yêgɛ bɛŋ yû, nlé nyûme besabɛŋ segechii gɛɛne bude kife kì woŋ lé wu gê wu ka.”</char><verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
